ilot CLI e SDK","Execução isolada em Docker","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores","Aprendizado prático com o r3f","Integração com o Docker"],"ru":["Площадка для изучения Copilot CLI и SDK","Запуск в изоляции в Docker","Лучшие практики для разработчиков","Практическое обучение с помощью r3f","Интеграция с Docker"],"ar":["بيئة اختبار لتعلم تشغيل Copilot CLI و SDK","تشغيل منعزل في Docker","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","تعلم عملي مع r3f","التكامل مع Docker"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Copilot CLI","什么是Copilot SDK","Docker开发最佳实践","Copilot CLI安装","Copilot SDK设置指南","AI智能工具","r3f最佳实践","Docker开发"],"ja":["Copilot CLIの使用方法","Copilot SDKとは","Docker開発のベストプラクティス","Copilot CLIのインストール","Copilot SDKの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","r3fベストプラクティス","Docker開発"],"ko":["Copilot CLI를 사용하는 방법","Copilot SDK란","Docker 개발의 최적의 실践","Copilot CLI 설치","Copilot SDK 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","r3f 최적의 실践","Docker 개발"],"es":["herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","cómo usar Copilot","qué es r3f","r3f vs Copilot","instalación de r3f","guía de configuración de Copilot","mejores prácticas para r3f","desarrollo de aplicaciones con React y Node.js"],"fr":["outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","comment utiliser Copilot","quoi est r3f","r3f vs Copilot","installation de r3f","guide de configuration de Copilot","meilleures pratiques pour r3f","développement d''applications avec React et Node.js"],"de":["KI-Tools","wie man Copilot verwendet","was ist r3f","r3f vs Copilot","Installation von r3f","Konfigurationsanleitung für Copilot","Best Practices für r3f","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["como usar r3f","o que é r3f","r3f vs copilot","instalar r3f","guia de configuração do r3f","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de ia"],"ru":["как использовать r3f","что такое r3f","r3f vs copilot","установить r3f","руководство по настройке r3f","лучшие практики разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام r3f","ما هو r3f","r3f مقابل copilot","تثبيت r3f","دليل إعداد r3f","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الإصطناعي"]}},"owner":"deadronos","repo":"copilot-chat-playground","repoPath":"deadronos/copilot-chat-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.747Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"r3f-best-practices","description":"React Three Fiber (R3F) and Poimandres ecosystem best practices. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing R3F code. Triggers on tasks involving @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, zustand, @react-three/postprocessing, @react-three/rapier, or leva.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@r","body":"# React Three Fiber Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for React Three Fiber and the Poimandres ecosystem. Contains 60+ rules across 11 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new R3F components\n- Optimizing R3F performance (re-renders are the #1 issue)\n- Using Drei helpers correctly\n- Managing state with Zustand\n- Implementing post-processing or physics\n\n## Ecosystem Coverage\n\n- **@react-three/fiber** - React renderer for Three.js\n- **@react-three/drei** - Useful helpers and abstractions\n- **@react-three/postprocessing** - Post-processing effects\n- **@react-three/rapier** - Physics engine\n- **zustand** - State management\n- **leva** - Debug GUI\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Performance & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `perf-` |\n| 2 | useFrame & Animation | CRITICAL | `frame-` |\n| 3 | Component Patterns | HIGH | `component-` |\n| 4 | Canvas & Setup | HIGH | `canvas-` |\n| 5 | Drei Helpers | MEDIUM-HIGH | `drei-` |\n| 6 | Loading & Suspense | MEDIUM-HIGH | `loading-` |\n| 7 | State Management | MEDIUM | `state-` |\n| 8 | Events & Interaction | MEDIUM | `events-` |\n| 9 | Post-processing | MEDIUM | `postpro-` |\n| 10 | Physics (Rapier) | LOW-MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 11 | Leva (Debug GUI) | LOW | `leva-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Performance & Re-renders (CRITICAL)\n\n- `perf-never-set-state-in-useframe` - NEVER call setState in useFrame\n- `perf-isolate-state` - Isolate components that need React state\n- `perf-zustand-selectors` - Use Zustand selectors, not entire store\n- `perf-transient-subscriptions` - Use transient subscriptions for continuous values\n- `perf-memo-components` - Memoize expensive components\n- `perf-keys-for-lists` - Use stable keys for dynamic lists\n- `perf-avoid-inline-objects` - Avoid creating objects/arrays in JSX\n- `perf-dispose-auto` - Understand R3F auto-dispose behavior\n\n### 2. useFrame & Animation (CRITICAL)\n\n- `frame-priority` - Use priority for execution order\n- `frame-delta-time` - Always use delta for animations\n- `frame-conditional-subscription` - Disable useFrame when not needed\n- `frame-destructure-state` - Destructure only what you need\n- `frame-render-on-demand` - Use invalidate() for on-demand rendering\n- `frame-avoid-heavy-computation` - Move heavy work outside useFrame\n\n### 3. Component Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `component-jsx-elements` - Use JSX for Three.js objects\n- `component-attach-prop` - Use attach for non-standard properties\n- `component-primitive` - Use primitive for existing objects\n- `component-extend` - Use extend() for custom classes\n- `component-forwardref` - Use forwardRef for reusable components\n- `component-dispose-null` - Set dispose={null} on shared resources\n\n### 4. Canvas & Setup (HIGH)\n\n- `canvas-size-container` - Canvas fills parent container\n- `canvas-camera-default` - Configure camera via prop\n- `canvas-gl-config` - Configure WebGL context\n- `canvas-shadows` - Enable shadows at Canvas level\n- `canvas-frameloop` - Choose appropriate frameloop mode\n- `canvas-events` - Configure event handling\n- `canvas-linear-flat` - Use linear/flat for correct colors\n\n### 5. Drei Helpers (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `drei-use-gltf` - useGLTF with preloading\n- `drei-use-texture` - useTexture for texture loading\n- `drei-environment` - Environment for realistic lighting\n- `drei-orbit-controls` - OrbitControls from Drei\n- `drei-html` - Html for DOM overlays\n- `drei-text` - Text for 3D text\n- `drei-instances` - Instances for optimized instancing\n- `drei-use-helper` - useHelper for debug visualization\n- `drei-bounds` - Bounds to fit camera\n- `drei-center` - Center to center objects\n- `drei-float` - Float for floating animation\n\n### 6. Loading & Suspense (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `loading-suspense` - Wrap async components in Suspense\n- `loading-preload` - Preload assets with useGLTF.preload\n- `loading-use-progress` - useProgress for loading UI\n- `loading-lazy-components` - Lazy load heavy components\n- `loading-error-boundary` - Handle loading errors\n\n### 7. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-zustand-store` - Create focused Zustand stores\n- `state-avoid-objects-in-store` - Be careful with Three.js objects\n- `state-subscribeWithSelector` - Fine-grained subscriptions\n- `state-persist` - Persist state when needed\n- `state-separate-concerns` - Separate stores by concern\n\n### 8. Events & Interaction (MEDIUM)\n\n- `events-pointer-events` - Use pointer events on meshes\n- `events-stop-propagation` - Prevent event bubbling\n- `events-cursor-pointer` - Change cursor on hover\n- `events-raycast-filter` - Filter raycasting\n- `events-event-data` - Understand event data structure\n\n### 9. Post-processing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `postpro-effect-composer` - Use EffectComposer\n- `postpro-common-effects` - Common effects reference\n- `postpro-selective-bloom` - SelectiveBloom for optimized glow\n- `postpro-custom-shader` - Create custom effects\n- `postpro-performance` - Optimize post-processing\n\n### 10. Physics Rapier (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-setup` - Basic Rapier setup\n- `physics-body-types` - dynamic, fixed, kinematic\n- `physics-colliders` - Choose appropriate colliders\n- `physics-events` - Handle collision events\n- `physics-api-ref` - Use ref for physics API\n- `physics-performance` - Optimize physics\n\n### 11. Leva (LOW)\n\n- `leva-basic` - Basic Leva usage\n- `leva-folders` - Organize with folders\n- `leva-conditional` - Hide in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/perf-never-set-state-in-useframe.md\nrules/drei-use-gltf.md\nrules/state-zustand-selectors.md\n```\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `../R3F_BEST_PRACTICES.md`\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### NEVER setState in useFrame\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - 60 re-renders per second!\nfunction BadComponent() {\n  const [position, setPosition] = useState(0);\n  useFrame(() => {\n    setPosition(p => p + 0.01); // NEVER DO THIS\n  });\n  return <mesh position-x={position} />;\n}\n\n// GOOD - Mutate refs directly\nfunction GoodComponent() {\n  const meshRef = useRef();\n  useFrame(() => {\n    meshRef.current.position.x += 0.01;\n  });\n  return <mesh ref={meshRef} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Zustand Selectors\n\n```jsx\n// BAD - Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useGameStore();\n\n// GOOD - Only re-renders when playerX changes\nconst playerX = useGameStore(state => state.playerX);\n\n// BETTER - No re-renders, direct mutation\nuseFrame(() => {\n  const { value } = useStore.getState();\n  ref.current.position.x = value;\n});\n```\n\n### Drei useGLTF\n\n```jsx\nimport { useGLTF } from ''@react-three/drei'';\n\nfunction Model() {\n  const { scene } = useGLTF(''/model.glb'');\n  return <primitive object={scene} />;\n}\n\n// Preload for instant loading\nuseGLTF.preload(''/model.glb'');\n```\n\n### Suspense Loading\n\n```jsx\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Suspense fallback={<Loader />}>\n        <Model />\n      </Suspense>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T10:45:42.209Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced 3D visualization capabilities with React Three Fiber","zh":"非常适合需要高级 3D 可视化能力的前端代理，特别是使用 React Three Fiber","ja":"React Three Fiber を使用するフロントエンド エージェントが高度な 3D ビジュアライゼーション機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"React Three Fiber를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트가 고급 3D 시각화 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de visualización 3D avanzadas con React Three Fiber","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation 3D avancées avec React Three Fiber","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte 3D-Visualisierungsfunktionen mit React Three Fiber benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de visualização 3D avançadas com React Three Fiber","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются расширенные возможности 3D-визуализации с React Three Fiber","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности مرئية متقدمة 3D مع React Three Fiber"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Three Fiber performance, utilize Drei helpers correctly, and manage state with Zustand, while implementing post-processing or physics, all within the Poimandres ecosystem using @react-three/fiber and @react-three/drei libraries","zh":"赋予代理优化 React Three Fiber 性能、正确使用 Drei 辅助工具、使用 Zustand 管理状态，并在 Poimandres 生态系统中使用 @react-three/fiber 和 @react-three/drei 库实现后处理或物理","ja":"React Three Fiber のパフォーマンスを最適化し、Drei ヘルパーを正しく使用し、Zustand を使用して状態を管理し、Poimandres エコシステム内で @react-three/fiber と @react-three/drei ライブラリを使用してポスト処理または物理を実装できる","ko":"에이전트가 React Three Fiber 성능을 최적화하고 Drei 헬퍼를 올바르게 사용하며 Zustand를 사용하여 상태를 관리하고 Poimandres 생태계에서 @react-three/fiber 및 @react-three/drei 라이브러리를 사용하여 후처리 또는 물리 구현을 하는 것을 가능하게 함","es":"Empodera a los agentes para optimizar el rendimiento de React Three Fiber, utilizar ayudantes de Drei correctamente y gestionar el estado con Zustand, mientras implementa el procesamiento posterior o la física, todo dentro del ecosistema de Poimandres utilizando las bibliotecas @react-three/fiber y @react-three/drei","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour optimiser les performances de React Three Fiber, utiliser correctement les aides de Drei et gérer l''état avec Zustand, tout en implémentant le post-traitement ou la physique, le tout dans l''écosystème de Poimandres en utilisant les bibliothèques @react-three/fiber et @react-three/drei","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Leistung von React Three Fiber zu optimieren, Drei-Helfer richtig zu nutzen und den Zustand mit Zustand zu verwalten, während sie das Nachbearbeiten oder die Physik implementieren, all dies innerhalb des Poimandres-Ökosystems unter Verwendung der Bibliotheken @react-three/fiber und @react-three/drei","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React Three Fiber, utilizar os ajudantes Drei corretamente e gerenciar o estado com Zustand, enquanto implementa o pós-processamento ou física, tudo dentro do ecossistema Poimandres usando as bibliotecas @react-three/fiber e @react-three/drei","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность React Three Fiber, правильно использовать помощников Drei и управлять состоянием с помощью Zustand, а также реализовывать постобработку или физику, все в рамках экосистемы Poimandres с использованием библиотек @react-three/fiber и @react-three/drei","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين أداء React Three Fiber، واستخدام مساعدي Drei بشكل صحيح، وإدارة الحالة مع Zustand، أثناء تنفيذ المعالجة اللاحقة أو الفيزياء، كل ذلك داخل نظام بيومندريس باستخدام مكتبات @react-three/fiber و @react-three/drei"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing R3F component re-renders for better performance","Implementing post-processing effects in 3D scenes","Managing complex state with Zustand in R3F applications"],"zh":["优化 R3F 组件重新渲染以获得更好的性能","在 3D 场景中实现后处理效果","在 R3F 应用程序中使用 Zustand 管理复杂状态"],"ja":["R3F コンポーネントの再描画を最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる","3D シーンにポスト処理効果を実装する","R3F アプリケーションで Zustand を使用して複雑な状態を管理する"],"ko":["R3F 컴포넌트重新 렌더링을 최적화하여 성능을 개선","3D 씬에서 후처리 효과를 구현","R3F 응용 프로그램에서 Zustand를 사용하여 복잡한 상태를 관리"],"es":["Optimizar las re-rendiciones de componentes R3F para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar efectos de post-procesamiento en escenas 3D","Gestionar estados complejos con Zustand en aplicaciones R3F"],"fr":["Optimiser les ré-rendus de composants R3F pour de meilleures performances","Implémenter des effets de post-traitement dans des scènes 3D","Gérer des états complexes avec Zustand dans des applications R3F"],"de":["Optimieren der R3F-Komponenten-Neuzeichnungen für eine bessere Leistung","Implementieren von Nachbearbeitungseffekten in 3D-Szenen","Verwalten komplexer Zustände mit Zustand in R3F-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Otimizar a re-renderização de componentes R3F para melhor desempenho","Implementar efeitos de pós-processamento em cenas 3D","Gerenciar estados complexos com Zustand em aplicações R3F"],"ru":["Оптимизировать повторную отрисовку компонентов R3F для лучшей производительности","Реализовывать эффекты постобработки в 3D-сценах","Управлять сложными состояниями с помощью Zustand в приложениях R3F"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة عرض مكونات R3F للحصول على أداء أفضل","تنفيذ تأثيرات المعالجة اللاحقة في مشاهد 3D","إدارة حالات معقدة مع Zustand في تطبيقات R3F"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Three.js","Limited to React Three Fiber ecosystem"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Three.js","仅限 React Three Fiber 生态系统"],"ja":["React と Three.js の知識が必要","React Three Fiber エコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Three.js에 대한 지식이 필요","React Three Fiber 생태계에 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Three.js","Limitado al ecosistema de React Three Fiber"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Three.js","Limité à l''écosystème de React Three Fiber"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Three.js","Begrenzt auf das React Three Fiber-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React e Three.js","Limitado ao ecossistema React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Three.js","Ограничен экосистемой React Three Fiber"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Three.js","محدود بنظام React Three Fiber"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4782e1666bd52b07a958a83671af91c66a54313cdd7e61269bff0ebc6772dad7","qualityScore":39}');
