y, OTel 통합","Docker Compose 사용하여 배포","Production 환경 지원","Cloudflare AI 에이전트 지원"],"es":["Producción Docker Compose stack","Integración con Hetzner VPS","Seguridad con RollHook y Valkey","Monitoreo con OTel","Balanceo de carga con Traefik"],"fr":["Stack de production Docker Compose","Intégration avec Hetzner VPS","Sécurité avec RollHook et Valkey","Surveillance avec OTel","Équilibrage de charge avec Traefik"],"de":["Produktions-Docker-Compose-Stack","Integration mit Hetzner VPS","Sicherheit mit RollHook und Valkey","Überwachung mit OTel","Lastverteilung mit Traefik"],"pt":["Integração com Docker Compose","Suporte a Traefik e Postgres","Segurança e desempenho para aplicações web","Valkey e OTel para monitoramento","RollHook para atualizações automatizadas"],"ru":["Интеграция с Docker Compose","Поддержка Traefik и Postgres","Безопасность и производительность для веб-приложений","Valkey и OTel для мониторинга","RollHook для автоматических обновлений"],"ar":["التكامل مع Docker Compose","دعم Traefik و Postgres","أمان وأداء لتطبيقات الوب","Valkey و OTel لمراقبة","RollHook لتحديثات تلقائية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare AIエージェント","Docker Compose","Hetzner VPS","RollHook","Traefik","Postgres","Valkey","OTel","Production环境","Cloudflare AIエージェント安装"],"ja":["Cloudflare AIエージェント","Docker Compose","Hetzner VPS","RollHook","Traefik","Postgres","Valkey","OTel","Production環境","Cloudflare AIエージェント設定"],"ko":["Cloudflare AI 에이전트","Docker Compose","Hetzner VPS","RollHook","Traefik","Postgres","Valkey","OTel","Production 환경","Cloudflare AI 에이전트 설치"],"es":["cómo usar Cloudflare","qué es Cloudflare","Cloudflare alternativa","Cloudflare vs AWS","instalación de Cloudflare","guía de configuración de Cloudflare"],"fr":["comment utiliser Cloudflare","qu''est-ce que Cloudflare","alternative à Cloudflare","Cloudflare vs AWS","installation de Cloudflare","guide de configuration de Cloudflare"],"de":["wie man Cloudflare verwendet","was ist Cloudflare","Cloudflare-Alternative","Cloudflare vs AWS","Installation von Cloudflare","Konfigurationsanleitung für Cloudflare"],"pt":["como usar cloudflare","cloudflare vs akamai","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","docker compose cloudflare","traefik e cloudflare","postgres e cloudflare","valkey e otel","rollhook e cloudflare","guias de instalação cloudflare"],"ru":["как использовать cloudflare","cloudflare vs akamai","инструменты ии для разработчиков","docker compose cloudflare","traefik и cloudflare","postgres и cloudflare","valkey и otel","rollhook и cloudflare","руководства по установке cloudflare"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام cloudflare","cloudflare vs akamai","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","docker compose cloudflare","traefik و cloudflare","postgres و cloudflare","valkey و otel","rollhook و cloudflare","دليل تثبيت cloudflare"]}},"owner":"jkrumm","repo":"hetzner-vps","repoPath":"jkrumm/hetzner-vps","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T21:35:05Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare","description":"Cloudflare API operations for the VPS — DNS records, tunnel ingress config, multi-domain and multi-zone support. Never exposes the API token to Claude Code directly.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare API Skill\n\nHandle any Cloudflare DNS or tunnel operation for VPS-hosted apps.\n\n**Execution model:** All API calls run on the VPS via `ssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''...''\"''\"''''`. The API token (`CF_API_TOKEN`) stays in Doppler — never passed as a CLI argument, never visible to Claude Code, never logged.\n\n---\n\n## Infrastructure Context\n\n### VPS Tunnel\n\nThe VPS has a single Cloudflare Tunnel. Its ID is stored in Doppler as `CF_TUNNEL_ID`.\n\n**Current tun","body":"# Cloudflare API Skill\n\nHandle any Cloudflare DNS or tunnel operation for VPS-hosted apps.\n\n**Execution model:** All API calls run on the VPS via `ssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''...''\"''\"''''`. The API token (`CF_API_TOKEN`) stays in Doppler — never passed as a CLI argument, never visible to Claude Code, never logged.\n\n---\n\n## Infrastructure Context\n\n### VPS Tunnel\n\nThe VPS has a single Cloudflare Tunnel. Its ID is stored in Doppler as `CF_TUNNEL_ID`.\n\n**Current tunnel IDs visible in jkrumm.com DNS:**\n- `13f91961-...` — VPS (this server)\n- `f270cecf-...` — HomeLab\n- `b99c010f-...` — other server\n\n**Wildcard ingress rule:** `*.DOMAIN → https://traefik:443` (TLS verify: off)\n- Set once after provisioning\n- Catches all subdomains that have a CNAME DNS record pointing to this tunnel\n- Does NOT affect other Cloudflare tunnels — each tunnel evaluates its own ingress rules independently\n\n**To reach a new app publicly:**\n1. Add a DNS CNAME record pointing the subdomain to `${CF_TUNNEL_ID}.cfargotunnel.com`\n2. The wildcard ingress rule already routes it to Traefik\n3. Traefik routes based on the `Host()` label on the container\n\n### Doppler Secrets (project: vps, config: prod)\n\n| Secret | What it is |\n|-|-|\n| `CF_API_TOKEN` | API token — Zone:Read + DNS:Edit (all zones) + Tunnel:Edit (all accounts). Passed to Traefik as `CF_DNS_API_TOKEN` (lego requires that name) |\n| `CF_ACCOUNT_ID` | Cloudflare account ID (same for all zones/tunnels) |\n| `CF_ZONE_ID` | Zone ID for `DOMAIN` (jkrumm.com) |\n| `CF_TUNNEL_ID` | UUID of the VPS Cloudflare Tunnel |\n| `DOMAIN` | Primary domain |\n\n### Multi-Domain / Multi-Zone Support\n\nDomains accessible with this token: `basalt-ui.com`, `jkrumm.com`, `rollhook.com`, `shutterflow.app`. For any domain not stored as `CF_ZONE_ID`, look up its zone ID first (see below).\n\n---\n\n## Authentication Pattern\n\nUse single-quote wrapping so `${VARS}` are expanded by the VPS shell after doppler injects them:\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''\n  curl -s \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" \\\n    | python3 -m json.tool\n''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n**Why:** Double-quote SSH commands cause the local shell to expand `${CF_API_TOKEN}` before it reaches the VPS (producing empty string and an auth error). The `''...'' ''\"''\"'' ''...''` pattern passes the inner string literally to the VPS where doppler has already injected the secrets.\n\n---\n\n## Common Operations\n\n### List all zones\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin); [print(z[\\\"name\\\"],z[\\\"id\\\"]) for z in r[\\\"result\\\"]] if r[\\\"success\\\"] else print(\\\"ERR:\\\",r[\\\"errors\\\"])\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n### Check current tunnel ingress config\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/${CF_ACCOUNT_ID}/cfd_tunnel/${CF_TUNNEL_ID}/configurations\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin); [print(i.get(\\\"hostname\\\",\\\"catch-all\\\"),\\\"→\\\",i[\\\"service\\\"]) for i in r[\\\"result\\\"][\\\"config\\\"][\\\"ingress\\\"]] if r[\\\"success\\\"] else print(\\\"ERR:\\\",r[\\\"errors\\\"])\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n### List DNS records for a zone\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones/${CF_ZONE_ID}/dns_records?per_page=100\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin); [print(rec[\\\"type\\\"],rec[\\\"name\\\"],\\\"→\\\",rec[\\\"content\\\"]) for rec in r[\\\"result\\\"]] if r[\\\"success\\\"] else print(\\\"ERR:\\\",r[\\\"errors\\\"])\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n### Add a DNS CNAME record (new app subdomain on primary domain)\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s -X POST \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones/${CF_ZONE_ID}/dns_records\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" --data \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"CNAME\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SUBDOMAIN\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"${CF_TUNNEL_ID}.cfargotunnel.com\\\",\\\"proxied\\\":true}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin); print(\\\"OK:\\\",r[\\\"result\\\"][\\\"name\\\"]) if r[\\\"success\\\"] else print(\\\"ERR:\\\",r[\\\"errors\\\"])\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\nReplace `SUBDOMAIN` with the actual subdomain before running.\n\n### Delete a DNS record\n\nFirst list records to find the ID, then:\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s -X DELETE \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones/${CF_ZONE_ID}/dns_records/RECORD_ID\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin); print(\\\"OK\\\" if r[\\\"success\\\"] else r[\\\"errors\\\"])\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n### Look up Zone ID for a secondary domain\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones?name=other-domain.com\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin)[\\\"result\\\"]; print(r[0][\\\"id\\\"],r[0][\\\"name\\\"]) if r else print(\\\"not found\\\")\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n### Set/update wildcard tunnel ingress rule\n\n```bash\nssh vps ''doppler run --project vps --config prod -- bash -c ''\"''\"''curl -s -X PUT \"https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/${CF_ACCOUNT_ID}/cfd_tunnel/${CF_TUNNEL_ID}/configurations\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${CF_API_TOKEN}\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" --data \"{\\\"config\\\":{\\\"ingress\\\":[{\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"*.${DOMAIN}\\\",\\\"service\\\":\\\"https://traefik:443\\\",\\\"originRequest\\\":{\\\"noTLSVerify\\\":true}},{\\\"service\\\":\\\"http_status:404\\\"}]}}\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; r=json.load(sys.stdin); print(\\\"OK — version\\\",r[\\\"result\\\"][\\\"version\\\"]) if r[\\\"success\\\"] else print(\\\"ERR:\\\",r[\\\"errors\\\"])\"''\"''\"''''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow: Add a New Public App\n\n1. Deploy the app compose to VPS (confirm running: `make ps`)\n2. Add DNS CNAME record (subdomain → VPS tunnel)\n3. Verify: `curl -I https://myapp.<DOMAIN>/health`\n4. No tunnel config changes needed — wildcard ingress already catches it\n\n## Workflow: Add App on a Secondary Domain\n\n1. Look up the zone ID for the secondary domain\n2. Use it directly in the curl call — zone IDs are not secret (visible in the Cloudflare dashboard)\n3. If the secondary domain isn''t covered by the wildcard ingress, add a specific hostname rule to the tunnel config before the `http_status:404` catch-all\n\n---\n\n## Useful Reference\n\nCF API base: `https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4`\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|-|-|-|\n| `/zones` | GET | List zones (filter: `?name=domain.com`) |\n| `/zones/{zone_id}/dns_records` | GET | List DNS records |\n| `/zones/{zone_id}/dns_records` | POST | Create DNS record |\n| `/zones/{zone_id}/dns_records/{id}` | PUT | Update DNS record |\n| `/zones/{zone_id}/dns_records/{id}` | DELETE | Delete DNS record |\n| `/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel/{tunnel_id}/configurations` | GET | Get tunnel ingress config |\n| `/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel/{tunnel_id}/configurations` | PUT | Replace tunnel ingress config |\n| `/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel` | GET | List all tunnels |\n\nAll responses: `{\"success\": bool, \"result\": ..., \"errors\": [...]}`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:54:45.769Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring secure Cloudflare DNS and tunnel management for VPS-hosted applications.","zh":"适用于需要安全的Cloudflare DNS和隧道管理的DevOps代理，用于VPS托管的应用程序。","ja":"VPSホストされたアプリケーションに対する安全なCloudflare DNSおよびトンネル管理を必要とするDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"VPS 호스팅된 애플리케이션에 대한 보안 Cloudflare DNS 및 터널 관리를 요구하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren un DNS de Cloudflare seguro y una gestión de túneles para aplicaciones alojadas en VPS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant un DNS Cloudflare sécurisé et une gestion de tunnels pour des applications hébergées sur VPS.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die ein sicheres Cloudflare-DNS und eine Tunnelverwaltung für auf VPS gehostete Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem Cloudflare DNS seguro e gerenciamento de túneis para aplicações hospedadas em VPS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих безопасного Cloudflare DNS и управления туннелями для приложений, размещенных на VPS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى Cloudflare DNS آمن وإدارة النفقات لتقديم التطبيقات المضيفة على VPS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle Cloudflare DNS and tunnel operations via the Cloudflare API, leveraging Doppler for secure token management and Traefik for reverse proxy configuration, all within a Production Docker Compose stack on Hetzner VPS.","zh":"赋予代理处理Cloudflare DNS和隧道操作的能力，通过Cloudflare API，利用Doppler进行安全令牌管理，利用Traefik进行反向代理配置，所有这些都在Hetzner VPS上的生产Docker Compose栈中。","ja":"Cloudflare APIを通じて、Cloudflare DNSおよびトンネル操作を処理するエージェントの能力を提供します。Dopplerを使用したセキュアなトークン管理と、Traefikを使用したリバースプロキシ構成を活用し、すべてHetzner VPS上のProduction Docker Composeスタックで実行します。","ko":"Cloudflare API를 통해 Cloudflare DNS 및 터널 작업을 처리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. Doppler를 사용한 보안 토큰 관리와 Traefik를 사용한 역방향 프록시 구성 모두를 활용하여 Hetzner VPS에서 프로덕션 Docker Compose 스택에서 실행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar operaciones de DNS y túneles de Cloudflare a través de la API de Cloudflare, aprovechando Doppler para una gestión de tokens segura y Traefik para la configuración de proxy inverso, todo dentro de una pila de Docker Compose de producción en Hetzner VPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les opérations DNS et de tunnels Cloudflare via l''API Cloudflare, en exploitant Doppler pour une gestion de jetons sécurisée et Traefik pour la configuration de proxy inversé, le tout au sein d''une pile Docker Compose de production sur Hetzner VPS.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Cloudflare-DNS- und Tunnelvorgänge über die Cloudflare-API zu verwalten, indem Doppler für eine sichere Tokenverwaltung und Traefik für die Konfiguration des Reverse-Proxy genutzt werden, alles innerhalb eines Produktions-Docker-Compose-Stapels auf Hetzner VPS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com operações Cloudflare DNS e túneis por meio da Cloudflare API, aproveitando o Doppler para gerenciamento de tokens seguro e o Traefik para configuração de proxy reverso, tudo dentro de uma pilha de Produção Docker Compose no Hetzner VPS.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обрабатывать операции Cloudflare DNS и туннелей через Cloudflare API, используя Doppler для безопасного управления токенами и Traefik для конфигурации обратного прокси, все это в стэке Production Docker Compose на Hetzner VPS.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء التعامل مع عمليات Cloudflare DNS والنفقات عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Cloudflare، مستفيدًا من Doppler لإدارة الرموز الأمنية وTraefik لتكوين وكيل الويب العكسي، كل ذلك داخل حزمة إنتاج Docker Compose على Hetzner VPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Cloudflare Tunnel setup for VPS-hosted apps","Managing Cloudflare DNS records for custom domains","Debugging Cloudflare Tunnel connectivity issues using OTel"],"zh":["为VPS托管的应用程序自动设置Cloudflare Tunnel","管理自定义域的Cloudflare DNS记录","使用OTel调试Cloudflare Tunnel的连接问题"],"ja":["VPSホストされたアプリケーションに対するCloudflare Tunnelのセットアップを自動化する","カスタムドメインのCloudflare DNSレコードを管理する","OTelを使用してCloudflare Tunnelの接続問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["VPS 호스팅된 애플리케이션에 대한 Cloudflare Tunnel 설정 자동화","사용자 지정 도메인에 대한 Cloudflare DNS 레코드 관리","OTel을 사용하여 Cloudflare Tunnel 연결 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración del túnel de Cloudflare para aplicaciones alojadas en VPS","Administrar registros de DNS de Cloudflare para dominios personalizados","Depurar problemas de conectividad del túnel de Cloudflare mediante OTel"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration du tunnel Cloudflare pour les applications hébergées sur VPS","Gérer les enregistrements DNS Cloudflare pour les domaines personnalisés","Déboguer les problèmes de connectivité du tunnel Cloudflare à l''aide d''OTel"],"de":["Automatisierung der Cloudflare-Tunnel-Konfiguration für auf VPS gehostete Anwendungen","Verwalten von Cloudflare-DNS-Einträgen für benutzerdefinierte Domains","Fehlerbehebung bei der Cloudflare-Tunnel-Konnektivität mithilfe von OTel"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do túnel Cloudflare para aplicações hospedadas em VPS","Gerenciar registros DNS do Cloudflare para domínios personalizados","Depurar problemas de conectividade do túnel Cloudflare usando OTel"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку туннеля Cloudflare для приложений, размещенных на VPS","Управлять записями DNS Cloudflare для пользовательских доменов","Отладить проблемы подключения туннеля Cloudflare с помощью OTel"],"ar":["توفير إعداد تلقائي لتونيل Cloudflare لتطبيقات مضيفة على VPS","إدارة سجلات DNS في Cloudflare لأسماء النطاقات المخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء الاتصال بتونيل Cloudflare باستخدام OTel"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare API token stored in Doppler","Limited to VPS-hosted applications with Docker Compose","Dependent on ssh access for execution via Doppler"],"zh":["需要在Doppler中存储Cloudflare API令牌","仅限于使用Docker Compose的VPS托管应用程序","依赖ssh访问以通过Doppler执行"],"ja":["Dopplerに保存されたCloudflare APIトークンが必要","Docker Composeを使用するVPSホストされたアプリケーションに限定される","Dopplerを介した実行のためにsshアクセスに依存する"],"ko":["Doppler에 저장된 Cloudflare API 토큰 필요","Docker Compose를 사용하는 VPS 호스팅된 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","Doppler를 통한 실행을 위해 SSH 접근에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un token de API de Cloudflare almacenado en Doppler","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en VPS con Docker Compose","Dependiente del acceso ssh para la ejecución a través de Doppler"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API Cloudflare stocké dans Doppler","Limité aux applications hébergées sur VPS avec Docker Compose","Dépend de l''accès ssh pour l''exécution via Doppler"],"de":["Erfordert ein Cloudflare-API-Token, das in Doppler gespeichert ist","Begrenzt auf auf VPS gehostete Anwendungen mit Docker Compose","Abhängig von ssh-Zugriff für die Ausführung über Doppler"],"pt":["Exige token da API do Cloudflare armazenado no Doppler","Limitado a aplicações hospedadas em VPS com Docker Compose","Dependente do acesso ssh para execução via Doppler"],"ru":["Требует токена API Cloudflare, хранящегося в Doppler","Ограничен для приложений, размещенных на VPS с Docker Compose","Зависит от доступа ssh для выполнения через Doppler"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Cloudflare المخزن في Doppler","محدود لتطبيقات مضيفة على VPS مع Docker Compose","يعتمد على الوصول إلى ssh للتنفيذ عبر Doppler"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6f4832608fac2e0d6a98af788efe7dbfa5e6e3e257e2476dec2e16ea6735fae6","qualityScore":39}');
