хническая документация","ce-pipeline-builder vs jenkins","ИИ агент для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ce-pipeline-builder","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لـ CI/CD","طريقة التفسيرات المعايرة","تثبيت ce-pipeline-builder","أتمتة خطوط أنابيب التطوير","توثيق تقني آلي","ce-pipeline-builder مقابل jenkins","وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"Moffran","repo":"calibrated_explanations","repoPath":"Moffran/calibrated_explanations","stars":74,"forks":12,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T20:43:37Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ce-pipeline-builder","description":">","bodyPreview":"# CE Pipeline Builder\n\nYou are implementing a CE-first pipeline. Load `references/ce-first-policy.md`\nfor the full policy text. Non-negotiable invariants are repeated inline below\nfor quick reference.\n\n## Mandatory CE-First Checklist (enforce in order)\n\n1. **Library check** — if `calibrated_explanations` is not importable, fail fast:\n   ```python\n   pip install calibrated-explanations\n   ```\n2. **Wrapper** — always use `WrapCalibratedExplainer`. Never invent a new wrapper\n   class; never use `Ca","body":"# CE Pipeline Builder\n\nYou are implementing a CE-first pipeline. Load `references/ce-first-policy.md`\nfor the full policy text. Non-negotiable invariants are repeated inline below\nfor quick reference.\n\n## Mandatory CE-First Checklist (enforce in order)\n\n1. **Library check** — if `calibrated_explanations` is not importable, fail fast:\n   ```python\n   pip install calibrated-explanations\n   ```\n2. **Wrapper** — always use `WrapCalibratedExplainer`. Never invent a new wrapper\n   class; never use `CalibratedExplainer` directly in user-facing code.\n3. **Fit** — `explainer.fit(x_proper, y_proper)`.\n   Assert `explainer.fitted is True` before proceeding.\n4. **Calibrate** — `explainer.calibrate(x_cal, y_cal)`.\n   Assert `explainer.calibrated is True` before proceeding.\n5. **Explain (standard)** — `explainer.explain_factual(X)` or\n   `explainer.explore_alternatives(X)`.\n6. **Explain (guarded / in-distribution)** — when higher security or\n   in-distribution filtering is needed, use `explainer.explain_guarded_factual(X)`\n   or `explainer.explore_guarded_alternatives(X)` instead of the standard paths.\n   Also use when rule conditions of the form `x < feature <= y` are needed, since\n   the guarded APIs support this natively.\n7. **Conjunctions** — `explanations.add_conjunctions(...)` or\n   `explanations[idx].add_conjunctions(...)`.\n8. **Narratives & plots** — `.to_narrative(output_format=...)` and `.plot(...)`.\n9. **Calibrated by default** — never return uncalibrated outputs unless\n   the user has explicitly requested them.\n\n## Minimal Working Skeleton\n\nAdapt the task type (binary / multiclass / regression) based on the user''s\ndata and model. Choose from the three templates below:\n\n### Binary classification\n\n```python\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nimport numpy as np\nfrom calibrated_explanations import WrapCalibratedExplainer\n\n# --- Data split ---------------------------------------------------------\n# x_proper, y_proper : proper training set (used for model training)\n# x_cal, y_cal       : calibration set    (must NOT overlap with x_proper)\n# X_query            : instances to explain\n\n# --- Build pipeline -----------------------------------------------------\nexplainer = WrapCalibratedExplainer(model)           # model: any sklearn-compat\nexplainer.fit(x_proper, y_proper)\nassert explainer.fitted is True\n\nexplainer.calibrate(x_cal, y_cal)\nassert explainer.calibrated is True\n\n# --- Explain ------------------------------------------------------------\nexplanations = explainer.explain_factual(X_query)\n# Optional: add feature conjunctions\nexplanations.add_conjunctions(max_rule_size=3)\n# Optional: narrative\nprint(explanations[0].to_narrative())\n# Optional: plot\nexplanations[0].plot()\n```\n\n### Multiclass classification\n\nSame scaffold as binary. The `explain_factual` call returns one explanation\nobject per query instance, with per-class calibrated probabilities available in\n`explanations[i].prediction[\"__full_probabilities__\"]`.\n\n### Regression (percentile intervals)\n\n```python\nexplainer = WrapCalibratedExplainer(reg_model)\nexplainer.fit(x_proper, y_proper)\nassert explainer.fitted is True\n\nexplainer.calibrate(x_cal, y_cal)\nassert explainer.calibrated is True\n\n# low_high_percentiles controls the conformal interval width (ADR-021)\nexplanations = explainer.explain_factual(X_query, low_high_percentiles=(10, 90))\n```\n\n### Regression (thresholded / probabilistic)\n\n```python\n# threshold= activates the CPS + Venn-Abers path (ADR-021 §3)\nexplanations = explainer.explain_factual(X_query, threshold=my_threshold)\n```\n\n## Using `ce_agent_utils` helpers\n\nPrefer the validated helpers from `src/calibrated_explanations/ce_agent_utils.py`\nfor end-to-end pipelines in agent code:\n\n```python\nfrom calibrated_explanations.ce_agent_utils import (\n    ensure_ce_first_wrapper,\n    fit_and_calibrate,\n    explain_and_narrate,\n    wrap_and_explain,\n)\n\n# Full pipeline in one call:\nexplanations = wrap_and_explain(\n    model, x_proper, y_proper, x_cal, y_cal, X_query\n)\n```\n\n## Decision: `explain_factual` vs `explain_guarded_factual`\n\n| Use case | API to use |\n|---|---|\n| Standard inference | `explain_factual` / `explore_alternatives` |\n| Production / unknown input distribution | `explain_guarded_factual` / `explore_guarded_alternatives` |\n| Explicit in-distribution filtering required | `explain_guarded_factual` |\n\nGuarded variants apply ADR-032 semantics — see `references/adr-032-guarded-semantics.md`.\n\n## Data Split Rules\n\n- `x_proper` / `y_proper` and `x_cal` / `y_cal` must **not** overlap.\n- Typical split: 60% proper training, 20% calibration, 20% test. Adjust based on\n  calibration data needs (larger calibration → tighter intervals).\n- Never reuse training data for calibration.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nThis skill does NOT:\n- Train or tune the underlying model (use your usual scikit-learn workflow).\n- Generate plots or visualizations beyond `.plot()` invocation (see `ce-plotspec-author`).\n- Cover the serialization / persistence of calibrators (see `ce-serializer-impl`).\n- Add new plugins or modify `core/` (see `ce-plugin-scaffold`).\n\n## Evaluation Checklist (self-verify before returning)\n\n- [ ] `WrapCalibratedExplainer` used (not raw `CalibratedExplainer`).\n- [ ] `fit()` called with proper training data.\n- [ ] `calibrate()` called with separate calibration data.\n- [ ] Both `.fitted is True` and `.calibrated is True` asserted.\n- [ ] `explain_factual` or `explore_alternatives` (or guarded variants) called.\n- [ ] No uncalibrated output returned unless explicitly requested.\n- [ ] Skeleton is runnable with the user''s model and data shapes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T01:59:21.145Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Explainability Agents needing to implement Calibrated Explanations pipelines with advanced wrapper classes.","zh":"非常适合需要实现校准解释管道的可解释性代理，具有高级包装类。","ja":"可解釈性エージェントが校正された説明のパイプラインを実装する必要がある場合に最適です。高度なラッパークラスを備えています。","ko":"설명 가능성 에이전트가 校准된 설명 파이프라인을 구현해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 고급 래퍼 클래스가 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de explicabilidad que necesitan implementar pipelines de Calibrated Explanations con clases wrapper avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''explicabilité nécessitant la mise en œuvre de pipelines Calibrated Explanations avec des classes wrapper avancées.","de":"Ideal für Explainability Agents, die Pipelines für Calibrated Explanations mit erweiterten Wrapper-Klassen implementieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Explicabilidade que precisam implementar pipelines de Calibrated Explanations com classes wrapper avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Объяснимости, которым необходимо реализовать конвейеры Calibrated Explanations с использованием расширенных классов-обёрток.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء القابلية للتفسير الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ خطوط أنابيب Calibrated Explanations مع فئات الغلاف المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce non-negotiable invariants using the `calibrated_explanations` library and `WrapCalibratedExplainer` wrapper, ensuring fail-fast policy checks and adherence to CE-first policy guidelines via files like `ce-first-policy.md`.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `calibrated_explanations` 库和 `WrapCalibratedExplainer` 包装器强制执行不可协商的不变量，确保快速失败的策略检查和遵守 CE 首要政策指南，例如通过文件 `ce-first-policy.md`。","ja":"エージェントに `calibrated_explanations` ライブラリと `WrapCalibratedExplainer` ラッパーを使用して交渉不可能な不変性を強制実行する力を与え、ファイル `ce-first-policy.md` などの CE ファースト ポリシーガイドラインへの準拠と、迅速に失敗するポリシーのチェックを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 `calibrated_explanations` 라이브러리와 `WrapCalibratedExplainer` 래퍼를 사용하여 협상할 수 없는 불변량을 강제 적용할 수 있도록 함으로써, `ce-first-policy.md` 파일과 같은 CE 첫 번째 정책 지침에 대한 준수와 빠른 실패 정책 체크를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar invariantes no negociables utilizando la biblioteca `calibrated_explanations` y el wrapper `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, garantizando comprobaciones de políticas fail-fast y el cumplimiento de las directrices de políticas CE-first mediante archivos como `ce-first-policy.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter des invariants non négociables en utilisant la bibliothèque `calibrated_explanations` et le wrapper `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, garantissant des vérifications de politiques fail-fast et le respect des directives de politiques CE-first via des fichiers tels que `ce-first-policy.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, nicht verhandelbare Invarianten mit der Bibliothek `calibrated_explanations` und dem `WrapCalibratedExplainer`-Wrapper durchzusetzen, wodurch Fail-Fast-Policy-Prüfungen und die Einhaltung von CE-First-Policy-Richtlinien über Dateien wie `ce-first-policy.md` sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a impor invariantes não negociáveis usando a biblioteca `calibrated_explanations` e o wrapper `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, garantindo verificações de política fail-fast e adesão às diretrizes da política CE-first por meio de arquivos como `ce-first-policy.md`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять неоспоримые инварианты с использованием библиотеки `calibrated_explanations` и обёртки `WrapCalibratedExplainer`, обеспечивая проверки политики по принципу fail-fast и соблюдение руководящих принципов политики «CE-first» через такие файлы, как `ce-first-policy.md`.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من فرض ثوابت غير قابلة للتفاوض باستخدام مكتبة `calibrated_explanations` وغلاف `WrapCalibratedExplainer`، مما يضمن عمليات فحص السياسة السريعة للفشل والالتزام بإرشادات سياسة CE-first عبر ملفات مثل `ce-first-policy.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Mandatory CE-First Checklist","Automating library checks with `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Enforcing wrapper class standards with `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"zh":["实现强制 CE 首先检查清单","使用 `pip install calibrated-explanations` 自动执行库检查","使用 `WrapCalibratedExplainer` 强制执行包装类标准"],"ja":["必須の CE ファースト チェックリストを実装する","`pip install calibrated-explanations` を使用してライブラリのチェックを自動化する","`WrapCalibratedExplainer` を使用してラッパークラスの標準を強制する"],"ko":["필수 CE 첫 번째 체크리스트 구현","`pip install calibrated-explanations`를 사용하여 라이브러리 체크 자동화","`WrapCalibratedExplainer`를 사용하여 래퍼 클래스 표준 적용"],"es":["Implementación de listas de verificación obligatorias CE-First","Automatización de comprobaciones de bibliotecas con `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Aplicación de estándares de clases wrapper con `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de listes de contrôle obligatoires CE-First","Automatisation des vérifications de bibliothèque avec `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Application des normes de classes wrapper avec `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"de":["Umsetzung verbindlicher CE-First-Checklisten","Automatisierung von Bibliotheksprüfungen mit `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Durchsetzung von Wrapper-Klassen-Standards mit `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"pt":["Implementação da Lista de Verificação Obrigatória CE-First","Automatização de verificações de biblioteca com `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Imposição de padrões de classe wrapper com `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"ru":["Реализация Обязательного Контрольного списка CE-First","Автоматизация проверок библиотек с помощью `pip install calibrated-explanations`","Обеспечение стандартов классов-обёрток с помощью `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"],"ar":["تنفيذ قائمة التحقق الإلزامية CE-First","أتمتة فحوصات المكتبة باستخدام `pip install calibrated-explanations`","فرض معايير فئة الغلاف باستخدام `WrapCalibratedExplainer`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `calibrated_explanations` library","Python environment needed for `pip install` and importing libraries"],"zh":["需要 `calibrated_explanations` 库","需要 Python 环境用于 `pip install` 和导入库"],"ja":["`calibrated_explanations` ライブラリが必要","`pip install` とライブラリのインポートに Python 環境が必要"],"ko":["`calibrated_explanations` 라이브러리가 필요","`pip install` 및 라이브러리 가져오기에 Python 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca `calibrated_explanations`","Se necesita un entorno Python para `pip install` y la importación de bibliotecas"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque `calibrated_explanations`","Environnement Python nécessaire pour `pip install` et l''importation de bibliothèques"],"de":["Erfordert die Bibliothek `calibrated_explanations`","Python-Umgebung für `pip install` und den Import von Bibliotheken erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca `calibrated_explanations`","Ambiente Python necessário para `pip install` e importação de bibliotecas"],"ru":["Требуется библиотека `calibrated_explanations`","Необходима среда Python для `pip install` и импорта библиотек"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة `calibrated_explanations`","بيئة Python مطلوبة لأمر `pip install` واستيراد المكتبات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ae2def778a6daa118ec4edef1a02444ce848e06818b61839b8d66f2ab0efd276","qualityScore":39}');
