imized for Python and ML open-source development."},"features":{"zh":["个人AI编码助手配置","专家代理","自动化工作流","Python和ML开发优化","开源开发支持","CLI集成"],"ja":["個人用AIコーディングアシスタント設定","専門家エージェント","自動化ワークフロー","PythonとMLの開発最適化","オープンソース開発サポート","CLI統合"],"ko":["개인용 AI 코딩 도우미 설정","전문가 에이전트","자동화 워크플로우","파이썬과 ML 개발 최적화","오픈소스 개발 지원","CLI 통합"],"es":["Configuraciones de asistentes de codificación de IA personalizados","Agentes especializados para el desarrollo de Python y ML","Flujos de trabajo automatizados para aumentar la productividad","Optimizado para el desarrollo de código abierto","Compatibilidad con Claude Code y Codex CLI"],"fr":["Configurations d''agents de codage IA personnalisés","Agents spécialisés pour le développement Python et ML","Flux de travail automatisés pour augmenter la productivité","Optimisé pour le développement de code open-source","Compatibilité avec Claude Code et Codex CLI"],"de":["Konfigurationen für personalisierte AI-Coding-Assistenten","Spezialisierte Agenten für die Entwicklung von Python und ML","Automatisierte Workflows für die Steigerung der Produktivität","Optimiert für die Entwicklung von Open-Source-Code","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Codex CLI"],"pt":["Configurações de assistentes de código AI personalizados","Agentes especializados para desenvolvimento de código aberto","Fluxos de trabalho automatizados para Python e ML","Desenvolvimento de código aberto em Python e ML","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares"],"ru":["Конфигурации личных помощников кода ИИ","Специализированные агенты для открытого развития","Автоматизированные рабочие процессы для Python и ML","Открытое развитие кода на Python и ML","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки"],"ar":["أدوات التكوين لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الشخصية","أدوات متخصصة لتطوير البرمجيات مفتوحة المصدر","عمليات العمل الآلية لل파이ثون و ML","تطوير البرمجيات مفتوحة المصدر بال파이ثون و ML","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具配置","Python开发","ML开发","AI编码助手","自动化工作流","如何使用AI工具","AI工具安装","AI工具设置指南","AI工具与其他工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Python開発","ML開発","AIコーディングアシスタント","自動化ワークフロー","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド","AIエージェントと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","파이썬 개발","ML 개발","AI 코딩 도우미","자동화 워크플로우","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트와 다른 도구 비교"],"es":["cómo usar asistentes de codificación de IA","qué es la configuración de ''fix''","alternativas a Claude Code","instalación de Codex CLI","guía de configuración de ''fix''","desarrollo de Python y ML de código abierto","asistentes de codificación de IA para Python","agentes de codificación de IA para ML"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents de codage IA","qu''est-ce que la configuration ''fix''","alternatives à Claude Code","installation de Codex CLI","guide de configuration de ''fix''","développement Python et ML open-source","agents de codage IA pour Python","agents de codage IA pour ML"],"de":["wie man AI-Coding-Assistenten verwendet","was ist die ''fix''-Konfiguration","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Installation von Codex CLI","Anleitung zur Konfiguration von ''fix''","Entwicklung von Python und ML Open-Source","AI-Coding-Assistenten für Python","AI-Coding-Assistenten für ML"],"pt":["assistentes de código AI","ferramentas de desenvolvimento Python","ML open-source","como usar assistentes de código AI","o que é assistente de código AI","alternativas para assistentes de código AI","instalação de assistentes de código AI","guia de configuração de assistentes de código AI"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","инструменты разработки Python","ML открытый исходный код","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агент","альтернативы для ИИ Агентов","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по конфигурации ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تطوير البرمجيات بال파이ثون","برمجيات مفتوحة المصدر ML","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل تكوين أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Borda","repo":".home","repoPath":"Borda/.home","stars":4,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T23:58:18Z","topics":["ai-agents","claude-agents","claude-code","claude-skills","codex","codex-agents","codex-cli"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fix","description":"Bug-fixing workflow — diagnose the problem, reproduce it with a regression test, apply a targeted fix, then verify with linting, quality checks, and optional optimization.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\n\nFix software bugs with a disciplined reproduce-first workflow. Before touching any code, understand the root cause and capture the bug in a regression test. Then apply the minimal fix, verify all tests pass, and finish with linting and quality checks. The regression test stays in the codebase to prevent re-introduction.\n\n</objective>\n\n<inputs>\n\n- **$ARGUMENTS**: required — one of:\n  - A bug description in plain text (e.g., `\"TypeError when passing None to transform()\"`)\n  - A GitHub","body":"<objective>\n\nFix software bugs with a disciplined reproduce-first workflow. Before touching any code, understand the root cause and capture the bug in a regression test. Then apply the minimal fix, verify all tests pass, and finish with linting and quality checks. The regression test stays in the codebase to prevent re-introduction.\n\n</objective>\n\n<inputs>\n\n- **$ARGUMENTS**: required — one of:\n  - A bug description in plain text (e.g., `\"TypeError when passing None to transform()\"`)\n  - A GitHub issue number (e.g., `123` — fetched via `gh issue view`)\n  - An error message or traceback snippet\n  - A failing test name (e.g., `tests/test_transforms.py::test_none_input`)\n\n</inputs>\n\n<workflow>\n\n## Step 1: Understand the problem\n\nGather all available context about the bug:\n\n```bash\n# If issue number: fetch the full issue with comments\ngh issue view <number> --comments\n```\n\nIf an error message or pattern was provided: use the Grep tool (pattern `<error_pattern>`, path `.`) to search the codebase for the failing code path. Adjust to `src/`, `lib/`, or `app/` as appropriate for the project layout.\n\n```bash\n\n# If failing test: run it to capture the exact failure\npython -m pytest <test_path> -v --tb=long 2>&1 | tail -40\n```\n\nSpawn a **sw-engineer** agent to analyze the failing code path and identify:\n\n- The root cause (not just the symptom)\n- The minimal code surface that needs to change\n- Any related code that might be affected by the fix\n\n## Step 2: Reproduce the bug\n\nCreate or identify a test that demonstrates the failure:\n\n```bash\n# If a failing test already exists — run it to confirm it fails\npython -m pytest <test_file>::<test_name> -v --tb=short\n\n# If no test exists — write a regression test that captures the bug\n# Name it: test_<function>_<bug_description> (e.g., test_transform_none_input)\n```\n\nSpawn a **qa-specialist** agent to write the regression test if one doesn''t exist:\n\n- The test must **fail** against the current code (proving the bug exists)\n- Use `pytest.mark.parametrize` if the bug affects multiple input patterns\n- Keep the test minimal — exercise exactly the broken behavior\n- Add a brief comment linking to the issue if applicable (e.g., `# Regression test for #123`)\n\n**Gate**: the regression test must fail before proceeding. If it passes, the bug isn''t properly captured — revisit Step 1.\n\n## Step 3: Apply the fix\n\nMake the minimal change to fix the root cause:\n\n1. Edit only the code necessary to resolve the bug\n2. Run the regression test to confirm it now passes:\n   ```bash\n   python -m pytest <test_file>::<test_name> -v --tb=short\n   ```\n3. Run the full test suite for the affected module to check for regressions:\n   ```bash\n   # Step 3: regression gate — confirms fix does not break existing tests\n   python -m pytest <test_dir> -v --tb=short\n   ```\n4. If any existing tests break: the fix has side effects — reconsider the approach\n\n## Step 4: Linting and quality\n\nSpawn a **linting-expert** agent (or run directly) to ensure the fix meets code quality standards:\n\n```bash\n# Run ruff for linting and formatting\nruff check <changed_files> --fix\nruff format <changed_files>\n\n# Run mypy for type checking if configured\nmypy <changed_files> --no-error-summary 2>&1 | head -20\n\n# Step 4: final full-suite clean run before commit\npython -m pytest <test_dir> -v --tb=short\n```\n\n## Step 5: Verify and report\n\nOutput a structured report:\n\n```\n## Fix Report: <bug summary>\n\n### Root Cause\n[1-2 sentence explanation of what was wrong and why]\n\n### Regression Test\n- File: <test_file>\n- Test: <test_name>\n- Confirms: [what behavior the test locks in]\n\n### Changes Made\n| File | Change | Lines |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| path/to/file.py | description of fix | -N/+M |\n\n### Test Results\n- Regression test: PASS\n- Full suite: PASS (N tests)\n- Lint: clean\n\n### Follow-up\n- [any related issues or code that should be reviewed]\n\n## Confidence\n**Score**: [0.N]\n**Gaps**: [e.g., could not reproduce locally, partial traceback only, fix not runtime-tested]\n```\n\n</workflow>\n\n<notes>\n\n- **Reproduce first**: never fix a bug you can''t demonstrate with a test — the test is the proof\n- **Minimal fix**: change only what''s necessary to resolve the root cause — avoid incidental refactoring\n- The regression test is a permanent contribution — it prevents the bug from recurring\n- If the bug is in `.claude/` config files: run `self-mentor` audit + `/sync` after fixing\n- Related agents: `sw-engineer` (root cause analysis), `qa-specialist` (regression test), `linting-expert` (quality)\n- Follow-up chains:\n  - Fix involves structural improvements beyond the bug → `/refactor` for test-first code quality pass\n  - Fix touches non-trivial code paths → `/review` for full multi-agent quality validation\n  - Fix required consistent renames or annotation changes across many files → `/codex` to delegate the mechanical sweep\n\n</notes>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T01:58:11.495Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Debugging Agents requiring a disciplined reproduce-first workflow for Python and ML open-source development.","zh":"适用于需要严格遵循重现优先工作流程的Python和机器学习开源开发的调试代理。","ja":"Pythonと機械学習のオープンソース開発に適した、再現性のあるワークフローを必要とするデバッグエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Python과 기계 학습 오픈소스 개발을 위한 엄격한 재현 우선 워크플로우가 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para depuradores de agentes que requieren un flujo de trabajo disciplinado de reproducción primero para el desarrollo de código abierto de Python y ML.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage nécessitant un flux de travail discipliné de reproduction en premier lieu pour le développement open-source de Python et ML.","de":"Ideal für Debugging-Agents, die einen disziplinierten reproduce-first-Workflow für die Open-Source-Entwicklung von Python und ML erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de depuração que exigem um fluxo de trabalho disciplinado de reproduzir primeiro para desenvolvimento de código aberto Python e ML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для отладки агентов, требующих дисциплинированного рабочего процесса reproduce-first для открытого развития Python и ML.","ar":"مثالي لعميل العامل الذي يتطلب تدفق عمل منضبط لإعادة الإنتاج أولا لتطوير mã برمجي مفتوح المصدر Python و ML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to resolve software bugs efficiently by capturing issues in regression tests, applying minimal fixes, and ensuring code quality through linting and verification, leveraging GitHub issues and plain text bug descriptions.","zh":"赋予代理高效解决软件错误的能力，通过捕获回归测试中的问题，应用最小修复，并通过linting和验证确保代码质量，利用GitHub问题和纯文本错误描述。","ja":"エージェントに効果的にソフトウェアのバグを解決する能力を与え、回帰テストで問題を捕捉し、最小限の修正を適用し、lintingと検証でコードの品質を確保し、GitHubの問題とプレーンテキストのバグ説明を利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 소프트웨어 버그를 효율적으로 해결할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 회귀 테스트에서 문제를 捕获하고 최소한의 수정을 적용하고 linting 및 verification을 통해 코드 품질을 보장하며 GitHub 문제와 평문 버그 설명을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes resolver errores de software de manera eficiente al capturar problemas en pruebas de regresión, aplicar soluciones mínimas y garantizar la calidad del código a través de linting y verificación, aprovechando problemas de GitHub y descripciones de errores de texto plano.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre les bogues logiciels de manière efficace en capturant les problèmes dans les tests de régression, en appliquant des correctifs minimaux et en garantissant la qualité du code via linting et vérification, en exploitant les problèmes GitHub et les descriptions de bogues en texte brut.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Softwarefehler effizient zu lösen, indem sie Probleme in Regressions-tests erfassen, minimale Korrekturen anwenden und die Code-Qualität durch Linting und Überprüfung sicherstellen, indem sie GitHub-Probleme und Klartext-Fehlerbeschreibungen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a resolver problemas de software de forma eficiente, capturando problemas em testes de regressão, aplicando soluções mínimas e garantindo a qualidade do código por meio de linting e verificação, aproveitando problemas do GitHub e descrições de bugs de texto simples.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно решать проблемы программного обеспечения, фиксируя проблемы в регрессионных тестах, применяя минимальные исправления и обеспечивая качество кода посредством linting и верификации, используя проблемы GitHub и простые текстовые описания ошибок.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على حل مشاكل البرمجيات بفعالية من خلال التقاط المشاكل في اختبارات الانحدار، وتطبيق إصلاحات صغيرة، وضمان جودة الشفرة من خلال linting والتحقق، واستخدام مشاكل GitHub ووصف الخطأ النصي البسيط."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging TypeError exceptions in Python code","Creating regression tests for ML model training pipelines","Verifying fixes with automated testing and linting workflows"],"zh":["调试Python代码中的TypeError异常","为机器学习模型训练管道创建回归测试","使用自动化测试和linting工作流验证修复"],"ja":["PythonコードのTypeError例外のデバッグ","機械学習モデルトレーニングパイプラインの回帰テストの作成","自動テストとlintingワークフローで修正を検証"],"ko":["Python 코드의 TypeError 예외 디버깅","기계 학습 모델 훈련 파이프라인을 위한 회귀 테스트 생성","자동 테스트 및 linting 워크플로우를 통한 수정 확인"],"es":["Depuración de excepciones TypeError en código Python","Creación de pruebas de regresión para tuberías de entrenamiento de modelos ML","Verificación de soluciones con flujos de trabajo de pruebas automatizadas y linting"],"fr":["Débogage des exceptions TypeError dans le code Python","Création de tests de régression pour les pipelines d''entraînement de modèles ML","Vérification des correctifs avec des flux de travail de tests automatisés et de linting"],"de":["Debugging von TypeError-Ausnahmen in Python-Code","Erstellung von Regressions-tests für ML-Modell-Trainingspipelines","Überprüfung von Korrekturen mit automatisierten Test- und Linting-Workflows"],"pt":["Depurar exceções TypeError em código Python","Criar testes de regressão para pipelines de treinamento de modelo ML","Verificar soluções com fluxos de trabalho de teste automatizado e linting"],"ru":["Отладка исключений TypeError в коде Python","Создание регрессионных тестов для конвейеров обучения модели ML","Проверка исправлений с помощью автоматизированных тестирований и рабочих процессов linting"],"ar":["تصحيح استثناءات TypeError في رمز Python","إنشاء اختبارات انحدار لخطوط أنابيب تدريب نموذج ML","التحقق من الإصلاحات باستخدام تدفقات عمل اختبار آلية وlinting"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and ML open-source development environment","Needs access to GitHub for issue tracking","Limited to software bugs with reproducible issues"],"zh":["需要Python和机器学习开源开发环境","需要访问GitHub进行问题跟踪","仅限于具有可重现问题的软件错误"],"ja":["Pythonと機械学習のオープンソース開発環境が必要","問題の追跡のためにGitHubへのアクセスが必要","再現可能な問題を持つソフトウェアのバグのみ"],"ko":["Python과 기계 학습 오픈소스 개발 환경이 필요","문제 추적을 위한 GitHub 액세스가 필요","재현 가능한 문제가 있는 소프트웨어 버그만"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de código abierto de Python y ML","Necesita acceso a GitHub para el seguimiento de problemas","Limitado a errores de software con problemas reproducibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement open-source de Python et ML","A besoin d''un accès à GitHub pour la traçabilité des problèmes","Limité aux bogues logiciels avec des problèmes reproductibles"],"de":["Benötigt eine Open-Source-Entwicklungsumgebung für Python und ML","Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub für die Problemmeldung","Begrenzt auf Softwarefehler mit reproduzierbaren Problemen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento de código aberto Python e ML","Necessita acesso ao GitHub para acompanhamento de problemas","Limitado a problemas de software com problemas reproduzíveis"],"ru":["Требует среды разработки открытого кода Python и ML","Требует доступа к GitHub для отслеживания проблем","Ограничен проблемами программного обеспечения с воспроизводимыми проблемами"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير برمجية مفتوحة المصدر Python و ML","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى GitHub لتتبع المشاكل","محدود بمشاكل البرمجيات التي تتميز بمشاكل قابلة للإعادة الإنتاج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"12e0958a90cd1d5954ea9ecf4041fd5a913c66047119968adb9a78027d1738ac","qualityScore":39}');
