 la eficiencia y precisión en el análisis de código","Compatibilidad con MCP para una mayor flexibilidad","Soporte para múltiples plataformas y lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Analyse de code avancée avec l''IA","Intégration avec IDA Pro et les modèles de langage","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la précision dans l''analyse de code","Compatibilité avec MCP pour une plus grande flexibilité","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes et langages de programmation"],"de":["Erweiterte Code-Analyse mit KI","Integration mit IDA Pro und Sprachmodellen","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Genauigkeit bei der Code-Analyse","Kompatibilität mit MCP für eine größere Flexibilität","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen und Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Análise de código impulsionada por IA","Integração com IDA Pro","Suporte a modelos de linguagem via MCP","Facilita a engenharia reversa","Melhora a eficiência da análise de código"],"ru":["Анализ кода с помощью ИИ","Интеграция с IDA Pro","Поддержка языковых моделей через MCP","Упрощает реверсивную инженерию","Повышает эффективность анализа кода"],"ar":["تحليل الكود بالذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع IDA Pro","دعم نماذج اللغة من خلال MCP","تسهيل هندسة عكسية","تحسين كفاءة تحليل الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["idapython","IDA Pro","AI智能代理","逆向工程","MCP","语言模型","如何使用idapython","idapython安装","idapython教程"],"ja":["idapython","IDA Pro","AIエージェント","逆向工学","MCP","言語モデル","idapythonの使い方","idapythonのインストール","idapythonのチュートリアル"],"ko":["idapython","IDA Pro","AI 에이전트","역공학","MCP","언어 모델","idapython 사용법","idapython 설치","idapython 튜토리얼"],"es":["idapython","ingeniería inversa","IA","IDA Pro","análisis de código","MCP","cómo usar idapython","alternativas a idapython","idapython vs IDA Pro"],"fr":["idapython","ingénierie inverse","IA","IDA Pro","analyse de code","MCP","comment utiliser idapython","alternatives à idapython","idapython vs IDA Pro"],"de":["idapython","Reverse-Engineering","KI","IDA Pro","Code-Analyse","MCP","idapython einrichten","idapython-Alternativen","idapython vs IDA Pro"],"pt":["idapython","ferramentas de ia","engenharia reversa","ida pro","modelos de linguagem","mcp","análise de código","desenvolvimento de software","segurança cibernética"],"ru":["idapython","ИИ агенты","реверсивная инженерия","ida pro","языковые модели","mcp","анализ кода","разработка программного обеспечения","кибербезопасность"],"ar":["idapython","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","هندسة عكسية","ida pro","نماذج اللغة","mcp","تحليل الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","أمن السيبراني"]}},"owner":"mrexodia","repo":"ida-pro-mcp","repoPath":"mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.672Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"idapython","description":"IDA Pro Python scripting for reverse engineering. Use when writing IDAPython scripts, analyzing binaries, working with IDAs API for disassembly, decompilation (Hex-Rays), type systems, cross-references, functions, segments, or any IDA database manipulation. Covers ida_* modules (50+), idautils iterators, and common patterns.","bodyPreview":"# IDAPython\n\nUse modern `ida_*` modules. Avoid legacy `idc` module.\n\n## Module Router\n\n| Task | Module | Key Items |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Bytes/memory | `ida_bytes` | `get_bytes`, `patch_bytes`, `get_flags`, `create_*` |\n| Functions | `ida_funcs` | `func_t`, `get_func`, `add_func`, `get_func_name` |\n| Names | `ida_name` | `set_name`, `get_name`, `demangle_name` |\n| Types | `ida_typeinf` | `tinfo_t`, `apply_tinfo`, `parse_decl` |\n| Decompiler | `ida_hexrays` | `decompile`, `cfunc_t`, `","body":"# IDAPython\n\nUse modern `ida_*` modules. Avoid legacy `idc` module.\n\n## Module Router\n\n| Task | Module | Key Items |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Bytes/memory | `ida_bytes` | `get_bytes`, `patch_bytes`, `get_flags`, `create_*` |\n| Functions | `ida_funcs` | `func_t`, `get_func`, `add_func`, `get_func_name` |\n| Names | `ida_name` | `set_name`, `get_name`, `demangle_name` |\n| Types | `ida_typeinf` | `tinfo_t`, `apply_tinfo`, `parse_decl` |\n| Decompiler | `ida_hexrays` | `decompile`, `cfunc_t`, `lvar_t`, ctree visitor |\n| Segments | `ida_segment` | `segment_t`, `getseg`, `add_segm` |\n| Xrefs | `ida_xref` | `xrefblk_t`, `add_cref`, `add_dref` |\n| Instructions | `ida_ua` | `insn_t`, `op_t`, `decode_insn` |\n| Stack frames | `ida_frame` | `get_frame`, `define_stkvar` |\n| Iteration | `idautils` | `Functions()`, `Heads()`, `XrefsTo()`, `Strings()` |\n| UI/dialogs | `ida_kernwin` | `msg`, `ask_*`, `jumpto`, `Choose` |\n| Database info | `ida_ida` | `inf_get_*`, `inf_is_64bit()` |\n| Analysis | `ida_auto` | `auto_wait`, `plan_and_wait` |\n| Flow graphs | `ida_gdl` | `FlowChart`, `BasicBlock` |\n| Register tracking | `ida_regfinder` | `find_reg_value`, `reg_value_info_t` |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Iterate functions\n```python\nfor ea in idautils.Functions():\n    name = ida_funcs.get_func_name(ea)\n    func = ida_funcs.get_func(ea)\n```\n\n### Iterate instructions in function\n```python\nfor head in idautils.FuncItems(func_ea):\n    insn = ida_ua.insn_t()\n    if ida_ua.decode_insn(insn, head):\n        print(f\"{head:#x}: {insn.itype}\")\n```\n\n### Cross-references\n```python\nfor xref in idautils.XrefsTo(ea):\n    print(f\"{xref.frm:#x} -> {xref.to:#x} type={xref.type}\")\n```\n\n### Read/write bytes\n```python\ndata = ida_bytes.get_bytes(ea, size)\nida_bytes.patch_bytes(ea, b\"\\x90\\x90\")\n```\n\n### Names\n```python\nname = ida_name.get_name(ea)\nida_name.set_name(ea, \"new_name\", ida_name.SN_NOCHECK)\n```\n\n### Decompile function\n```python\ncfunc = ida_hexrays.decompile(ea)\nif cfunc:\n    print(cfunc)  # pseudocode\n    for lvar in cfunc.lvars:\n        print(f\"{lvar.name}: {lvar.type()}\")\n```\n\n### Walk ctree (decompiled AST)\n```python\nclass MyVisitor(ida_hexrays.ctree_visitor_t):\n    def visit_expr(self, e):\n        if e.op == ida_hexrays.cot_call:\n            print(f\"Call at {e.ea:#x}\")\n        return 0\n\ncfunc = ida_hexrays.decompile(ea)\nMyVisitor().apply_to(cfunc.body, None)\n```\n\n### Apply type\n```python\ntif = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t()\nif ida_typeinf.parse_decl(tif, None, \"int (*)(char *, int)\", 0):\n    ida_typeinf.apply_tinfo(ea, tif, ida_typeinf.TINFO_DEFINITE)\n```\n\n### Create structure\n```python\nudt = ida_typeinf.udt_type_data_t()\nm = ida_typeinf.udm_t()\nm.name = \"field1\"\nm.type = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t(ida_typeinf.BTF_INT32)\nm.offset = 0\nm.size = 4\nudt.push_back(m)\ntif = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t()\ntif.create_udt(udt, ida_typeinf.BTF_STRUCT)\ntif.set_named_type(ida_typeinf.get_idati(), \"MyStruct\")\n```\n\n### Strings list\n```python\nfor s in idautils.Strings():\n    print(f\"{s.ea:#x}: {str(s)}\")\n```\n\n### Wait for analysis\n```python\nida_auto.auto_wait()  # Block until autoanalysis completes\n```\n\n## Key Constants\n\n| Constant | Value/Use |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `BADADDR` | Invalid address sentinel |\n| `ida_name.SN_NOCHECK` | Skip name validation |\n| `ida_typeinf.TINFO_DEFINITE` | Force type application |\n| `o_reg`, `o_mem`, `o_imm`, `o_displ`, `o_near` | Operand types |\n| `dt_byte`, `dt_word`, `dt_dword`, `dt_qword` | Data types |\n| `fl_CF`, `fl_CN`, `fl_JF`, `fl_JN`, `fl_F` | Code xref types |\n| `dr_R`, `dr_W`, `dr_O` | Data xref types |\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **NEVER convert hex/decimal manually** — use `int_convert` MCP tool\n2. **Wait for analysis**: Call `ida_auto.auto_wait()` before reading results\n3. **Thread safety**: IDA SDK calls must run on main thread (use `@idasync`)\n4. **64-bit addresses**: Always assume `ea_t` can be 64-bit\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Do Instead |\n|-------|------------|\n| `idc.*` functions | Use `ida_*` modules |\n| Hardcoded addresses | Use names, patterns, or xrefs |\n| Manual hex conversion | Use `int_convert` tool |\n| Blocking main thread | Use `execute_sync()` for long ops |\n| Guessing at types | Derive from disassembly/decompilation |\n\n## Detailed API Reference\n\nFor comprehensive documentation on any module, read `docs/<module>.md`:\n- **High-use**: `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs`, `ida_hexrays`, `ida_typeinf`, `ida_name`, `idautils`\n- **Medium-use**: `ida_segment`, `ida_xref`, `ida_ua`, `ida_frame`, `ida_kernwin`\n- **Specialized**: `ida_dbg` (debugger), `ida_nalt` (netnode storage), `ida_regfinder` (register tracking)\n\nFull RST sources from hex-rays.com available at `docs/<module>.rst`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:00.631Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Reverse Engineering Agents needing advanced IDA Pro integration with Python scripting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级IDA Pro集成和Python脚本编写能力的逆向工程代理。","ja":"IDA ProとPythonスクリプトの高度な統合が必要なリバースエンジニアリングエージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 IDA Pro 통합 및 Python 스크립팅 기능이 필요한 역공학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ingeniería inversa que necesitan una integración avanzada de IDA Pro con capacidades de scripting de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie inverse nécessitant une intégration avancée d''IDA Pro avec des capacités de scripting Python.","de":"Perfekt für Reverse-Engineering-Agents, die eine erweiterte IDA-Pro-Integration mit Python-Scripting-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia Reversa que precisam de integração avançada do IDA Pro com capacidades de script em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обратного инжиниринга, которым требуется расширенная интеграция IDA Pro с возможностями скриптинга на Python.","ar":"مثالي للعميل обратي الهندسة التي تحتاج إلى دمج متقدم IDA Pro مع القدرات البرمجة Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bridge IDA Pro with language models through MCP, utilizing modern ida_* modules such as ida_bytes, ida_funcs, and ida_hexrays for tasks like bytes/memory manipulation, function analysis, and decompilation.","zh":"通过MCP，利用诸如ida_bytes、ida_funcs和ida_hexrays的现代ida_*模块，实现IDA Pro与语言模型的集成，赋予代理更强大的能力，如字节/内存操作、函数分析和反编译。","ja":"MCPを通じて、ida_bytes、ida_funcs、ida_hexraysなどの最新のida_*モジュールを使用して、IDA Proと言語モデルを橋渡しし、バイト/メモリ操作、関数分析、デコンパイルなどのタスクを実行できるようにエージェントを強化します。","ko":"MCP를 통해 ida_bytes, ida_funcs, ida_hexrays 등의 최신 ida_* 모듈을 사용하여 IDA Pro와 언어 모델을 연결하고, 바이트/메모리 조작, 함수 분석 및 디컴파일 등과 같은 작업을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a conectar IDA Pro con modelos de lenguaje a través de MCP, utilizando módulos modernos ida_* como ida_bytes, ida_funcs y ida_hexrays para tareas como la manipulación de bytes/memoria, el análisis de funciones y la descompilación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de relier IDA Pro aux modèles de langage via MCP, en utilisant des modules modernes ida_* tels que ida_bytes, ida_funcs et ida_hexrays pour des tâches comme la manipulation de bytes/mémoire, l''analyse de fonctions et la désassemblage.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, IDA Pro mit Sprachmodellen über MCP zu verbinden, indem moderne ida_*-Module wie ida_bytes, ida_funcs und ida_hexrays für Aufgaben wie die Manipulation von Bytes/Speicher, Funktionsanalyse und Dekompilierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a conectar o IDA Pro com modelos de linguagem por meio do MCP, utilizando módulos ida_* modernos, como ida_bytes, ida_funcs e ida_hexrays, para tarefas como manipulação de bytes/memória, análise de funções e descompilação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью соединить IDA Pro с языковыми моделями через MCP, используя современные модули ida_*, такие как ida_bytes, ida_funcs и ida_hexrays, для задач, таких как манипуляция байтами/памятью, анализ функций и декомпиляция.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية ربط IDA Pro مع نماذج اللغة من خلال MCP، باستخدام وحدات ida_* الحديثة مثل ida_bytes و ida_funcs و ida_hexrays لأعمال مثل تعديل البايتات / الذاكرة وتحليل الوظائف وإلغاء التجميع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating reverse engineering workflows with IDAPython scripts","Analyzing binary functions using ida_funcs and ida_hexrays","Decompiling code with ida_hexrays for further analysis"],"zh":["使用IDAPython脚本自动化逆向工程工作流程","使用ida_funcs和ida_hexrays分析二进制函数","使用ida_hexrays进行代码反编译以进行进一步分析"],"ja":["IDAPythonスクリプトを使用してリバースエンジニアリングのワークフローを自動化する","ida_funcsとida_hexraysを使用してバイナリ関数を分析する","ida_hexraysを使用してコードをデコンパイルし、さらに分析する"],"ko":["IDAPython 스크립트를 사용하여 역공학 워크플로를 자동화하는こと","ida_funcs 및 ida_hexrays를 사용하여 바이너리 함수를 분석하는 것","ida_hexrays를 사용하여 코드를 디컴파일하여 추가 분석을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de ingeniería inversa con scripts de IDAPython","Analizar funciones binarias utilizando ida_funcs y ida_hexrays","Descompilar código con ida_hexrays para un análisis posterior"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''ingénierie inverse avec des scripts IDAPython","Analyser des fonctions binaires en utilisant ida_funcs et ida_hexrays","Désassembler du code avec ida_hexrays pour une analyse ultérieure"],"de":["Automatisierung von Reverse-Engineering-Workflows mit IDAPython-Skripten","Analyse von Binärfunktionen mit ida_funcs und ida_hexrays","Dekompilierung von Code mit ida_hexrays für eine weitere Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de engenharia reversa com scripts IDAPython","Analisar funções binárias usando ida_funcs e ida_hexrays","Descompilar código com ida_hexrays para análise adicional"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы обратного инжиниринга с помощью скриптов IDAPython","Анализировать бинарные функции с помощью ida_funcs и ida_hexrays","Декомпилировать код с помощью ida_hexrays для дальнейшего анализа"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل الهندسة العكسية باستخدام نصوص IDAPython","تحليل الدوال الثنائية باستخدام ida_funcs و ida_hexrays","فك التجميع للكود باستخدام ida_hexrays للتحليل الإضافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires IDA Pro installation","Python scripting knowledge necessary","Avoids legacy idc module in favor of modern ida_* modules"],"zh":["需要IDA Pro安装","需要Python脚本编写知识","避免使用遗留的idc模块，转而使用现代的ida_*模块"],"ja":["IDA Proのインストールが必要","Pythonスクリプトの知識が必要","レガシーのidcモジュールを避けて、最新のida_*モジュールを使用"],"ko":["IDA Pro 설치가 필요합니다","Python 스크립팅 지식이 필요합니다","레거시 idc 모듈을 피하고 최신 ida_* 모듈을 사용합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de IDA Pro","Conocimiento de scripting de Python necesario","Evita el módulo idc heredado en favor de módulos ida_* modernos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''IDA Pro","Connaissances de scripting Python nécessaires","Évite le module idc hérité au profit de modules ida_* modernes"],"de":["Benötigt IDA-Pro-Installation","Python-Scripting-Kenntnisse erforderlich","Vermeidet das veraltete idc-Modul zugunsten moderner ida_*-Module"],"pt":["Requer instalação do IDA Pro","Conhecimento de script em Python necessário","Evita o módulo idc legado em favor dos módulos ida_* modernos"],"ru":["Требуется установка IDA Pro","Необходимо знание скриптинга на Python","Избегает устаревшего модуля idc в пользу современных модулей ida_*"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت IDA Pro","مطلوب معرفة البرمجة بلغة Python","يتجنب وحدة idc القديمة لصالح وحدات ida_* الحديثة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"421e209611d04299458034e03d9ff214d443f5bfef0403f3ffbebf35c79c61b1","qualityScore":39}');
