state vs otros agentes de trading","instalación de atom-state","guía de configuración de atom-state"],"fr":["comment utiliser atom-state","qu''est-ce que Effect-TS","outils d''IA pour le trading","alternatives à Claude Code Agent","atom-state vs autres agents de trading","installation d''atom-state","guide de configuration d''atom-state"],"de":["wie man atom-state verwendet","was ist Effect-TS","KI-Tools für den Aktienhandel","Alternativen zu Claude Code Agent","atom-state vs andere Trading-Agenten","Installation von atom-state","Konfigurationsanleitung für atom-state"],"pt":["como usar atom-state","o que é atom-state","alternativa ao atom-state","atom-state vs outros agentes","instalar atom-state","guia de configuração do atom-state","desenvolvimento de aplicações com atom-state","atom-state para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать atom-state","что такое atom-state","альтернатива atom-state","atom-state vs другие агенты","установить atom-state","руководство по настройке atom-state","разработка приложений с atom-state","atom-state для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام atom-state","ما هو atom-state","بديل ل atom-state","atom-state مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت atom-state","دليل إعداد atom-state","تطوير التطبيقات مع atom-state","atom-state للمطورين"]}},"owner":"front-depiction","repo":"cli-stock","repoPath":"front-depiction/cli-stock","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.695Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atom-state","description":"Implement reactive state management with Effect Atom for React applications","bodyPreview":"# Effect Atom State Management\n\nEffect Atom is a reactive state management library for Effect that seamlessly integrates with React.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Atoms as References\n\nAtoms work **by reference** - they are stable containers for reactive state:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\n// Atoms are created once and referenced throughout the app\nexport const counterAtom = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Multiple components can reference the same atom\n// All update when the atom va","body":"# Effect Atom State Management\n\nEffect Atom is a reactive state management library for Effect that seamlessly integrates with React.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Atoms as References\n\nAtoms work **by reference** - they are stable containers for reactive state:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\n// Atoms are created once and referenced throughout the app\nexport const counterAtom = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Multiple components can reference the same atom\n// All update when the atom value changes\n```\n\n### Automatic Cleanup\n\nAtoms automatically reset when no subscribers remain (unless marked with `keepAlive`):\n\n```typescript\n// Resets when last subscriber unmounts\nexport const temporaryState = Atom.make(initialValue)\n\n// Persists across component lifecycles\nexport const persistentState = Atom.make(initialValue).pipe(Atom.keepAlive)\n```\n\n### Lazy Evaluation\n\nAtom values are computed on-demand when subscribers access them.\n\n## Pattern: Basic Atoms\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\n// Simple atom\nexport const count = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Atom with object state\nexport interface CartState {\n  readonly items: ReadonlyArray<Item>\n  readonly total: number\n}\n\nexport const cart = Atom.make<CartState>({\n  items: [],\n  total: 0\n})\n```\n\n## Pattern: Derived Atoms\n\nUse `Atom.map` or computed atoms with the `get` parameter:\n\n```typescript\n// Derived via map\nexport const itemCount = Atom.map(cart, (c) => c.items.length)\nexport const isEmpty = Atom.map(cart, (c) => c.items.length === 0)\n\n// Computed atom accessing other atoms\nexport const cartSummary = Atom.make((get) => {\n  const cartData = get(cart)\n  const count = get(itemCount)\n\n  return {\n    itemCount: count,\n    total: cartData.total,\n    isEmpty: count === 0\n  }\n})\n```\n\n## Pattern: Atom Family (Dynamic Atoms)\n\nUse `Atom.family` for stable references to dynamically created atoms:\n\n```typescript\n// Create atoms per entity ID\nexport const userAtoms = Atom.family((userId: string) =>\n  Atom.make<User | null>(null).pipe(Atom.keepAlive)\n)\n\n// Usage - always returns the same atom for a given ID\nconst userAtom = userAtoms(userId)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Function Atoms (Side Effects)\n\nUse `Atom.fn` for operations with side effects:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Effect } from \"effect\"\n\n// Function atom for side effects\nexport const addItem = Atom.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (item: Item) {\n    const current = yield* Atom.get(cart)\n\n    yield* Atom.set(cart, {\n      items: [...current.items, item],\n      total: current.total + item.price\n    })\n  })\n)\n\n// Clear cart operation\nexport const clearCart = Atom.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* () {\n    yield* Atom.set(cart, { items: [], total: 0 })\n  })\n)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Runtime with Services\n\nWrap Effect layers/services for use in atoms:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Layer } from \"effect\"\n\n// Create runtime with services\nexport const runtime = Atom.runtime(\n  Layer.mergeAll(\n    DatabaseService.Live,\n    LoggerService.Live,\n    ApiClient.Live\n  )\n)\n\n// Use services in function atoms\nexport const fetchUserData = runtime.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (userId: string) {\n    const db = yield* DatabaseService\n    const user = yield* db.getUser(userId)\n\n    yield* Atom.set(userAtoms(userId), user)\n    return user\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Global Layers\n\nConfigure global layers once at app initialization:\n\n```typescript\n// App setup\nAtom.runtime.addGlobalLayer(\n  Layer.mergeAll(\n    Logger.Live,\n    Tracer.Live,\n    Config.Live\n  )\n)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Result Types (Error Handling)\n\nAtoms can return `Result` types for explicit error handling:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Result from \"@effect-atom/atom/Result\"\n\nexport const userData = Atom.make<Result.Result<User, Error>>(\n  Result.initial\n)\n\n// In component\nconst result = useAtomValue(userData)\n\nResult.match(result, {\n  Initial: () => <Loading />,\n  Failure: (error) => <Error message={error.message} />,\n  Success: (user) => <UserProfile user={user} />\n})\n```\n\n## Pattern: Stream Integration\n\nConvert streams into atoms that capture the latest value:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Stream } from \"effect\"\n\n// Infinite stream becomes reactive atom\nexport const notifications = Atom.make(\n  Stream.fromEventListener(window, \"notification\").pipe(\n    Stream.map(parseNotification),\n    Stream.filter(isValid),\n    Stream.scan([], (acc, n) => [...acc, n].slice(-10))\n  )\n)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Pull Atoms (Pagination)\n\nUse `Atom.pull` for stream-based pagination:\n\n```typescript\nexport const pagedItems = Atom.pull(\n  Stream.fromIterable(itemsSource).pipe(\n    Stream.grouped(10) // Pages of 10 items\n  )\n)\n\n// In component - automatically fetches next page when called\nconst loadMore = useAtomSet(pagedItems)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Persistence\n\nUse `Atom.kvs` for persisted state:\n\n```typescript\nimport { BrowserKeyValueStore } from \"@effect/platform-browser\"\nimport * as Schema from \"effect/Schema\"\n\nexport const userSettings = Atom.kvs({\n  runtime: Atom.runtime(BrowserKeyValueStore.layerLocalStorage),\n  key: \"user-settings\",\n  schema: Schema.Struct({\n    theme: Schema.Literal(\"light\", \"dark\"),\n    notifications: Schema.Boolean,\n    language: Schema.String\n  }),\n  defaultValue: () => ({\n    theme: \"light\",\n    notifications: true,\n    language: \"en\"\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## React Integration\n\n### Hooks\n\n```typescript\nimport { useAtomValue, useAtomSet, useAtom, useAtomSetPromise } from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\nexport function CartView() {\n  // Read only\n  const cartData = useAtomValue(cart)\n  const isEmpty = useAtomValue(isEmpty)\n\n  // Write only\n  const addItem = useAtomSet(addItem)\n  const clearCart = useAtomSet(clearCart)\n\n  // Both read and write\n  const [count, setCount] = useAtom(counterAtom)\n\n  // For async function atoms\n  const fetchData = useAtomSetPromise(fetchUserData)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <div>Items: {cartData.items.length}</div>\n      <button onClick={() => addItem(newItem)}>Add</button>\n      <button onClick={() => clearCart()}>Clear</button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Separation of Concerns\n\nDifferent components can read/write the same atom reactively:\n\n```typescript\n// Component A - reads state\nfunction CartDisplay() {\n  const cart = useAtomValue(cart)\n  return <div>Items: {cart.items.length}</div>\n}\n\n// Component B - modifies state\nfunction CartActions() {\n  const addItem = useAtomSet(addItem)\n  return <button onClick={() => addItem(item)}>Add</button>\n}\n\n// Both update reactively when atom changes\n```\n\n## Scoped Resources & Finalizers\n\nAtoms support scoped effects with automatic cleanup:\n\n```typescript\nexport const wsConnection = Atom.make(\n  Effect.gen(function* () {\n    // Acquire resource\n    const ws = yield* Effect.acquireRelease(\n      connectWebSocket(),\n      (ws) => Effect.sync(() => ws.close())\n    )\n\n    return ws\n  })\n)\n\n// Finalizer runs when atom rebuilds or becomes unused\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Reference Stability**: Use `Atom.family` for dynamically generated atom sets\n2. **Lazy Evaluation**: Values computed on-demand when accessed\n3. **Automatic Cleanup**: Atoms reset when unused (unless `keepAlive`)\n4. **Derive, Don''t Coordinate**: Use computed atoms to derive state\n5. **Result Types**: Handle errors explicitly with Result.match\n6. **Services in Runtime**: Wrap layers once, use in multiple atoms\n7. **Immutable Updates**: Always create new values, never mutate\n8. **Scoped Effects**: Leverage finalizers for resource cleanup\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Loading States\n\n```typescript\nexport const userDataAtom = Atom.make<Result.Result<User, Error>>(\n  Result.initial\n)\n\nexport const loadUser = runtime.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (id: string) {\n    yield* Atom.set(userDataAtom, Result.initial)\n\n    const result = yield* Effect.either(\n      userService.fetchUser(id)\n    )\n\n    yield* Atom.set(\n      userDataAtom,\n      result._tag === \"Right\"\n        ? Result.success(result.right)\n        : Result.failure(result.left)\n    )\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Optimistic Updates\n\n```typescript\nexport const updateItem = runtime.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (id: string, updates: Partial<Item>) {\n    const current = yield* Atom.get(itemsAtom)\n\n    // Optimistic update\n    yield* Atom.set(\n      itemsAtom,\n      current.map(item => item.id === id ? { ...item, ...updates } : item)\n    )\n\n    // Persist to server\n    const result = yield* Effect.either(api.updateItem(id, updates))\n\n    // Revert on failure\n    if (result._tag === \"Left\") {\n      yield* Atom.set(itemsAtom, current)\n    }\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Computed Queries\n\n```typescript\n// Filter atom accessing other atoms\nexport const filteredItems = Atom.make((get) => {\n  const items = get(itemsAtom)\n  const searchTerm = get(searchAtom)\n  const activeFilters = get(filtersAtom)\n\n  return items.filter(item =>\n    item.name.includes(searchTerm) &&\n    activeFilters.every(f => f.predicate(item))\n  )\n})\n```\n\nEffect Atom bridges Effect''s powerful type system with React''s rendering model, providing type-safe reactive state management with automatic cleanup and seamless Effect integration.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:19.098Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for React-based AI Agents needing advanced state management capabilities with Effect-TS and Atom","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Effect-TS 和 Atom 进行高级状态管理的基于 React 的 AI 代理","ja":"React ベースの AI エージェントが Effect-TS と Atom を使用して高度な状態管理機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"Effect-TS와 Atom을 사용하여 고급 상태 관리 기능을 필요한 React 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA basados en React que necesitan capacidades de gestión de estado avanzadas con Effect-TS y Atom","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA basés sur React nécessitant des fonctionnalités de gestion d''état avancées avec Effect-TS et Atom","de":"Perfekt für auf React basierende KI-Agents, die erweiterte Statusverwaltungsfunktionen mit Effect-TS und Atom benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em React que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de estado com Effect-TS e Atom","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе React, которым необходимы расширенные возможности управления состоянием с Effect-TS и Atom","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى React الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الحالة مع Effect-TS و Atom"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage reactive state seamlessly with Effect Atom, utilizing stable containers for state and integrating with React, while enabling multiple components to reference the same atom for unified updates, all through the @effect-atom/atom-react library","zh":"赋予代理无缝管理响应状态的能力，利用 Effect Atom 和稳定的容器进行状态管理，并与 React 集成，同时允许多个组件引用同一个 Atom 进行统一更新，所有这些都通过 @effect-atom/atom-react 库实现","ja":"エージェントが Effect Atom と安定したコンテナを使用してリアクティブ状態をシームレスに管理できるようにし、React と統合して複数のコンポーネントが同じ Atom を参照して統一された更新を行うことを可能にし、すべて @effect-atom/atom-react ライブラリを通じて実現","ko":"에이전트가 Effect Atom과 안정적인 컨테이너를 사용하여 리액티브 상태를 무결점으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, React와 통합하여 여러 컴포넌트가 동일한 Atom을 참조하여 통일된 업데이트를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 모두 @effect-atom/atom-react 라이브러리를 통해 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado reactivo de forma fluida con Effect Atom, utilizando contenedores estables para el estado e integrándose con React, al mismo tiempo que permite que varios componentes hagan referencia al mismo átomo para actualizaciones unificadas, todo a través de la biblioteca @effect-atom/atom-react","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état réactif de manière fluide avec Effect Atom, en utilisant des conteneurs stables pour l''état et en s''intégrant avec React, tout en permettant à plusieurs composants de référencer le même atome pour des mises à jour unifiées, le tout via la bibliothèque @effect-atom/atom-react","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den reaktiven Status nahtlos mit Effect Atom zu verwalten, indem stabilen Containern für den Status verwendet und in React integriert werden, während gleichzeitig mehrere Komponenten auf das gleiche Atom verweisen können, um einheitliche Updates zu ermöglichen, all dies über die @effect-atom/atom-react-Bibliothek","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado reativo de forma transparente com Effect Atom, utilizando contêineres estáveis para o estado e integrando com React, permitindo que vários componentes façam referência ao mesmo átomo para atualizações unificadas, tudo por meio da biblioteca @effect-atom/atom-react","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять реактивным состоянием прозрачно с Effect Atom, используя стабильные контейнеры для состояния и интегрируя с React, позволяя нескольким компонентам ссылаться на один и тот же атом для унифицированных обновлений, все через библиотеку @effect-atom/atom-react","ar":"يمكّن العميل من إدارة الحالة التفاعلية بطريقة شفافة مع Effect Atom، باستخدام حاويات مستقرة للحالة وتكامل مع React، مما يسمح لمكونات متعددة بالإشارة إلى نفس الذرة لتحديثات موحدة، كل ذلك من خلال مكتبة @effect-atom/atom-react"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing global state across multiple components","Creating reactive state containers with Effect Atom","Integrating state management with React applications"],"zh":["跨多个组件管理全局状态","使用 Effect Atom 创建响应状态容器","将状态管理与 React 应用程序集成"],"ja":["複数のコンポーネントを跨ぐグローバル状態の管理","Effect Atom を使用したリアクティブ状態コンテナの作成","状態管理と React アプリケーションの統合"],"ko":["여러 컴포넌트에 걸친 전역 상태 관리","Effect Atom을 사용한 리액티브 상태 컨테이너 생성","상태 관리와 React 애플리케이션 통합"],"es":["Gestión de estado global en varios componentes","Creación de contenedores de estado reactivo con Effect Atom","Integración de la gestión de estado con aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Gestion de l''état global à travers plusieurs composants","Création de conteneurs d''état réactif avec Effect Atom","Intégration de la gestion d''état avec des applications React"],"de":["Verwaltung des globalen Status über mehrere Komponenten hinweg","Erstellung reaktiver Statuscontainer mit Effect Atom","Integration der Statusverwaltung in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerenciar o estado global em vários componentes","Criar contêineres de estado reativo com Effect Atom","Integrar o gerenciamento de estado com aplicações React"],"ru":["Управлять глобальным состоянием в нескольких компонентах","Создавать контейнеры реактивного состояния с Effect Atom","Интегрировать управление состоянием с приложениями React"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة العالمية عبر مكونات متعددة","إنشاء حاويات للحالة التفاعلية مع Effect Atom","تكامل إدارة الحالة مع تطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Effect-TS and React integration","Limited to applications using the @effect-atom/atom-react library"],"zh":["需要 Effect-TS 和 React 集成","仅限于使用 @effect-atom/atom-react 库的应用程序"],"ja":["Effect-TS と React の統合が必要","@effect-atom/atom-react ライブラリを使用するアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["Effect-TS와 React 통합이 필요","@effect-atom/atom-react 라이브러리를 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración de Effect-TS y React","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan la biblioteca @effect-atom/atom-react"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de Effect-TS et React","Limité aux applications utilisant la bibliothèque @effect-atom/atom-react"],"de":["Benötigt die Integration von Effect-TS und React","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die die @effect-atom/atom-react-Bibliothek verwenden"],"pt":["Requer integração com Effect-TS e React","Limitado a aplicações que utilizam a biblioteca @effect-atom/atom-react"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Effect-TS и React","Ограничен для приложений, использующих библиотеку @effect-atom/atom-react"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع Effect-TS و React","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم مكتبة @effect-atom/atom-react"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"465daa37e8de1a2ceb4dc72fef11571863c5de1f5708c7f5ba49c7164bfb3b83","qualityScore":39}');
