"Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Orchestration élastique pour MCP Gateway","Gestion simplifiée des modèles de contexte","Conception légère et flexible","Mise en œuvre simple et rapide","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Elastische Orchestrierung für MCP Gateway","Vereinfachte Verwaltung von Kontextmodellen","Leichtes und flexibles Design","Einfache und schnelle Implementierung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Orquestração elástica para servidores de protocolo de contexto de modelo","Melhoria da eficiência do projeto","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Эластичная оркестрация для серверов протокола контекста модели","Повышение эффективности проекта","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Поддержка нескольких сред","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["توجيه مرن لخادم بروتوكول سياق النموذج","تحسين كفاءة المشروع","إدماج مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم بيئات متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","轻量级弹性编排器","Model Context Protocol Servers","MCP Gateway","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","軽量Elastic Orchestrator","Model Context Protocol Servers","MCP Gateway","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","경량 Elastic Orchestrator","모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜 서버","MCP Gateway","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de ai","orquestrador elástico","MCP Gateway","cómo usar Project Overview","qué es un orquestador elástico","Project Overview alternativa","instalación de Project Overview","guía de configuración de Project Overview"],"fr":["outils d''ia","orchestrateur élastique","MCP Gateway","comment utiliser Project Overview","qu''est-ce qu''un orchestrateur élastique","alternative à Project Overview","installation de Project Overview","guide de configuration de Project Overview"],"de":["ki-tools","elastischer orchester","MCP Gateway","wie man Project Overview verwendet","was ist ein elastischer orchester","alternative zu Project Overview","installation von Project Overview","konfigurationsanleitung für Project Overview"],"pt":["como usar MCP Gateway","o que é MCP Gateway","MCP Gateway vs outros orquestradores","guia de instalação do MCP Gateway","configuração do MCP Gateway","MCP Gateway para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать MCP Шлюз","что такое MCP Шлюз","MCP Шлюз vs другие оркестраторы","руководство по установке MCP Шлюза","настройка MCP Шлюза","MCP Шлюз для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام MCP Gateway","ما هو MCP Gateway","MCP Gateway مقابل أوركستراتور آخر","دليل تثبيت MCP Gateway","تكوين MCP Gateway","MCP Gateway للمطورين"]}},"owner":"wibus-wee","repo":"mcpv","repoPath":"wibus-wee/mcpv","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.713Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-overview","description":"Provides comprehensive overview of mcpd project architecture, capabilities, and key technical details. Use when understanding the project structure, architecture layers, or core concepts.","bodyPreview":"# mcpd Project Overview\n\n**mcpd** is an elastic control plane and runtime for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. It provides on-demand startup, scale-to-zero hibernation, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering for managing multiple MCP servers locally.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n- Elastic runtime with automatic instance lifecycle management\n- Unified gateway (`mcpvmcp`) providing single entry point for all MCP servers\n- Smart SubAgent powered by CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware tool filte","body":"# mcpd Project Overview\n\n**mcpd** is an elastic control plane and runtime for Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. It provides on-demand startup, scale-to-zero hibernation, unified routing, and intelligent tool filtering for managing multiple MCP servers locally.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\n- Elastic runtime with automatic instance lifecycle management\n- Unified gateway (`mcpvmcp`) providing single entry point for all MCP servers\n- Smart SubAgent powered by CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware tool filtering\n- GUI support (`mcpvui`) built with Wails 3 for configuration and monitoring\n- Profile-based configuration with tag-based visibility\n- Native observability with Prometheus metrics and Grafana dashboards\n\n## Architecture\n\nThree-layer architecture for maximum decoupling:\n\n1. **Core (`mcpv`)**: Central control plane managing instance lifecycles, scheduling, and aggregation\n2. **Gateway (`mcpvmcp`)**: Protocol bridge acting as standard MCP server for AI clients\n3. **App (`mcpvui`)**: Wails-driven GUI for configuration, monitoring, and core lifecycle hosting\n\n### Internal Structure\n\n- `internal/domain/`: Domain models and interfaces (ServerSpec, Instance, Transport, Scheduler, Router, etc.)\n- `internal/app/`: Application glue layer with explicit subpackages:\n  - `controlplane/`: Control plane facade, registry/discovery/observability/automation, reload application\n  - `bootstrap/`: Bootstrap and server initialization management\n  - `catalog/`: Catalog providers and state loading\n  - `runtime/`: Runtime indexes and aggregation state\n- `internal/infra/`: Infrastructure adapters organized by concern:\n  - `catalog/`: Configuration loading and validation\n  - `scheduler/`: Instance lifecycle and capacity constraints coordination\n  - `lifecycle/`: Instance startup, handshake, and shutdown management\n  - `router/`: Request routing to managed MCP server instances\n  - `transport/`: stdio and streamable HTTP transport implementations\n  - `aggregator/`: Tool/resource/prompt aggregation and indexing\n  - `gateway/`: MCP gateway client manager and registry\n  - `subagent/`: Eino-based intelligent tool filtering\n  - `telemetry/`: Prometheus metrics and health checks\n  - `rpc/`: gRPC server and client for core-gateway communication\n- `internal/ui/`: Wails bridge layer exposing core functionality to GUI\n\n## Configuration\n\nConfiguration is YAML-based with a single file per profile. See `docs/catalog.example.yaml` or `runtime.yaml` for reference.\n\n**Key Configuration Sections**:\n- `servers[]`: MCP server definitions with transport, command, tags, lifecycle settings\n- `subAgent`: Eino-based tool filtering configuration (model, provider, API key, enabled tags)\n- `observability`: Prometheus metrics endpoint configuration\n- `rpc`: gRPC server configuration for core-gateway communication\n- Runtime settings: timeouts, concurrency limits, retry policies, bootstrap behavior\n\n**Server Configuration Example**:\n```yaml\nservers:\n  - name: my-server\n    transport: stdio\n    cmd: [node, ./path/to/server.js]\n    tags: [chat]\n    idleSeconds: 60\n    maxConcurrent: 1\n    strategy: stateless\n    activationMode: on-demand\n    protocolVersion: \"2025-11-25\"\n```\n\n**Profile System**:\n- Multiple profiles supported with caller-to-profile mapping\n- Default profile used as fallback\n- Tag-based visibility: clients see only servers matching their tags\n\n## Transport Types and Activation Modes\n\n### Transport Types\n\n**stdio** (most common):\n- Launches subprocess and communicates via stdin/stdout\n- Suitable for Node.js, Python, and other scripting languages\n- Process lifecycle managed by mcpv\n\n**streamable_http**:\n- Connects to HTTP endpoint with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming\n- Suitable for long-running HTTP services\n- No process management needed\n\n**composite**:\n- Advanced use case combining multiple transports\n- Rarely needed\n\n### Activation Modes\n\n**on-demand** (default):\n- Instances start when first request arrives\n- Ideal for resource efficiency\n- Cold start latency on first request\n\n**always-on**:\n- Keeps `minReady` instances running at all times\n- Use for latency-sensitive servers\n- Higher resource usage\n\n**disabled**:\n- Server defined but not activated\n- Useful for testing or staged rollouts\n\n### Server Strategies\n\n**stateless**:\n- Requests can be routed to any available instance\n- Instances can be freely started/stopped\n- Most common and efficient\n\n**stateful**:\n- Router maintains sticky sessions\n- Requests from same client go to same instance\n- Session expires after client inactivity timeout\n\n### Gateway Behavior\n\nThe `mcpvmcp` gateway:\n- Registers with core on startup via gRPC\n- Maintains persistent connection to core\n- Translates MCP JSON-RPC to core''s internal protocol\n- Handles tool/resource/prompt aggregation\n- Supports both single-server and tag-based modes\n\n### Flags\n\n- `--config`: Specify config directory (default: current directory)\n- `--rpc`: Override RPC address for gateway\n- `--tag`: Filter servers by tag in gateway mode\n- `--server`: Single-server mode for gateway\n\n## Key Technical Details\n\n### Hot Reload\n\nThe core watches the config directory for changes and automatically reloads:\n- Server spec additions/removals\n- Configuration updates\n- Profile changes\n- Active instances are gracefully drained before applying changes\n\n### Concurrency Control\n\n- `maxConcurrent`: Maximum parallel requests per instance\n- `minReady`: Minimum instances to keep warm\n- Scheduler spawns new instances when capacity is reached\n- Instances are reused across requests (connection pooling)\n\n### Tool Namespace Strategy\n\nTo avoid tool name collisions across servers:\n- **prefix**: Tools named as `server__toolname` (default)\n- **suffix**: Tools named as `toolname__server`\n\n### Bootstrap Modes\n\n- **metadata**: Only fetch server metadata (tools/resources/prompts) on startup\n- **full**: Perform full initialization including handshake\n- **none**: Skip bootstrap entirely\n\n### Scale-to-Zero Runtime\n\nInstances are launched on-demand and shut down after idle timeout:\n- Scheduler manages instance pools with concurrency limits\n- Router maintains session affinity for stateful servers\n- Lifecycle manager handles startup, handshake, and graceful shutdown\n- Probe system monitors instance health\n\n### Tool Aggregation\n\nThe aggregator maintains a unified index across all active instances:\n- Automatic refresh on `list_changed` notifications\n- Concurrent refresh workers with rate limiting\n- Namespace strategy (prefix or suffix) to avoid tool name collisions\n- Supports tools, resources, and prompts\n\n## Version Information\n\n- **Go**: 1.25+\n- **Wails**: 3.0.0-alpha.53\n- **MCP SDK**: github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk v1.2.0\n- **Eino**: github.com/cloudwego/eino v0.7.15\n- **Prometheus**: github.com/prometheus/client_golang v1.23.2\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **MCP Specification**: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/\n- **Wails Documentation**: https://wails.io/\n- **Wire Documentation**: https://github.com/google/wire\n- **CloudWeGo Eino**: https://github.com/cloudwego/eino\n- **Frontend Guide**: See `frontend/CLAUDE.md` for React/TypeScript frontend development\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:45:52.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing lightweight elastic orchestration for Model Context Protocol servers","zh":"适用于需要轻量级弹性编排的Model Context Protocol服务器的AI代理","ja":"Model Context Protocolサーバーに軽量なエラスティックオーケストレーションが必要なAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Model Context Protocol 서버에 경량 엘라스틱 오케스트레이션이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan orquestación elástica ligera para servidores de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une orchestration élastique légère pour les serveurs de protocole de contexte de modèle","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine leichte elastische Orchestrierung für Model Context Protocol-Server benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de orquestração elástica leve para servidores do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется легкая эластичная оркестрация для серверов Протокола контекста модели","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق مرن خفيف لخادم بروتوكول سياق النموذج"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple MCP servers locally with unified routing, intelligent tool filtering, and elastic runtime capabilities using the Model Context Protocol and CloudWeGo/Eino for context-aware operations","zh":"赋予代理管理多个MCP服务器的能力，具有统一的路由、智能工具过滤和弹性运行时能力，使用Model Context Protocol和CloudWeGo/Eino进行上下文感知操作","ja":"エージェントに複数のMCPサーバーをローカルで管理する機能を与え、統一されたルーティング、インテリジェントなツールフィルタリング、エラスティックなランタイム能力を提供し、Model Context ProtocolとCloudWeGo/Einoを使用したコンテキスト認識操作を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 로컬에서 여러 MCP 서버를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 통일된 라우팅, 지능형 툴 필터링 및 엘라스틱 런타임 기능을 제공하며, Model Context Protocol 및 CloudWeGo/Eino를 사용하여 컨텍스트 인식 작동을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples servidores MCP de forma local con enrutamiento unificado, filtrado de herramientas inteligentes y capacidades de tiempo de ejecución elásticas utilizando el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo y CloudWeGo/Eino para operaciones conscientes del contexto","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs serveurs MCP localement avec un routage unifié, un filtrage d''outils intelligent et des capacités de runtime élastiques en utilisant le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle et CloudWeGo/Eino pour des opérations sensibles au contexte","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, mehrere MCP-Server lokal mit einheitlicher Routing, intelligenter Werkzeugfilterung und elastischer Laufzeitfähigkeiten zu verwalten, indem sie das Model Context Protocol und CloudWeGo/Eino für kontextbewusste Operationen verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar vários servidores MCP localmente com roteamento unificado, filtragem de ferramentas inteligentes e capacidades de tempo de execução elástico usando o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo e CloudWeGo/Eino para operações de conscientização de contexto","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять несколькими серверами MCP на локальном уровне с помощью унифицированного маршрутизации, интеллектуальной фильтрации инструментов и эластичных возможностей runtime с использованием Протокола контекста модели и CloudWeGo/Eino для контекстно-зависимых операций","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إدارةخوادم متعددة MCP محليًا مع التوجيه الموحد وتصفية الأدوات الذكية وقدرات وقت التشغيل المرن باستخدام بروتوكول سياق النموذج و CloudWeGo/Eino من أجل عمليات متأثرة بالسياق"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating on-demand startup and scale-to-zero hibernation for MCP servers","Unifying gateway management for multiple MCP servers","Intelligently filtering tools for context-aware MCP server operations"],"zh":["自动化MCP服务器的按需启动和缩放至零休眠","统一多个MCP服务器的网关管理","智能过滤工具以进行上下文感知的MCP服务器操作"],"ja":["MCPサーバーの需要に応じた起動とゼロスケール化の休眠を自動化する","複数のMCPサーバーのゲートウェイ管理を統一する","コンテキスト認識操作のためのツールのインテリジェントなフィルタリング"],"ko":["MCP 서버의 수요에 따른 시작 및 제로 스케일링 휴면 자동화","여러 MCP 서버의 게이트웨이 관리를 통일","컨텍스트 인식 작동을 위한 툴의 지능형 필터링"],"es":["Automatizar el inicio y la hibernación a escala cero a demanda para servidores MCP","Unificar la gestión de puertas de enlace para múltiples servidores MCP","Filtrar inteligentemente herramientas para operaciones de servidores MCP conscientes del contexto"],"fr":["Automatiser le démarrage et l''hibernation à l''échelle zéro à la demande pour les serveurs MCP","Unifier la gestion des passerelles pour plusieurs serveurs MCP","Filtrer intelligemment les outils pour les opérations de serveurs MCP sensibles au contexte"],"de":["Automatisieren des Startups und der Skalierung auf Null bei Bedarf für MCP-Server","Vereinheitlichen der Gateway-Verwaltung für mehrere MCP-Server","Intelligent filtern von Werkzeugen für kontextbewusste MCP-Server-Operationen"],"pt":["Automatizar inicialização sob demanda e hibernação de escala zero para servidores MCP","Unificar gerenciamento de gateway para vários servidores MCP","Filtrar ferramentas inteligentemente para operações de servidor MCP cientes de contexto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запуск по требованию и спящее состояние масштабирования до нуля для серверов MCP","Унифицировать управление шлюзом для нескольких серверов MCP","Интеллектуально фильтровать инструменты для контекстно-зависимых операций сервера MCP"],"ar":["تحسين تشغيل الطلب والاستيطان بالصفر لخادم MCP","توحيد إدارة البوابة لخادم MCP متعددة","تصفية أدوات ذكية لعمليات خادم MCP متأثرة بالسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local MCP server setup","Dependent on CloudWeGo/Eino for smart SubAgent functionality"],"zh":["需要本地MCP服务器设置","依赖于CloudWeGo/Eino进行智能SubAgent功能"],"ja":["ローカルのMCPサーバー設定が必要","スマートSubAgent機能のためにCloudWeGo/Einoに依存する"],"ko":["로컬 MCP 서버 설정이 필요","스마트 SubAgent 기능을 위해 CloudWeGo/Eino에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración local de servidor MCP","Dependiente de CloudWeGo/Eino para la funcionalidad inteligente de SubAgent"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration locale de serveur MCP","Dépendant de CloudWeGo/Eino pour la fonctionnalité intelligente de SubAgent"],"de":["Benötigt lokale MCP-Server-Konfiguration","Abhängig von CloudWeGo/Eino für intelligente SubAgent-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer configuração de servidor MCP local","Dependente de CloudWeGo/Eino para funcionalidade inteligente de SubAgente"],"ru":["Требует локальной настройки сервера MCP","Зависит от CloudWeGo/Eino для интеллектуальной функциональности SubAgente"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم MCP محلي","يعتمد على CloudWeGo/Eino للوظيفة الذكية ل SubAgente"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4ef9270502ad0f209e185d37768b86c1934df28629f399d71b654274b2929209","qualityScore":39}');
