ilisateur","Personnalisation de l''édition de copie en fonction des besoins du site web","Analyse de performance du contenu édité"],"de":["Automatische Copyedit-Funktion","Optimierung von Inhalten für Suchmaschinen","Integration mit KI-Agents für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung","Anpassung der Copyedit-Funktion an die Bedürfnisse der Website","Leistungsanalyse des editierten Inhalts"],"pt":["Edição de conteúdo personalizado","Revisão de precisão e clareza","Integração com sites pessoais","Ferramenta de IA para melhorar a qualidade do conteúdo","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo"],"ru":["Пользовательская редакция контента","Проверка точности и ясности","Интеграция с личными сайтами","Инструмент ИИ для улучшения качества контента","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов"],"ar":["تحرير المحتوى المخصص","مراجعة الدقة والوضوح","التكامل مع المواقع الشخصية","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين جودة المحتوى","دعم عدة صيغ للملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用copyedit","什么是AI智能编辑","copyedit替代品","copyedit与其他编辑工具比较","copyedit安装","copyedit设置指南","AI编辑工具","个人网站优化"],"ja":["copyeditの使い方","AIエージェントとは","copyeditの代替","copyeditと他の編集ツールの比較","copyeditのインストール","copyeditの設定ガイド","AI編集ツール","個人サイトの最適化"],"ko":["copyedit 사용법","AI 에이전트란","copyedit 대안","copyedit와 다른 편집 도구 비교","copyedit 설치","copyedit 설정 가이드","AI 편집 도구","개인 웹사이트 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de edición de copia","qué es un Agente de IA","herramientas de edición de copia para sitios web personales","Agentes de IA para la edición de copia","guía de instalación de herramientas de edición de copia","mejores prácticas para la edición de copia en sitios web","herramientas de edición de copia alternativas","herramientas de edición de copia vs competidores"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils de copie édités","qu''est-ce qu''un outil d''IA","outils de copie édités pour les sites web personnels","outils d''IA pour l''édition de copie","guide d''installation des outils de copie édités","meilleures pratiques pour l''édition de copie sur les sites web","outils de copie édités alternatifs","outils de copie édités vs concurrents"],"de":["wie man Copyedit-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Copyedit-Tools für persönliche Websites","KI-Agents für die Copyedit-Funktion","Installationsanleitung für Copyedit-Tools","beste Praktiken für die Copyedit-Funktion auf Websites","Copyedit-Tools-Alternativen","Copyedit-Tools vs Wettbewerber"],"pt":["como usar copyedit","o que é copyedit","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","copyedit alternative","copyedit vs grammarly","instalar copyedit","guia de configuração do copyedit"],"ru":["как использовать copyedit","что такое copyedit","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы copyedit","copyedit vs grammarly","установить copyedit","руководство по настройке copyedit"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Copyedit","ما هو Copyedit","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل Copyedit","Copyedit مقابل Grammarly","تثبيت Copyedit","دليل إعداد Copyedit"]}},"owner":"agude","repo":"agude.github.io","repoPath":"agude/agude.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.719Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copyedit","description":"Edit blog posts and book reviews. Use `/copyedit grammar` for spelling/grammar only, or `/copyedit polish` for fuller editing. Preserves the authors voice and style.","bodyPreview":"# Copyedit Skill\n\nEdit drafts for alexgude.com while preserving voice and style.\n\n## Usage\n\n- `/copyedit grammar` --- Fix only spelling, grammar, and punctuation. Change nothing else.\n- `/copyedit polish` --- Fix errors, improve clarity, reword for coherence. Preserve voice.\n\nIf no mode is specified, ask which mode to use.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Grammar Mode\n\nFix ONLY:\n- Spelling errors\n- Grammar mistakes (subject-verb agreement, tense consistency)\n- Punctuation errors\n- Typos\n\n### Polish Mode\n\nF","body":"# Copyedit Skill\n\nEdit drafts for alexgude.com while preserving voice and style.\n\n## Usage\n\n- `/copyedit grammar` --- Fix only spelling, grammar, and punctuation. Change nothing else.\n- `/copyedit polish` --- Fix errors, improve clarity, reword for coherence. Preserve voice.\n\nIf no mode is specified, ask which mode to use.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Grammar Mode\n\nFix ONLY:\n- Spelling errors\n- Grammar mistakes (subject-verb agreement, tense consistency)\n- Punctuation errors\n- Typos\n\n### Polish Mode\n\nFollow this prompt:\n> Fix errors, make it clearer. Reword to make the arguments and sentences more coherent. Use the same sort of words I''m using, don''t substitute fancy synonyms. Maintain my voice.\n\nYou may:\n- Fix all grammar/spelling issues\n- Restructure sentences for clarity\n- Improve flow between ideas\n- Cut unnecessary words\n\nYou must:\n- Preserve the author''s vocabulary---don''t upgrade \"good\" to \"exceptional\"\n- Keep the same level of formality\n- Maintain opinions and judgments as written\n- Preserve all Liquid tags and formatting exactly\n\n## Output Format\n\n**Add the edited copy to the bottom of the article, separated by a markdown HR break.**\n\nFor grammar mode, just change in place, and also list the changes made so the author can review them.\n\n## Voice & Style Guide\n\nSee [references/STYLE.md](references/STYLE.md) for the complete style guide.\n\nKey points:\n- **Tone**: First-person, conversational but substantive, direct and opinionated\n- **Vocabulary**: Simple, direct words. \"great\", \"fun\", \"loved\"---not \"exceptional\", \"delightful\", \"adored\"\n- **Hedging**: Avoid. Say \"I didn''t like it\" not \"I perhaps didn''t fully appreciate it\"\n- **Em-dashes**: Do NOT add em-dashes. LLMs overuse them. Only keep existing ones if appropriate.\n- **Contractions**: Use naturally, don''t insert needlessly.\n- **Oxford comma**: Yes\n\n### Anti-patterns (never do these)\n\n- Don''t add too many em-dashes (---)\n- Don''t add emojis\n- Don''t add exclamation marks unless the original has them\n- Don''t use \"delve\", \"tapestry\", \"nuanced\", \"compelling\"\n- Don''t add hedging words (\"perhaps\", \"somewhat\", \"rather\")\n- Don''t make it sound more formal or academic\n- Don''t add superlatives or intensifiers\n- Don''t stack comma-separated adjectives (\"brutal, high-stakes\", \"dark, gritty\"). Pick one.\n\n## Book Review Structure\n\nSee [references/BOOK-REVIEWS.md](references/BOOK-REVIEWS.md) for details on book review structure.\n\nKey constraints:\n- **First paragraph**: Uses `{{ page.title }}`, `{{ page.book_authors }}`, etc. No custom plugin tags. This paragraph is pulled out for social media previews, so it must stand alone.\n- **After first paragraph**: `{% capture %}` blocks define template variables, then prose continues using those variables.\n- **Paragraph 2 transition**: The challenge is prose flow---don''t repeat too much of what paragraph 1 just said. Find a new angle or continue the thought. Generally the author has already tried to do this but help them a bit.\n- **References to other works**: These create backlinks, so mentioning other books/authors is encouraged, but again the author will have filled in most of these. You may suggest others.\n\n## Plugin Reference\n\nSee [references/PLUGINS.md](references/PLUGINS.md) for the full plugin reference.\n\nCommon tags you''ll encounter:\n- `{% book_link \"Title\" %}` --- link to a book\n- `{% author_link \"Name\" %}` --- link to an author (supports `possessive`, `link_text=`)\n- `{% series_link \"Series\" %}` --- link to a series\n- `{% capture var %}...{% endcapture %}` --- define reusable variables\n\nDo not modify these tags. Preserve them exactly as written.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:50:21.560Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing advanced text refinement capabilities, such as Claude Code or AutoGPT, to enhance content quality.","zh":"非常适合需要高级文本精炼能力的语言代理，例如 Claude Code 或 AutoGPT，以提高内容质量。","ja":"Claude Code または AutoGPT などの高度なテキスト精製機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適で、コンテンツの品質を向上させることができます。","ko":"클라우드 코드 또는 오토지피티와 같은 언어 에이전트가 고급 텍스트 정련 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합하여 콘텐츠의 품질을 향상시킬 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de refinamiento de texto avanzadas, como Claude Code o AutoGPT, para mejorar la calidad del contenido.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités de raffinement de texte avancées, comme Claude Code ou AutoGPT, pour améliorer la qualité du contenu.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die erweiterte Textverfeinerungsfunktionen wie Claude Code oder AutoGPT benötigen, um die Inhaltsqualität zu verbessern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de refinamento de texto, como Claude Code ou AutoGPT, para melhorar a qualidade do conteúdo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности уточнения текста, такие как Claude Code или AutoGPT, для улучшения качества контента.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة بحاجة إلى قدرات تعديل متقدمة للنص، مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT، لتحسين جودة المحتوى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refine text with precision, fixing spelling, grammar, and punctuation errors, and improving clarity and coherence while preserving the author''s voice, utilizing modes like grammar and polish to tailor the editing process.","zh":"赋予代理以精确的方式修订文本，纠正拼写、语法和标点错误，并在保留作者声音的同时提高清晰度和连贯性，利用语法和抛光等模式来定制编辑过程。","ja":"エージェントにテキストを精密に修正する力を与え、スペル、文法、句読点などのミスを修正し、著者の声を保ちつつ、明確性と一貫性を向上させ、文法や磨き上げなどのモードを利用して編集プロセスをカスタマイズする。","ko":"에이전트가 정밀한 방법으로 텍스트를 수정할 수 있게 해주며, 철자, 문법 및 구두점 오류를 수정하고, 작가의 목소리를 보존하면서 명확성과 일관성을 향상시키고, 문법 및 다듬기와 같은 모드를 사용하여 편집 프로세스를 사용자 정의합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refinar el texto con precisión, corrigiendo errores de ortografía, gramática y puntuación, y mejorando la claridad y coherencia mientras se preserva la voz del autor, utilizando modos como gramática y pulido para personalizar el proceso de edición.","fr":"Permet aux agents de raffiner le texte avec précision, en corrigeant les fautes d''orthographe, de grammaire et de ponctuation, et en améliorant la clarté et la cohérence tout en préservant la voix de l''auteur, en utilisant des modes tels que la grammaire et le polissage pour personnaliser le processus d''édition.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Text mit Präzision zu verfeinern, indem sie Rechtschreib-, Grammatik- und Zeichensetzungsfehler korrigieren und Klarheit und Kohärenz verbessern, während die Stimme des Autors erhalten bleibt, wobei Modi wie Grammatik und Polieren verwendet werden, um den Editierprozess anzupassen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refinar o texto com precisão, corrigindo erros de ortografia, gramática e pontuação, e melhorando a clareza e a coerência, preservando a voz do autor, utilizando modos como gramática e polimento para personalizar o processo de edição.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью уточнять текст с точностью, исправляя ошибки в правописании, грамматике и пунктуации, и улучшая ясность и связность, сохраняя голос автора, используя режимы, такие как грамматика и полировка, для адаптации процесса редактирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تعديل النص بدقة، وتصحيح الأخطاء الإملائية والنحوية والوضعية، وتحسين الوضوح والاتساق، مع الحفاظ على صوت الكاتب، واستخدام أوضاع مثل القواعد والنعمة لتعديل عملية التحرير."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining draft articles for publication","Polishing website content for clarity","Correcting grammar and punctuation in user-generated text"],"zh":["为出版而修订草稿文章","为清晰度而润色网站内容","纠正用户生成文本中的语法和标点错误"],"ja":["出版用の下書き記事の修正","明確性のためにウェブサイトコンテンツの磨き上げ","ユーザー生成テキストの文法と句読点のミスの修正"],"ko":["발행을 위해 초안 기사를 다듬는 것","명확성을 위해 웹사이트 콘텐츠를 다듬는 것","사용자 생성 텍스트의 문법 및 구두점 오류 수정"],"es":["Refinar artículos de borrador para publicación","Pulir contenido de sitios web para claridad","Corregir gramática y puntuación en texto generado por el usuario"],"fr":["Raffiner les articles de brouillon pour publication","Polir le contenu des sites Web pour la clarté","Corriger la grammaire et la ponctuation dans le texte généré par l''utilisateur"],"de":["Verfeinern von Entwurfsartikeln für die Veröffentlichung","Polieren von Website-Inhalten für Klarheit","Korrigieren von Grammatik und Zeichensetzung in benutzergeneriertem Text"],"pt":["Refinamento de artigos de rascunho para publicação","Polimento de conteúdo de sites para clareza","Correção de gramática e pontuação em texto gerado pelo usuário"],"ru":["Уточнение черновиков статей для публикации","Полировка контента сайтов для ясности","Исправление грамматики и пунктуации в тексте, сгенерированном пользователем"],"ar":["تعديل مسودات المقالات للنشر","تنعيم محتوى الموقع للوضوح","تصحيح القواعد والنقاط في النص المولّد من قبل المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear input text","Limited to two editing modes: grammar and polish","Preserves original voice and style, which may limit drastic content changes"],"zh":["需要清晰的输入文本","仅限两种编辑模式：语法和抛光","保留原始声音和风格，这可能会限制剧烈的内容更改"],"ja":["明確な入力テキストが必要","編集モードは文法と磨き上げの2つのみ","オリジナルの声とスタイルを保つため、激しいコンテンツの変更が制限される"],"ko":["명확한 입력 텍스트가 필요함","편집 모드가 문법 및 다듬기 2가지로만 제한됨","원래的声音 및 스타일을 보존하므로, 극적인 콘텐츠 변경이 제한될 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere texto de entrada claro","Limitado a dos modos de edición: gramática y pulido","Preserva la voz y el estilo original, lo que puede limitar los cambios de contenido drásticos"],"fr":["Nécessite du texte d''entrée clair","Limité à deux modes d''édition : grammaire et polissage","Préserve la voix et le style d''origine, ce qui peut limiter les changements de contenu drastiques"],"de":["Benötigt klaren Eingabetext","Begrenzt auf zwei Editiermodi: Grammatik und Polieren","Bewahrt die ursprüngliche Stimme und den Stil, was drastische Inhaltsänderungen einschränken kann"],"pt":["Requer texto de entrada claro","Limitado a dois modos de edição: gramática e polimento","Preserva a voz e o estilo originais, o que pode limitar mudanças drásticas no conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует четкого входного текста","Ограничен двумя режимами редактирования: грамматика и полировка","Сохраняет оригинальный голос и стиль, что может ограничить радикальные изменения контента"],"ar":["يتطلب نصًا واضحًا","محدود بنمطي التحرير: القواعد والنعمة","الحفاظ على الصوت والأسلوب الأصليين، مما قد يقيد التغييرات الجذرية في المحتوى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"116a4e46c699c7424195a8106c4500e9c509fdc37d51a0721d9663606f7dc975","qualityScore":39}');
