erts."},"features":{"zh":["轻量级验证器监控","实时性能和奖励跟踪","Telegram机器人集成","mini-app界面","实时警报和通知"],"ja":["軽量バリデーターモニター","リアルタイムのパフォーマンスと報酬の追跡","Telegramボットの統合","mini-appインターフェース","リアルタイムのアラートと通知"],"ko":["경량 검증자 모니터","실시간 성능과 보상 추적","Telegram 봇 통합","мини 앱 인터페이스","실시간 경고와 알림"],"es":["Indexer para la cadena de faros","API para acceso a datos","Bot de Telegram para notificaciones","Monitoreo de rendimiento de validadores","Alertas en tiempo real"],"fr":["Indexer pour la chaîne de balises","API pour accéder aux données","Bot Telegram pour les notifications","Surveillance des performances des validateurs","Alertes en temps réel"],"de":["Indexer für die Leuchtturmkette","API für den Zugriff auf Daten","Telegram-Bot für Benachrichtigungen","Überwachung der Validatorenleistung","Echtzeit-Alarme"],"pt":["Monitoramento em tempo real da cadeia de beacon","Indexer e API para informações precisas","Bot do Telegram para notificações instantâneas","Desempenho e recompensas em tempo real","Solução leve e escalável"],"ru":["Мониторинг бекон-чейна в реальном времени","Индексер и API для точной информации","Telegram-бот для мгновенных уведомлений","Производительность и вознаграждения в реальном времени","Легкое и масштабируемое решение"],"ar":["مراقبة سلسلة البكون في الوقت الفعلي","محدد موقع وواجهة برمجة تطبيقات للمعلومات الدقيقة","бот تلجرام للتنبيهات الفورية","الأداء والمرتبات في الوقت الفعلي","حل خفيف وقابل للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["github-issue AI工具","验证器监控","实时警报","Telegram机器人","mini-app","github-issue教程","github-issue安装","github-issue替代品"],"ja":["github-issue AIエージェント","バリデーターモニター","リアルタイムアラート","Telegramボット","mini-app","github-issueチュートリアル","github-issueインストール","github-issueの代替"],"ko":["github-issue AI 에이전트","검증자 모니터","실시간 경고","Telegram 봇","mini-app","github-issue 튜토리얼","github-issue 설치","github-issue 대안"],"es":["herramientas de ai","github-issue","validadores de cadena de faros","cómo usar github-issue","alternativas a github-issue","github-issue vs otros validadores","instalación de github-issue","guía de configuración de github-issue"],"fr":["outils d''ia","github-issue","validateurs de chaîne de balises","comment utiliser github-issue","alternatives à github-issue","github-issue vs autres validateurs","installation de github-issue","guide de configuration de github-issue"],"de":["ki-tools","github-issue","validatoren für leuchtturmkette","wie man github-issue verwendet","alternativen zu github-issue","github-issue vs andere validatoren","installation von github-issue","konfigurationsanleitung für github-issue"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","github issue","monitoramento de cadeia de beacon","indexer e API","bot do telegram","desempenho em tempo real","recompensas em tempo real","solução leve e escalável","como usar github issue","o que é github issue"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","github issue","мониторинг бекон-чейна","индексер и API","Telegram-бот","производительность в реальном времени","вознаграждения в реальном времени","легкое и масштабируемое решение","как использовать github issue","что такое github issue"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","github issue","مراقبة سلسلة البكون","محدد موقع وواجهة برمجة تطبيقات","бот تلجرام","الأداء في الوقت الفعلي","المرتبات في الوقت الفعلي","حل خفيف وقابل للتوسيع","كيفية استخدام github issue","ما هي github issue"]}},"owner":"NodeSentinel","repo":"beacon-chain-validators-monitor","repoPath":"NodeSentinel/beacon-chain-validators-monitor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.722Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-issue","description":"Use when creating GitHub issues, breaking down work into issues, or when asked to file a bug report or feature request","bodyPreview":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\nCreate focused, self-contained GitHub issues that an external contributor could implement without additional context.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nWork requested\n    │\n    ▼\nSingle clear goal? ──yes──> Create single issue\n    │\n    no\n    │\n    ▼\nSpans multiple layers? ──yes──> Create epic with sub-issues\n```\n\n## Scope Boundaries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Stick to what was requested.** Create issues ONLY for the requested feature. Do NOT expand into adjacent features.\n\nWhen Feature X dep","body":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\nCreate focused, self-contained GitHub issues that an external contributor could implement without additional context.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nWork requested\n    │\n    ▼\nSingle clear goal? ──yes──> Create single issue\n    │\n    no\n    │\n    ▼\nSpans multiple layers? ──yes──> Create epic with sub-issues\n```\n\n## Scope Boundaries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Stick to what was requested.** Create issues ONLY for the requested feature. Do NOT expand into adjacent features.\n\nWhen Feature X depends on Feature Y:\n\n- Create minimal stub for Y (just enough to unblock X)\n- ASK user if they want a separate epic for Y\n\n**ASK before proceeding when:**\n\n1. Adjacent features detected\n2. Ambiguous boundaries\n3. Multiple interpretations possible\n4. Feature seems too large (10+ issues)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Clarify Scope\n\nASK user about boundaries before drafting.\n\n### 2. Review Preference\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion`:\n\n- **\"Review first\" (Recommended)**: Create preview file in scratchpad for feedback before creating issues\n- **\"Create directly\"**: Create issues immediately with `needs-review` label added via `gh issue edit <num> --add-label \"needs-review\"` after creation\n\n### 3. Create Issues (Single Script)\n\nUse GraphQL API for reliable creation (see `./graphql-api.md`).\n\n**CRITICAL**: Execute ALL operations in a SINGLE bash script to minimize permission prompts. This includes:\n\n1. Getting repo info\n2. Getting repo ID\n3. Creating epic\n4. Creating all sub-issues\n5. Linking sub-issues to epic\n6. Adding labels\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ALL OPERATIONS IN ONE SCRIPT - Single permission prompt\n\nset -e\n\n# 1. Get repo info\nREPO=$(gh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner)\nOWNER=$(echo \"$REPO\" | cut -d''/'' -f1)\nNAME=$(echo \"$REPO\" | cut -d''/'' -f2)\n\n# 2. Get repo ID\nREPO_ID=$(gh api graphql -f query=\"query { repository(owner: \\\"$OWNER\\\", name: \\\"$NAME\\\") { id } }\" -q ''.data.repository.id'')\n\n# 3. Create epic\nEPIC=$(gh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation($repoId: ID!, $title: String!, $body: String!) {\n  createIssue(input: { repositoryId: $repoId, title: $title, body: $body }) {\n    issue { number id }\n  }\n}'' -f repoId=\"$REPO_ID\" -f title=\"[Context] Epic: Feature Name\" -f body=\"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Objective\nEpic description here...\n\n## Sub-Issues\n- [ ] Sub-issue 1\n- [ ] Sub-issue 2\nEOF\n)\")\nEPIC_NUM=$(echo \"$EPIC\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.number'')\nEPIC_ID=$(echo \"$EPIC\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.id'')\n\n# 4. Create sub-issues\nISSUE1=$(gh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation($repoId: ID!, $title: String!, $body: String!) {\n  createIssue(input: { repositoryId: $repoId, title: $title, body: $body }) {\n    issue { number id }\n  }\n}'' -f repoId=\"$REPO_ID\" -f title=\"[Context] Sub-issue 1\" -f body=\"Issue body...\")\nISSUE1_NUM=$(echo \"$ISSUE1\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.number'')\nISSUE1_ID=$(echo \"$ISSUE1\" | jq -r ''.data.createIssue.issue.id'')\n\n# Continue for all sub-issues...\n\n# 5. Link sub-issues (attempt - may not be available on all repos)\ngh api graphql \\\n  -H \"GraphQL-Features: sub_issues\" \\\n  -f query=''mutation($parentId: ID!, $childId: ID!) {\n    addSubIssue(input: { issueId: $parentId, subIssueId: $childId }) {\n      issue { number }\n    }\n  }'' \\\n  -f parentId=\"$EPIC_ID\" \\\n  -f childId=\"$ISSUE1_ID\" 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 6. Add labels\nfor issue in $EPIC_NUM $ISSUE1_NUM; do\n  gh issue edit \"$issue\" --add-label \"needs-review\" --repo \"$REPO\" 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\n\necho \"Created Epic #$EPIC_NUM with sub-issues\"\n```\n\n## Issue Structure\n\n### Title Convention\n\nIssue titles MUST include context prefix from the user''s request. Extract the context (e.g., \"Seller\", \"Buyer\", \"Payments\") and prefix all issues:\n\n```\n[Context] Issue title\n```\n\nExamples:\n\n- User asks: \"create issues for the Seller\" → `[Seller] Seller Registration`, `[Seller] Create Product Listing`\n- User asks: \"create issues for checkout flow\" → `[Checkout] Cart Summary`, `[Checkout] Payment Processing`\n- Epic title: `[Seller] Epic: Seller Experience`\n\n### Required Sections\n\nEvery issue MUST include:\n\n| Section                 | Purpose                           |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Objective**           | Single, clear goal (one sentence) |\n| **Scope**               | What''s included                   |\n| **Acceptance Criteria** | Checkboxes for \"done\"             |\n| **Out of Scope**        | Explicit boundaries               |\n| **How to Test**         | Verification steps                |\n\nOptional: Examples, Technical Notes, Dependencies, Related\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake                          | Fix                                   |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Vague objective                  | Specific goal with measurable outcome |\n| Missing acceptance criteria      | Add checkboxes                        |\n| Expanding into adjacent features | ASK if separate epic needed           |\n| Using only labels to link issues | Use GraphQL `addSubIssue`             |\n\n## Reference Files\n\nLoad these on-demand as needed:\n\n- `./graphql-api.md` - GraphQL mutations for creating issues and sub-issues (RECOMMENDED)\n- `./cli-reference.md` - Quick gh CLI commands reference\n- `./templates.md` - Issue body templates and examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:52:36.486Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents focused on collaborative project management needing precise issue tracking and project planning.","zh":"适合专注于协作项目管理、需要精确问题跟踪和项目规划的开发代理。","ja":"コラボレーションプロジェクト管理に焦点を当て、正確な問題追跡とプロジェクト計画が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"협업 프로젝트 관리에 중점을 둔 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며, 정확한 문제 추적 및 프로젝트 계획이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo centrados en la gestión de proyectos colaborativos que necesitan un seguimiento de problemas preciso y una planificación de proyectos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement axés sur la gestion de projets collaboratifs nécessitant un suivi de problèmes précis et une planification de projets.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsspezialisten, die auf kollaboratives Projektmanagement ausgerichtet sind und präzise Problemmeldung und Projektplanung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento focados em gerenciamento de projetos colaborativos que necessitam de acompanhamento preciso de problemas e planejamento de projetos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, ориентированных на совместное управление проектами, требующих точного отслеживания проблем и планирования проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تركز على إدارة المشاريع التعاونية التي تحتاج إلى تتبع دقيق للقضايا وتخطيط المشاريع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create focused, self-contained GitHub issues with clear goals, utilizing decision flows and scope boundaries to ensure efficient project execution, and integrating with APIs and Telegram bots for real-time updates.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有明确目标的、自成体系的GitHub问题，利用决策流程和范围边界以确保高效的项目执行，并与API和Telegram机器人集成以实现实时更新。","ja":"エージェントが明確な目標を持つ、自己完結的なGitHubの問題を作成できるようにし、意思決定の流れと範囲の境界を利用して効率的なプロジェクトの実行を確保し、APIやTelegramボットと統合してリアルタイムの更新を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가明確한 목표를 가진 자체 완결형 GitHub 이슈를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 의사 결정 흐름과 범위 경계를 사용하여 효율적인 프로젝트 실행을 보장하며, API 및 Telegram 봇과 통합하여 실시간 업데이트 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear problemas de GitHub enfocados y autocontenidos con objetivos claros, utilizando flujos de decisión y límites de alcance para garantizar una ejecución de proyecto eficiente, e integrándose con APIs y bots de Telegram para actualizaciones en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub ciblés et auto-contenus avec des objectifs clairs, en utilisant des flux de décision et des limites de portée pour assurer une exécution de projet efficace, et en s''intégrant avec des API et des bots Telegram pour des mises à jour en temps réel.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, fokussierte, selbstenthaltene GitHub-Probleme mit klaren Zielen zu erstellen, unter Nutzung von Entscheidungsflüssen und Umfangsgrenzen, um eine effiziente Projektausführung sicherzustellen, und integriert sich mit APIs und Telegram-Bots für Echtzeit-Updates.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar problemas focados e autocontidos no GitHub com metas claras, utilizando fluxos de decisão e limites de escopo para garantir a execução eficiente do projeto, e integrando-se com APIs e bots do Telegram para atualizações em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сосредоточенные, самодостаточные проблемы GitHub с четкими целями, используя потоки решений и границы области действия для обеспечения эффективного выполнения проекта, и интегрируясь с API и Telegram-ботами для обновлений в реальном времени.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء مشاكل محددة ومتكاملة في GitHub مع أهداف واضحة، باستخدام تدفقات القرار وحدود النطاق لضمان تنفيذ المشروع بكفاءة، وتكامل مع APIs وأدوات Telegram للحصول على تحديثات في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating single issues for clear project goals","Generating epics with sub-issues for complex, multi-layered projects","Integrating GitHub issues with external tools like indexer and API for streamlined project management"],"zh":["为明确的项目目标创建单个问题","为复杂的多层项目生成史诗级问题及其子问题","将GitHub问题与外部工具（如索引器和API）集成以实现流畅的项目管理"],"ja":["明確なプロジェクト目標のための単一の問題を作成する","複雑な多層プロジェクトのためのエピックとサブ問題を生成する","GitHubの問題を外部ツール（例：インデクサー、API）と統合してプロジェクト管理をストリームライン化する"],"ko":["명확한 프로젝트 목표를 위한 단일 이슈 생성","복잡한 다층 프로젝트를 위한 에픽 및 하위 이슈 생성","GitHub 이슈를 외부 도구(예: 인덱서, API)와 통합하여 프로젝트 관리를 간소화"],"es":["Creación de problemas individuales para objetivos de proyecto claros","Generación de epo