o do find-bugs","desenvolvimento de software com find-bugs","erros comuns em projetos next"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","как использовать find-bugs","что такое find-bugs","find-bugs vs другие инструменты","установка find-bugs","руководство по настройке find-bugs","разработка программного обеспечения с find-bugs","общие ошибки в проектах Next"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام find-bugs","ما هي find-bugs","find-bugs مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت find-bugs","دليل إعداد find-bugs","تطوير البرمجيات مع find-bugs","أخطاء شائعة في مشاريع Next"]}},"owner":"JFEspanolito","repo":"Template_FrontEnd_NextJS_JF","repoPath":"JFEspanolito/Template_FrontEnd_NextJS_JF","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.724Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-bugs","description":"Find bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues in local branch changes. Use when asked to review changes, find bugs, security review, or audit code on the current branch.","bodyPreview":"# Find Bugs\n\nReview changes on this branch for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues.\n\n## Phase 1: Complete Input Gathering\n\n1. Get the FULL diff: `git diff master...HEAD`\n2. If output is truncated, read each changed file individually until you have seen every changed line\n3. List all files modified in this branch before proceeding\n\n## Phase 2: Attack Surface Mapping\n\nFor each changed file, identify and list:\n\n* All user inputs (request params, headers, body, URL components)\n*","body":"# Find Bugs\n\nReview changes on this branch for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues.\n\n## Phase 1: Complete Input Gathering\n\n1. Get the FULL diff: `git diff master...HEAD`\n2. If output is truncated, read each changed file individually until you have seen every changed line\n3. List all files modified in this branch before proceeding\n\n## Phase 2: Attack Surface Mapping\n\nFor each changed file, identify and list:\n\n* All user inputs (request params, headers, body, URL components)\n* All database queries\n* All authentication/authorization checks\n* All session/state operations\n* All external calls\n* All cryptographic operations\n\n## Phase 3: Security Checklist (check EVERY item for EVERY file)\n\n* [ ] **Injection**: SQL, command, template, header injection\n* [ ] **XSS**: All outputs in templates properly escaped?\n* [ ] **Authentication**: Auth checks on all protected operations?\n* [ ] **Authorization/IDOR**: Access control verified, not just auth?\n* [ ] **CSRF**: State-changing operations protected?\n* [ ] **Race conditions**: TOCTOU in any read-then-write patterns?\n* [ ] **Session**: Fixation, expiration, secure flags?\n* [ ] **Cryptography**: Secure random, proper algorithms, no secrets in logs?\n* [ ] **Information disclosure**: Error messages, logs, timing attacks?\n* [ ] **DoS**: Unbounded operations, missing rate limits, resource exhaustion?\n* [ ] **Business logic**: Edge cases, state machine violations, numeric overflow?\n\n## Phase 4: Verification\n\nFor each potential issue:\n\n* Check if it''s already handled elsewhere in the changed code\n* Search for existing tests covering the scenario\n* Read surrounding context to verify the issue is real\n\n## Phase 5: Pre-Conclusion Audit\n\nBefore finalizing, you MUST:\n\n1. List every file you reviewed and confirm you read it completely\n2. List every checklist item and note whether you found issues or confirmed it''s clean\n3. List any areas you could NOT fully verify and why\n4. Only then provide your final findings\n\n## Output Format\n\n**Prioritize**: security vulnerabilities > bugs > code quality\n\n**Skip**: stylistic/formatting issues\n\nFor each issue:\n\n* **File:Line** - Brief description\n* **Severity**: Critical/High/Medium/Low\n* **Problem**: What''s wrong\n* **Evidence**: Why this is real (not already fixed, no existing test, etc.)\n* **Fix**: Concrete suggestion\n* **References**: OWASP, RFCs, or other standards if applicable\n\nIf you find nothing significant, say so - don''t invent issues.\n\nDo not make changes - just report findings. I''ll decide what to address.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:54:18.504Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced bug detection and security vulnerability assessment in TypeScript projects.","zh":"适合需要高级bug检测和安全漏洞评估的TypeScript项目的代码审查代理。","ja":"TypeScriptプロジェクトで高度なバグ検出とセキュリティ脆弱性評価が必要なコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"고급 버그 감지 및 보안 취약성 평가가 필요한 TypeScript 프로젝트를 위한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una detección de errores avanzada y una evaluación de vulnerabilidades de seguridad en proyectos de TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une détection de bogues avancée et une évaluation des vulnérabilités de sécurité dans les projets TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Fehlererkennung und eine Bewertung von Sicherheitslücken in TypeScript-Projekten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de detecção avançada de bugs e avaliação de vulnerabilidades de segurança em projetos TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих продвинутой детекции багов и оценки уязвимостей безопасности в проектах TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى كشف متقدم عن الأخطاء وتقييم نقاط الضعف في الأمان في مشاريع TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review changes for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues using git diff and TypeScript, providing a comprehensive analysis of user inputs and attack surface mapping.","zh":"赋予代理使用git diff和TypeScript审查更改以发现bug、安全漏洞和代码质量问题的能力，提供对用户输入和攻击面映射的综合分析。","ja":"git diffとTypeScriptを使用して変更をレビューし、バグ、セキュリティ脆弱性、コード品質の問題を発見し、ユーザー入力と攻撃面マッピングの包括的な分析を提供するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"git diff 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 변경 사항을 검토하고 버그, 보안 취약성 및 코드 품질 문제를 발견하며 사용자 입력 및 공격 표면 매핑에 대한 종합적인 분석을 제공하여 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar los cambios para errores, vulnerabilidades de seguridad y problemas de calidad del código utilizando git diff y TypeScript, proporcionando un análisis integral de las entradas de usuario y el mapeo de la superficie de ataque.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser les modifications pour les bogues, les vulnérabilités de sécurité et les problèmes de qualité de code en utilisant git diff et TypeScript, fournissant une analyse complète des entrées utilisateur et de la cartographie de la surface d''attaque.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Änderungen auf Fehler, Sicherheitslücken und Codequalitätsprobleme zu überprüfen, indem sie git diff und TypeScript verwenden, und bietet eine umfassende Analyse der Benutzereingaben und der Abbildung der Angriffsoberfläche.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar alterações para bugs, vulnerabilidades de segurança e problemas de qualidade de código usando git diff e TypeScript, fornecendo uma análise abrangente das entradas do usuário e mapeamento da superfície de ataque.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью просматривать изменения для багов, уязвимостей безопасности и проблем качества кода, используя git diff и TypeScript, обеспечивая всесторонний анализ пользовательских входных данных и отображение поверхности атаки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية مراجعة التغييرات لتحديد الأخطاء ونقاط الضعف في الأمان ومشاكل جودة الشفرة باستخدام git diff وTypeScript، وتقديم تحليل شامل لمدخلات المستخدم وخرائط سطح الهجوم."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging TypeScript code","Identifying security vulnerabilities in git commits","Reviewing code quality issues in modified files"],"zh":["调试TypeScript代码","在git提交中识别安全漏洞","审查修改文件中的代码质量问题"],"ja":["TypeScriptコードのデバッグ","gitコミットのセキュリティ脆弱性の特定","変更されたファイルのコード品質の問題のレビュー"],"ko":["TypeScript 코드 디버깅","git 커밋의 보안 취약성 식별","수정된 파일의 코드 품질 문제 검토"],"es":["Depuración de código TypeScript","Identificación de vulnerabilidades de seguridad en confirmaciones de git","Revisión de problemas de calidad del código en archivos modificados"],"fr":["Débogage de code TypeScript","Identification des vulnérabilités de sécurité dans les validations git","Révision des problèmes de qualité de code dans les fichiers modifiés"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von TypeScript-Code","Identifizierung von Sicherheitslücken in Git-Commits","Überprüfung von Codequalitätsproblemen in geänderten Dateien"],"pt":["Depuração de código TypeScript","Identificação de vulnerabilidades de segurança em confirmações git","Revisão de problemas de qualidade de código em arquivos modificados"],"ru":["Отладка кода TypeScript","Определение уязвимостей безопасности в фиксациях git","Просмотр проблем качества кода в измененных файлах"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة TypeScript","تحديد نقاط الضعف في الأمان في عمليات الإلتزام git","مراجعة مشاكل جودة الشفرة في الملفات المعدلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git repository access","TypeScript projects only","Manual review of changed files may be necessary for comprehensive analysis"],"zh":["需要git仓库访问","仅适用于TypeScript项目","可能需要手动审查更改的文件以进行全面分析"],"ja":["gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","TypeScriptプロジェクトのみ","包括的な分析のために変更されたファイルの手動レビューが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["git 저장소 액세스가 필요합니다.","TypeScript 프로젝트만 해당","전체 분석을 위해 수정된 파일의 수동 검토가 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de git","Solo proyectos de TypeScript","Es posible que sea necesaria una revisión manual de los archivos modificados para un análisis integral"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel git","Uniquement des projets TypeScript","Une révision manuelle des fichiers modifiés peut être nécessaire pour une analyse complète"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Nur TypeScript-Projekte","Eine manuelle Überprüfung der geänderten Dateien kann für eine umfassende Analyse erforderlich sein"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório git","Apenas projetos TypeScript","Revisão manual de arquivos alterados pode ser necessária para análise abrangente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию git","Только проекты TypeScript","Ручной обзор измененных файлов может быть необходим для всестороннего анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع git","مشاريع TypeScript فقط","مراجعة يدوية للملفات المعدلة قد تكون ضرورية للتحليل الشامل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"edad456696ade7d64c855594e55b9064689a6ce354e667dc2a64e83362a56a8e","qualityScore":39}');
