v2.0.67","guides d''installation de formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","alternatives à formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs claud code","comment utiliser formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","configuration de formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"de":["ki-tools","software-engineering","automatisierung von aufgaben","claud code v2.0.67","installation guides für formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","alternativen zu formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs claud code","wie man formax-repomix-handoff-workflow verwendet","konfiguration von formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para engenharia de software","como usar formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","o que é formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs Claude Code","instalar formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","guia de configuração do formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"ru":["ИИ-помощницы для программной инженерии","как использовать formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","что такое formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow vs Claude Code","установить formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","руководство по настройке formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للهندسة البرمجية","كيفية استخدام formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","ما هو formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","formax-repomix-handoff-workflow مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","دليل إعداد formax-repomix-handoff-workflow"]}},"owner":"yusifeng","repo":"formax","repoPath":"yusifeng/formax","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.751Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"formax-repomix-handoff-workflow","description":"Use when preparing a Formax code handoff: selecting files, generating repomix bundles, and writing a high-quality prompt for WebGPT or another coding agent with clear constraints and validation scope.","bodyPreview":"# formax-repomix-handoff-workflow\n\n## Goal\nCreate a clean handoff package for another AI with:\n- the smallest correct repomix bundle\n- a prompt that matches the target environment\n- explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals\n- predictable artifact naming + validation (so uploads stay consistent)\n\n## Where to change what\n- All handoff artifacts live in one folder: `repomix-output/`\n- Bundle output: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt`\n- Handoff prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-promp","body":"# formax-repomix-handoff-workflow\n\n## Goal\nCreate a clean handoff package for another AI with:\n- the smallest correct repomix bundle\n- a prompt that matches the target environment\n- explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals\n- predictable artifact naming + validation (so uploads stay consistent)\n\n## Where to change what\n- All handoff artifacts live in one folder: `repomix-output/`\n- Bundle output: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt`\n- Handoff prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-prompt.md`\n- File manifest notes: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-files.md`\n- Template references: `references/prompt-templates.md`\n\n> Required hygiene: each new pack run must clear previous files in `repomix-output/` first, so users can upload that folder as-is without manual file picking.\n\n## Pack tiers (default taxonomy)\nUse exactly one tier label in bundle filename:\n\n- `minimal`: changed runtime files + direct dependencies + adjacent tests.\n- `core`: `minimal` + only critical contract/design docs needed for intent.\n- `full`: broad context pack for deep investigations (cross-subsystem docs/tests).\n\nExample names:\n- `repomix-topic-minimal.txt`\n- `repomix-topic-core.txt`\n- `repomix-topic-full.txt`\n\n## Patterns\n1. Classify target runtime first\n- `Static consumer` (e.g., WebGPT): cannot run local commands or tests.\n- `Executable agent` (repo access): can run local commands/tests.\n\n2. Pick a pack tier first (`minimal` / `core` / `full`)\n- Default to `minimal`.\n- Upgrade to `core` only when architecture/contracts matter.\n- Use `full` only when root cause plausibly spans multiple subsystems.\n\n3. Build the include set for that tier\n- Include changed runtime files + direct dependencies + adjacent tests.\n- Include only docs needed for intent/constraints at the chosen tier.\n- Avoid unrelated folders to keep context small.\n\n4. Pack with deterministic command (single folder, auto-clean)\n```sh\nbunx repomix . \\\n  --style plain \\\n  --no-git-sort-by-changes \\\n  -o repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  --include \"<comma-separated-file-list>\"\n```\nOr use the helper script:\n```sh\nbash .codex/skills/formax-repomix-handoff-workflow/scripts/build-repomix.sh \\\n  repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  \"<comma-separated-file-list>\"\n```\nThe helper script will:\n- create `repomix-output/` if missing\n- delete previous files under `repomix-output/` (except `.gitkeep`)\n- write the new bundle into `repomix-output/`\n\n5. Write prompt + file manifest with naming convention\n- Prompt: `repomix-output/<topic>-handoff-prompt.md`\n- Manifest: `repomix-output/repomix-<topic>-files.md`\n- Always use **repo-relative paths** in prompt + manifest (no machine absolute paths).\n\n6. Write prompt with explicit boundaries\n- State known symptoms.\n- State hard constraints (what must not change).\n- Define deliverables (root cause model, options, recommended plan, test/validation matrix).\n- Include acceptance criteria with observable assertions.\n\n7. Run artifact validation (required)\n```sh\nbash .codex/skills/formax-repomix-handoff-workflow/scripts/check-handoff-artifacts.sh \\\n  repomix-<topic>-<tier>.txt \\\n  <topic>\n```\nThis check enforces:\n- Bundle/prompt/manifest files all exist.\n- Prompt and manifest reference the current bundle name.\n- Manifest references the prompt filename.\n- Prompt + manifest do not contain local absolute paths.\n\n8. Sanity-check before handoff\n- `repomix-output/` only contains current-round artifacts.\n- Bundle exists and includes the expected files.\n- Prompt has no impossible instructions for the target runtime.\n- Prompt does not ask static consumers to run commands.\n- Naming is topic-driven and consistent across all three artifacts.\n\nSee `references/prompt-templates.md` for copy-ready templates.\n\n## Tests to update\n- No repository tests required for creating the handoff itself.\n- If target is executable, include a suggested minimal test list in the handoff prompt.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Never include `bun run test:coverage` in a static-consumer prompt.\n- Never assume the other AI can read files outside the provided bundle unless explicitly attached.\n- Keep asks decision-oriented first (root cause/options) before patch implementation.\n- Prefer concrete acceptance checks over vague goals.\n- Avoid mixing unrelated bugfixes into one handoff package.\n- Never leak machine absolute paths (e.g., `/Users/...`) in prompt/manifest.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:11:32.180Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Software Engineering Agents needing efficient handoff workflows with minimal repomix bundles and predictable artifact naming.","zh":"非常适合需要高效交接工作流和最小化 repomix 包以及可预测的构件命名的软件工程代理。","ja":"ソフトウェアエンジニアリングエージェントが効率的なハンドオフワークフローと最小の repomix バンドルおよび予測可能な成果物命名を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 핸드오버 워크플로와 최소한의 repomix 번들 및 예측 가능한 아티팩트命名이 필요한 소프트웨어 엔지니어링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Ingeniería de Software que necesitan flujos de trabajo de entrega eficientes con paquetes mínimos de repomix y nombres de artefactos predecibles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie logicielle nécessitant des flux de travail de passation efficaces avec des bundles de repomix minimaux et des noms d''artefacts prévisibles.","de":"Perfekt für Software Engineering Agents, die effiziente Handoff-Workflows mit minimalen repomix-Bundles und vorhersehbaren Artefakt-Namen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia de Software que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de handoff eficientes com pacotes de repomix mínimos e nomeação de artefatos previsível.","ru":"Идеально для агентов инженерии программного обеспечения, которым требуются эффективные рабочие процессы передачи с минимальными пакетами repomix и предсказуемым именованием артефактов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الهندسيين البرمجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى سير عمل مثالية لتحويل مع الحزم المخففة من repomix وأسماء الملفات المتوقعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create clean handoff packages with explicit acceptance criteria, non-goals, and validated artifact naming, utilizing terminal-first interfaces and repomix bundles in .txt format.","zh":"赋予代理创建干净的交接包的能力，具有明确的验收标准、非目标和验证的构件命名，利用基于终端的接口和 repomix 包的 .txt 格式。","ja":"エージェントが明確な受け入れ基準、非目標、および検証された成果物命名を使用してクリーンなハンドオフパッケージを作成する能力を提供し、ターミナル第一のインターフェイスと repomix バンドルの .txt 形式を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가明确한 수락 기준, 비목표 및 검증된 아티팩트命名을 사용하여 깨끗한 핸드오버 패키지를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 터미널 우선 인터페이스와 repomix 번들의 .txt 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear paquetes de entrega limpios con criterios de aceptación explícitos, no objetivos y nombres de artefactos validados, utilizando interfaces de terminal en primer lugar y bundles de repomix en formato .txt.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des paquets de passation propres avec des critères d''acceptation explicites, des non-objectifs et des noms d''artefacts validés, en utilisant des interfaces de terminal en premier lieu et des bundles de repomix au format .txt.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, saubere Handoff-Pakete mit expliziten Akzeptanzkriterien, Nicht-Zielen und validierten Artefakt-Namen zu erstellen, indem sie terminal-erste Schnittstellen und repomix-Bundles im .txt-Format nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem pacotes de handoff limpos com critérios de aceitação explícitos, metas não alcançadas e nomeação de artefatos validada, utilizando interfaces de terminal em primeiro lugar e pacotes de repomix no formato .txt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать чистые пакеты передачи с явными критериями приемки, недостижимыми целями и проверенным именованием артефактов, используя терминальные интерфейсы и пакеты repomix в формате .txt.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء حزم مثالية لتحويل مع معايير قبول صريحة وأهداف غير قابلة للتحقيق وأسماء الملفات المثبتة، باستخدام واجهات الطرفية أولاً وحزم repomix بامتداد .txt."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating minimal repomix bundles for handoffs","Creating predictable and validated artifact names for uploads","Defining explicit acceptance criteria and non-goals for target environments"],"zh":["为交接生成最小的 repomix 包","为上传创建可预测且验证的构件名称","为目标环境定义明确的验收标准和非目标"],"ja":["ハンドオフ用に最小の repomix バンドルを生成する","アップロード用に予測可能且つ検証された成果物名を作成する","ターゲット環境用に明確な受け入れ基準と非目標を定義する"],"ko":["핸드오버를 위한 최소한의 repomix 번들을 생성하는 것","업로드를 위한 예측 가능하며 검증된 아티팩트 이름을 생성하는 것","타겟 환경을 위한 명확한 수락 기준 및 비목표를 정의하는 것"],"es":["Generación de bundles de repomix mínimos para entregas","Creación de nombres de artefactos predecibles y validados para subidas","Definición de criterios de aceptación explícitos y no objetivos para entornos de destino"],"fr":["Génération de bundles de repomix minimaux pour les passations","Création de noms d''artefacts prévisibles et validés pour les téléchargements","Définition de critères d''acceptation explicites et de non-objectifs pour les environnements cibles"],"de":["Generierung minimaler repomix-Bundles für Handoffs","Erstellung vorhersehbarer und validierter Artefakt-Namen für Uploads","Definition expliziter Akzeptanzkriterien und Nicht-Ziele für Zielumgebungen"],"pt":["Geração de pacotes de repomix mínimos para handoffs","Criação de nomes de artefatos previsíveis e validados para uploads","Definição de critérios de aceitação explícitos e metas não alcançadas para ambientes de destino"],"ru":["Генерация минимальных пакетов repomix для передачи","Создание предсказуемых и проверенных имен артефактов для загрузки","Определение явных критериев приемки и недостижимых целей для целевых сред"],"ar":["توليد حزم repomix المخففة لتحويل","إنشاء أسماء الملفات المتوقعة والمدقة للمرفقات","تحديد معايير القبول الصريحة والأهداف غير القابلة للتحقيق للبيئات المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires terminal-first interface compatibility","Output artifacts limited to repomix-output/ folder","Bundle output and handoff prompt follow specific naming conventions"],"zh":["需要基于终端的接口兼容性","输出构件仅限于 repomix-output/ 文件夹","包输出和交接提示遵循特定的命名约定"],"ja":["ターミナル第一のインターフェイスの互換性が必要","出力成果物は repomix-output/ フォルダに限定される","バンドル出力とハンドオフプロンプトは特定の命名規則に従う"],"ko":["터미널 우선 인터페이스 호환성이 필요","출력 아티팩트는 repomix-output/ 폴더에만 제한","번들 출력 및 핸드오버 프롬프트는 특정한 명명 규칙을 따름"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con interfaces de terminal en primer lugar","Los artefactos de salida están limitados a la carpeta repomix-output/","La salida del bundle y la invitación de entrega siguen convenciones de nomenclatura específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec les interfaces de terminal en premier lieu","Les artefacts de sortie sont limités au dossier repomix-output/","La sortie du bundle et l''invite de passation suivent des conventions de dénomination spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit terminal-ersten Schnittstellen","Die Ausgabe-Artefakte sind auf den Ordner repomix-output/ beschränkt","Die Bundle-Ausgabe und die Handoff-Aufforderung folgen spezifischen Benennungskonventionen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com interface de terminal em primeiro lugar","Artifacts de saída limitados à pasta repomix-output/","Saída do pacote e prompt de handoff seguem convenções de nomeação específicas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с терминальным интерфейсом в первую очередь","Артефакты вывода ограничены папкой repomix-output/","Вывод пакета и подсказка передачи следуют конкретным соглашениям об именовании"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع واجهة الطرفية أولاً","محدودية الملفات الناتجة إلى مجلد repomix-output/","مخرجات الحزمة وتنبيه التحويل تتبع اتفاقيات命名 محددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"96f19b328a9ee07a5c8c63581472ee482beb3abf8feb8f8c95d07818139f0d64","qualityScore":39}');
