가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Conductor alternative","Conductor vs otros","cómo usar Conductor","instalación de Conductor","guía de configuración de Conductor","desarrollo de software con AI","herramientas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","Conductor alternative","Conductor vs autres","comment utiliser Conductor","installation de Conductor","guide de configuration de Conductor","développement de logiciels avec IA","outils de développement de logiciels"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Conductor-Alternative","Conductor vs andere","wie man Conductor verwendet","Installation von Conductor","Konfigurationsanleitung für Conductor","Software-Entwicklung mit KI","Software-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["como usar Conductor","o que é Conductor","Conductor vs outros agentes","Conductor alternative","instalar Conductor","guia de setup do Conductor","desenvolvimento com Conductor","Conductor e React","Conductor e Python","Conductor e Node.js"],"ru":["как использовать Conductor","что такое Conductor","Conductor vs другие агенты","альтернатива Conductor","установить Conductor","руководство по настройке Conductor","разработка с Conductor","Conductor и React","Conductor и Python","Conductor и Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام موزع","ما هو موزع","موزع مقابل وكلاء آخرين","بديل موزع","تثبيت موزع","دليل إعداد موزع","التطوير مع موزع","موزع و رياكت","موزع و بايثون","موزع و نود.جس"]}},"owner":"pythrick","repo":"codex-conductor","repoPath":"pythrick/codex-conductor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.782Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"conductor","description":"Maintain Conductor-compatible project context, tracks, specs, and plans.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Conductor Compatibility Skill\n\nPurpose: create and maintain Conductor artifacts so they remain fully compatible with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow (Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement).\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to set up a new project context, start a new track, implement or resume a track, check progress, or revert work.\n\n## Required File Structure (Do Not Deviate)\n\n```\nconductor/\n  product.md\n  product-guidelines.md\n  tech-stack.md\n  workflow.md\n  setup_state.json","body":"# Conductor Compatibility Skill\n\nPurpose: create and maintain Conductor artifacts so they remain fully compatible with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow (Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement).\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to set up a new project context, start a new track, implement or resume a track, check progress, or revert work.\n\n## Required File Structure (Do Not Deviate)\n\n```\nconductor/\n  product.md\n  product-guidelines.md\n  tech-stack.md\n  workflow.md\n  setup_state.json\n  code_styleguides/\n    *.md\n  tracks.md\n  tracks/\n    <track_id>/\n      spec.md\n      plan.md\n      metadata.json\n  archive/                 (optional)\n    <track_id>/            (optional)\n```\n\n## Required Formats\n\n### Track ID\n- Format: `shortname_YYYYMMDD` (lowercase ASCII, underscores only).\n- Example: `auth_20251219`.\n\n### `conductor/tracks.md`\n- Must use `---` separators between track sections.\n- Each track section must use the exact heading format below.\n\n```\n---\n\n## [ ] Track: <Track Description>\n*Link: [./conductor/tracks/<track_id>/](./conductor/tracks/<track_id>/)*\n```\n\n### `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/metadata.json`\n- Required keys: `track_id`, `type`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `description`.\n- Timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC, e.g., `2025-12-19T23:59:59Z`.\n- `status` values: `new`, `in_progress`, `completed`, `cancelled`.\n\n### `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/plan.md`\n- Use checklist markers: `[ ]` (pending), `[~]` (in progress), `[x]` (done).\n- When completing a task, append the first 7 chars of the commit SHA to the task line.\n- If the workflow defines the Phase Completion Verification protocol, append a meta-task to each phase:\n  `- [ ] Task: Conductor - User Manual Verification ''<Phase Name>'' (Protocol in workflow.md)`\n- When a phase is checkpointed, append `[checkpoint: <sha>]` to the phase heading.\n\n## Setup Workflow (Greenfield or Brownfield)\n\n1. Detect project maturity (greenfield vs brownfield) based on repo and code presence.\n2. Create `conductor/` and `conductor/setup_state.json` if missing. Start with:\n   `{ \"last_successful_step\": \"\" }`\n3. Generate or update the core documents with user input:\n   - `product.md`\n   - `product-guidelines.md`\n   - `tech-stack.md`\n4. Copy the workflow template from `assets/templates/workflow.md` into `conductor/workflow.md` unless the user provides a custom workflow.\n5. Copy code style guides from `assets/templates/code_styleguides/` into `conductor/code_styleguides/`.\n6. Initialize `conductor/tracks.md` using the format in `assets/templates/tracks.md`.\n7. Create the initial track folder and artifacts (`spec.md`, `plan.md`, `metadata.json`).\n8. Update `conductor/setup_state.json` as steps complete using these values:\n   - `2.1_product_guide`\n   - `2.2_product_guidelines`\n   - `2.3_tech_stack`\n   - `2.4_code_styleguides`\n   - `2.5_workflow`\n   - `3.3_initial_track_generated`\n\n## New Track Workflow\n\n1. Confirm Conductor is set up (`product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, `workflow.md` exist).\n2. Collect or confirm a track description.\n3. Draft and confirm `spec.md` (requirements, acceptance criteria, out of scope).\n4. Draft and confirm `plan.md` based on `workflow.md` (TDD steps if required).\n5. Create `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/` with `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `metadata.json`.\n6. Append the track section to `conductor/tracks.md` using the required format.\n\n## Implement Workflow\n\n1. Parse `conductor/tracks.md` by `---` separators and select the target track.\n2. Mark the selected track as `[~]` in `conductor/tracks.md` before work starts.\n3. Read `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/spec.md`, `plan.md`, and `conductor/workflow.md`.\n4. Execute tasks strictly following the Task Workflow in `workflow.md` (including tests, commits, git notes, and plan updates).\n5. When the track is complete, mark the track as `[x]` in `conductor/tracks.md`.\n6. Synchronize `product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, and `product-guidelines.md` when the spec warrants it, with explicit user approval.\n7. Offer to archive or delete the completed track. If archiving, move it to `conductor/archive/<track_id>` and remove its section from `tracks.md`.\n\n## Status Workflow\n\n- Verify Conductor setup and `conductor/tracks.md` exists.\n- Summarize counts of tracks and tasks (done/in progress/pending).\n- Report current phase/task and next action.\n\n## Revert Workflow\n\n- Confirm the target track/phase/task from `tracks.md` and `plan.md`.\n- Use git history to identify associated commits.\n- Present a clear revert plan and wait for explicit user confirmation before executing any destructive action.\n\n## Templates Available\n\n- `assets/templates/workflow.md`\n- `assets/templates/code_styleguides/*.md`\n- `assets/templates/tracks.md`\n- `assets/templates/product.md`\n- `assets/templates/product-guidelines.md`\n- `assets/templates/tech-stack.md`\n- `assets/templates/spec.md`\n- `assets/templates/plan.md`\n- `assets/templates/metadata.json`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:25:06.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing advanced project management capabilities with Gemini Conductor extension","zh":"适合需要高级项目管理功能的Workflow Automation Agents，特别是具有Gemini Conductor扩展功能的","ja":"Gemini Conductor拡張機能を使用した高度なプロジェクト管理機能を必要とするワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Gemini Conductor 확장 기능을 사용하는 고급 프로젝트 관리 기능이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Flujos de Trabajo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de proyectos con la extensión Gemini Conductor","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Workflow ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion de projet avec l''extension Gemini Conductor","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungs-Agents, die erweiterte Projektmanagement-Fähigkeiten mit der Gemini Conductor-Erweiterung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Workflow que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gestão de projetos com a extensão Gemini Conductor","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым требуются расширенные возможности управления проектами с расширением Gemini Conductor","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء أتمتة سير العمل الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإدارة المشاريع مع امتداد Gemini Conductor"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage and maintain Conductor artifacts, ensuring compatibility with the Gemini Conductor workflow through Context, Spec & Plan, and Implement phases, utilizing JSON setup states and Markdown guidelines","zh":"赋予代理管理和维护Conductor工件的能力，确保通过上下文、规格和计划、实施阶段与Gemini Conductor工作流兼容，利用JSON设置状态和Markdown指南","ja":"エージェントがConductorアーティファクトを管理および維持できるようにし、コンテキスト、仕様および計画、実装段階を通じてGemini Conductorワークフローと互換性を保証する、JSON設定状態とMarkdownガイドラインを使用","ko":"에이전트가 Conductor 아티팩트를 관리하고 유지할 수 있도록 하여, 컨텍스트, 사양 및 계획, 구현 단계를 통해 Gemini Conductor 워크플로와의 호환성을 보장하고, JSON 설정 상태 및 Markdown 지침을 활용","es":"Empodera a los agentes para gestionar y mantener artefactos de Conductor, asegurando la compatibilidad con el workflow de Gemini Conductor a través de las fases de Contexto, Especificación y Plan, e Implementación, utilizando estados de configuración JSON y directrices en Markdown","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et de maintenir les artefacts Conductor, en assurant la compatibilité avec le workflow Gemini Conductor à travers les phases Context, Spec & Plan, et Implement, en utilisant les états de configuration JSON et les directives Markdown","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Conductor-Artefakte zu verwalten und zu pflegen, und stellt die Kompatibilität mit dem Gemini Conductor-Workflow durch die Phasen Context, Spec & Plan und Implement sicher, unter Verwendung von JSON-Setup-Status und Markdown-Richtlinien","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerir e manter artefactos do Conductor, assegurando compatibilidade com o fluxo de trabalho Gemini Conductor através das fases de Contexto, Especificação & Plano e Implementação, utilizando estados de configuração JSON e diretrizes Markdown","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять артефактами Conductor и поддерживать их, обеспечивая совместимость с рабочим процессом Gemini Conductor на этапах Context, Spec & Plan и Implement с использованием состояний настройки JSON и руководств Markdown","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إدارة وصيانة قطع Conductor، مما يضمن التوافق مع سير عمل Gemini Conductor من خلال مراحل Context، وSpec & Plan، وImplement، باستخدام حالات إعداد JSON والمبادئ التوجيهية Markdown"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new project contexts","Implementing or resuming tracks","Checking progress and reverting work","Maintaining product and technical guidelines"],"zh":["设置新的项目上下文","实现或恢复轨迹","检查进度并还原工作","维护产品和技术指南"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトコンテキストの設定","トラックの実装または再開","進捗状況の確認と作業の復元","製品および技術ガイドラインの維持"],"ko":["新的 프로젝트 컨텍스트 설정","트랙 구현 또는 재개","진행 상황 확인 및 작업 복원","제품 및 기술 가이드 유지"],"es":["Configurar nuevos contextos de proyecto","Implementar o reanudar tracks","Verificar el progreso y revertir el trabajo","Mantener directrices de producto y técnicas"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux contextes de projet","Implémentation ou reprise de tracks","Vérification de la progression et annulation du travail","Maintenance des directives produit et techniques"],"de":["Einrichten neuer Projektkontexte","Implementieren oder Fortsetzen von Tracks","Überprüfen des Fortschritts und Rückgängigmachen von Arbeit","Pflege von Produkt- und technischen Richtlinien"],"pt":["Configurar novos contextos de projeto","Implementar ou retomar trilhas","Verificar o progresso e reverter trabalho","Manter diretrizes de produto e técnicas"],"ru":["Настройка новых контекстов проекта","Реализация или возобновление треков","Проверка прогресса и отмена работы","Поддержка продукт