long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持RWA资产、加密货币、股票和指数","最高1000倍杠杆","自定义oracle和虚拟AMM","TWAP平滑价格","每用户链上金库"],"ja":["RWAアセット、暗号資産、株式、指数をサポート","最大1000倍のレバレッジ","カスタムオラクルと仮想AMM","TWAPスムージング価格","ユーザー毎のオンチェーン金庫"],"ko":["RWA 자산, 암호화폐, 주식, 지수를 지원","최대 1000배의 레버리지","사용자 지정 오라클 및 가상 AMM","TWAP 스무딩 가격","사용자별 온체인 금고"],"es":["Soporte para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Posiciones apalancadas largas/cortas con hasta 1000x de apalancamiento","Bóveda de liquidez centralizada como contraparte para todos los trades","Precios que combinan un oráculo personalizado, un AMM virtual y suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["Prise en charge des actifs RWA, crypto, actions et indices","Positions longues/courtes avec jusqu''à 1000x de levier","Coffre de liquidité centralisé en tant que contrepartie pour tous les trades","Prix qui combinent un oracle personnalisé, un AMM virtuel et un lissage TWAP"],"de":["Unterstützung für RWA-Assets, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Lange/Kurz-Positionen mit bis zu 1000x Hebel","Zentralisierte Liquiditätsbörse als Kontrahent für alle Trades","Preise, die einen benutzerdefinierten Oracle, ein virtuelles AMM und TWAP-Glättung kombinieren"],"pt":["Suporte a ativos RWA, criptomoedas, ações e índices","Posições long/short com alavancagem de até 1000x","Protocolo de futuros sintéticos","Cofre de liquidez centralizado","Preços combinados com oráculo personalizado, Virtual AMM e suavização TWAP"],"ru":["Поддержка активов RWA, криптовалют, акций и индексов","Длинные/короткие позиции с левериджем до 1000х","Синтетический фьючерсный протокол","Центральный кофр ликвидности","Цены, объединенные с индивидуальным оракулом, Virtual AMM и сглаживанием TWAP"],"ar":["دعم أصول RWA وأصول العملات الرقمية وأسهم وفهارس","مراكز التداول الطويلة/القصيرة مع رافعة مالية تصل إلى 1000 مرة","بروتوكول أسواق آجلة اصطناعية","خزان لиквидية مركزي","أسعار مجتمعة مع أوراكل مخصص و Virtual AMM وتنعيم TWAP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dev-commands教程","什么是合成永续期货","dev-commands安装","dev-commands替代品","dev-commands vs 其他AI工具","如何使用dev-commands","dev-commands文档","dev-commands API"],"ja":["dev-commandsチュートリアル","合成永続期貨とは","dev-commandsインストール","dev-commandsの代替","dev-commands vs その他のAIエージェント","dev-commandsの使い方","dev-commandsドキュメント","dev-commands API"],"ko":["dev-commands 튜토리얼","합성 영속 선물이란","dev-commands 설치","dev-commands 대체","dev-commands vs 다른 AI 에이전트","dev-commands 사용법","dev-commands 문서","dev-commands API"],"es":["cómo usar dev-commands","qué es un protocolo de futuros sintéticos","dev-commands alternativa","dev-commands vs otros protocolos","instalación de dev-commands","guía de configuración de dev-commands","desarrollo de traders con dev-commands"],"fr":["comment utiliser dev-commands","qu''est-ce qu''un protocole de futures synthétiques","alternative à dev-commands","dev-commands vs autres protocoles","installation de dev-commands","guide de configuration de dev-commands","développement de traders avec dev-commands"],"de":["wie man dev-commands verwendet","was ist ein synthetisches Futures-Protokoll","Alternative zu dev-commands","dev-commands im Vergleich zu anderen Protokollen","Installation von dev-commands","Einrichtungsanleitung für dev-commands","Entwicklung von Tradern mit dev-commands"],"pt":["como usar dev-commands","o que é dev-commands","dev-commands alternativa","dev-commands vs outros protocolos","instalar dev-commands","guia de configuração dev-commands","futuros sintéticos","mercados de futuros","criptomoedas","ações","índices"],"ru":["как использовать dev-commands","что такое dev-commands","dev-commands альтернатива","dev-commands vs другие протоколы","установить dev-commands","руководство по настройке dev-commands","синтетические фьючерсы","фьючерсные рынки","криптовалюты","акции","индексы"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام dev-commands","ما هو dev-commands","بديل dev-commands","dev-commands مقابل بروتوكولات أخرى","تثبيت dev-commands","دليل إعداد dev-commands","الأسواق الآجلة الاصطناعية","الأسواق الآجلة","أصول العملات الرقمية","أسهم","فهارس"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.812Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev-commands","description":"Development commands for monorepo projects. Use when running dev servers, building apps, linting, testing, or troubleshooting build issues. Triggers on yarn, dev, build, lint, test, desktop, mobile, web, extension, ios, android, compile, bundle.","bodyPreview":"# Development Commands\n\n## Application Development Commands\n\n**PLATFORM-SPECIFIC DEVELOPMENT** (adapt command names to your project):\n- `yarn app:desktop` - Start desktop Electron app development\n  - **Runtime**: 30-60 seconds to start\n  - **Common issues**: Node version conflicts, missing native dependencies\n  - **Troubleshooting**: Run `yarn clean && yarn reinstall` if startup fails\n\n- `yarn app:web` - Start web development server\n  - **Runtime**: 15-30 seconds to start\n  - **Common issues**:","body":"# Development Commands\n\n## Application Development Commands\n\n**PLATFORM-SPECIFIC DEVELOPMENT** (adapt command names to your project):\n- `yarn app:desktop` - Start desktop Electron app development\n  - **Runtime**: 30-60 seconds to start\n  - **Common issues**: Node version conflicts, missing native dependencies\n  - **Troubleshooting**: Run `yarn clean && yarn reinstall` if startup fails\n\n- `yarn app:web` - Start web development server\n  - **Runtime**: 15-30 seconds to start\n  - **Common issues**: Port already in use, webpack/bundler compilation errors\n  - **Troubleshooting**: Kill existing processes on port, check console for specific errors\n\n- `yarn app:ext` - Start browser extension development\n  - **Runtime**: 20-40 seconds to start\n  - **Common issues**: Manifest v3 validation errors, permission issues\n  - **Troubleshooting**: Check extension manifest validity, verify content security policy\n\n- `yarn app:ios` - Start iOS mobile development\n  - **Runtime**: 1-2 minutes (includes Metro bundler)\n  - **Common issues**: Xcode setup, simulator issues, pod install failures\n  - **Prerequisites**: Xcode installed, iOS simulator available\n\n- `yarn app:android` - Start Android mobile development\n  - **Runtime**: 1-2 minutes (includes Metro bundler)\n  - **Common issues**: Android SDK path, emulator setup, gradle build failures\n  - **Prerequisites**: Android Studio, SDK tools, emulator configured\n\n## Build Commands\n\n**PRODUCTION BUILDS** (Use for final validation):\n- `yarn app:desktop:build` - Build desktop app for all platforms\n  - **Runtime**: 5-10 minutes (multi-platform build)\n  - **Output**: Platform-specific installers in `apps/desktop/dist/`\n  - **Common issues**: Code signing, platform-specific dependencies\n\n- `yarn app:ext:build` - Build browser extension\n  - **Runtime**: 2-3 minutes\n  - **Output**: Extension packages in `apps/ext/dist/`\n  - **Common issues**: Manifest validation, content security policy violations\n\n- `yarn app:web:build` - Build web application\n  - **Runtime**: 3-5 minutes\n  - **Output**: Static files in `apps/web/dist/`\n  - **Common issues**: Bundle size limits, missing environment variables\n\n- `yarn app:native-bundle` - Bundle React Native app\n  - **Runtime**: 3-5 minutes\n  - **Common issues**: Native module linking, Metro bundler errors\n\n## Development Tools & Quality Assurance\n\n### Pre-commit Commands (Local Development)\n\n**Use these for fast pre-commit validation:**\n- `yarn lint:staged` - Lint only staged files (fast, recommended for pre-commit)\n- `yarn tsc:staged` - Type check staged files\n\n**Pre-commit workflow:**\n```bash\nyarn lint:staged && yarn tsc:staged && git commit -m \"your message\"\n```\n\n### CI Commands (Full Project Check)\n\n**These run in CI pipeline, not for local pre-commit:**\n- `yarn lint` - **CI ONLY** comprehensive linting\n  - **Expected runtime**: 5-10 minutes\n  - **Zero tolerance**: ALL warnings and errors MUST be fixed\n- `yarn lint:only` - Quick lint check (all files)\n- `yarn tsc:only` - Full TypeScript type check\n- `yarn test` - Test execution\n\n### Other Tools\n\n- `yarn clean` - Clean all build artifacts and node_modules\n- `yarn reinstall` - Full clean install (use when dependency issues occur)\n\n## Testing\n\n- Jest configuration in `jest.config.js`\n- Test setup in `jest-setup.js`\n- Tests located in `__tests__/` or `@tests/` directories within packages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:34:31.008Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined application development workflows with yarn and Electron","zh":"非常适合需要使用yarn和Electron简化应用开发工作流程的开发代理","ja":"yarnとElectronを使用してアプリケーション開発のワークフローを簡素化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"yarn과 Electron을 사용하여 애플리케이션 개발 워크플로를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de aplicaciones optimizados con yarn y Electron","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de flux de travail de développement d''applications rationalisés avec yarn et Electron","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die optimierte Workflow-Prozesse für die Anwendungsentwicklung mit yarn und Electron benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de aplicativos otimizados com yarn e Electron","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы оптимизированные рабочие процессы разработки приложений с помощью yarn и Electron","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تيار عمل مطور تطبيقات متدفق مع yarn و Electron"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage desktop and web application development using yarn commands, such as `yarn app:desktop` and `yarn app:web`, for rapid prototyping and testing with Node and native dependencies","zh":"赋予代理高效管理桌面和Web应用开发的能力，使用yarn命令（如`yarn app:desktop`和`yarn app:web`）进行快速原型设计和测试，使用Node和本地依赖项","ja":"エージェントがデスクトップおよびWebアプリケーション開発を効率的に管理できるようにし、yarnコマンド（例： `yarn app:desktop`および`yarn app:web`）を使用してNodeおよびネイティブ依存関係とともに迅速なプロトタイピングおよびテストを行う","ko":"에이전트가 데스크톱 및 웹 애플리케이션 개발을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `yarn app:desktop` 및 `yarn app:web`와 같은 yarn 명령을 사용하여 Node 및 네이티브 종속성과 함께 빠른 프로토타이핑 및 테스트를 수행할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de manera eficiente el desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio y web utilizando comandos de yarn, como `yarn app:desktop` y `yarn app:web`, para prototipado y pruebas rápidas con Node y dependencias nativas","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement le développement d''applications de bureau et web en utilisant des commandes yarn, comme `yarn app:desktop` et `yarn app:web`, pour un prototypage et des tests rapides avec Node et des dépendances natives","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Entwicklung von Desktop- und Webanwendungen effizient zu verwalten, indem sie yarn-Befehle wie `yarn app:desktop` und `yarn app:web` für schnelles Prototyping und Testing mit Node und nativen Abhängigkeiten verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma eficiente o desenvolvimento de aplicativos de desktop e web usando comandos yarn, como `yarn app:desktop` e `yarn app:web`, para prototipagem e teste rápidos com Node e dependências nativas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять разработкой настольных и веб-приложений, используя команды yarn, такие как `yarn app:desktop` и `yarn app:web`, для быстрого прототипирования и тестирования с Node и родными зависимостями","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إدارة تطوير التطبيقات سطح المكتب والويب بفعالية باستخدام أوامر yarn مثل `yarn app:desktop` و `yarn app:web` من أجل النمذجة السريعة والاختبار مع Node والاعتماديات الأصلية"},"useCases":{"en":["Starting desktop Electron app development with `yarn app:desktop`","Launching web development servers using `yarn app:web`","Troubleshooting startup issues with `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"],"zh":["使用`yarn app:desktop`启动桌面Electron应用开发","使用`yarn app:web`启动Web开发服务器","使用`yarn clean && yarn reinstall`解决启动问题"],"ja":["`yarn app:desktop`を使用してデスクトップElectronアプリ開発を開始する","`yarn app:web`を使用してWeb開発サーバーを起動する","`yarn clean && yarn reinstall`を使用して起動時の問題を解決する"],"ko":["`yarn app:desktop`를 사용하여 데스크톱 Electron 애플리케이션 개발을 시작하는 경우","`yarn app:web`를 사용하여 웹 개발 서버를 시작하는 경우","`yarn clean && yarn reinstall`를 사용하여 시작 시 발생하는 문제를 해결하는 경우"],"es":["Inicio del desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio Electron con `yarn app:desktop`","Iniciar servidores de desarrollo web con `yarn app:web`","Solucionar problemas de inicio con `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"],"fr":["Démarrage du développement d''applications de bureau Electron avec `yarn app:desktop`","Lancement de serveurs de développement web avec `yarn app:web`","Dépannage des problèmes de démarrage avec `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"],"de":["Starten der Entwicklung von Desktop-Electron-Anwendungen mit `yarn app:desktop`","Starten von Web-Entwicklungsservern mit `yarn app:web`","Beheben von Startproblemen mit `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"],"pt":["Iniciando o desenvolvimento de aplicativos Electron de desktop com `yarn app:desktop`","Iniciando servidores de desenvolvimento web usando `yarn app:web`","Solucionando problemas de inicialização com `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"],"ru":["Начало разработки настольных приложений Electron с помощью `yarn app:desktop`","Запуск веб-серверов разработки с помощью `yarn app:web`","Устранение неполадок при запуске с помощью `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"],"ar":["بدء تطوير تطبيقات Electron لسطح المكتب باستخدام `yarn app:desktop`","تشغيل خوادم تطوير الويب باستخدام `yarn app:web`","معالجة مشاكل التشغيل مع `yarn clean && yarn reinstall`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires yarn and Node installation","May encounter Node version conflicts or missing native dependencies","Limited to Electron and web application development"],"zh":["需要安装yarn和Node","可能会遇到Node版本冲突或缺失的本地依赖项","仅限Electron和Web应用开发"],"ja":["yarnおよびNodeのインストールが必要","Nodeのバージョンコンフリクトや不足しているネイティブ依存関係に遭遇する可能性がある","ElectronおよびWebアプリケーション開発のみに限定"],"ko":["yarn 및 Node 설치가 필요합니다","Node 버전 충돌 또는 누락된 네이티브 종속성과 같은 문제가 발생할 수 있습니다","Electron 및 웹 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de yarn y Node","Puede encontrar conflictos de versión de Node o dependencias nativas que faltan","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones Electron y web"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de yarn et de Node","Peut rencontrer des conflits de version de Node ou des dépendances natives manquantes","Limité au développement d''applications Electron et web"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von yarn und Node","Kann auf Node-Versionen-Konflikte oder fehlende native Abhängigkeiten stoßen","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Electron- und Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do yarn e do Node","Pode encontrar conflitos de versão do Node ou dependências nativas ausentes","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos Electron e web"],"ru":["Требует установки yarn и Node","Может столкнуться с конфликтами версий Node или отсутствием родных зависимостей","Ограничен разработкой приложений Electron и веб-приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت yarn و Node","يمكن أن يواجه صراعات إصدار Node أو نقصاً في الاعتماديات الأصلية","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات Electron والويب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3639301ff37479134f57a0e539321dbad39e3d6745aff256b0bed0b8cf2f4153","qualityScore":39}');
