te a Node.js e Python","Documentação completa"],"ru":["Нейронная сеть для разработчиков","Оптимизация творчества","Интеграция с CLI","Поддержка Node.js и Python","Полная документация"],"ar":["شبكة عصبية للمطورين","تحسين الإبداع","التكامل مع CLI","دعم Node.js و Python","توثيق كامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用sc-managing-worktrees","sc-managing-worktrees是什么","sc-managing-worktrees替代品","sc-managing-worktrees和git的区别","sc-managing-worktrees安装指南","sc-managing-worktrees设置教程"],"ja":["sc-managing-worktreesの使い方","sc-managing-worktreesとは","sc-managing-worktreesの代替品","sc-managing-worktreesとgitの違い","sc-managing-worktreesのインストールガイド","sc-managing-worktreesの設定方法"],"ko":["sc-managing-worktrees 사용 방법","sc-managing-worktrees란","sc-managing-worktrees 대안","sc-managing-worktrees와 git의 차이","sc-managing-worktrees 설치 가이드","sc-managing-worktrees 설정 방법"],"es":["herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","sc-managing-worktrees","redes neuronales para desarrollo","mejora de la creatividad","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","automatización de tareas","colaboración en equipo","integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["outils IA pour les développeurs","sc-managing-worktrees","réseaux neuronaux pour le développement","amélioration de la créativité","flux de travail de développement","automatisation de tâches","collaboration d''équipe","intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","sc-managing-worktrees","neuronale Netze für die Entwicklung","Verbesserung der Kreativität","Arbeitsablauf der Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Zusammenarbeit im Team","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["como usar sc-managing-worktrees","o que é sc-managing-worktrees","alternativas para sc-managing-worktrees","sc-managing-worktrees vs GitHub","instalar sc-managing-worktrees","guia de configuração do sc-managing-worktrees"],"ru":["как использовать sc-managing-worktrees","что такое sc-managing-worktrees","альтернативы sc-managing-worktrees","sc-managing-worktrees vs GitHub","установить sc-managing-worktrees","руководство по настройке sc-managing-worktrees"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام sc-managing-worktrees","ما هو sc-managing-worktrees","بديل sc-managing-worktrees","sc-managing-worktrees مقابل GitHub","تثبيت sc-managing-worktrees","دليل إعداد sc-managing-worktrees"]}},"owner":"randlee","repo":"synaptic-canvas","repoPath":"randlee/synaptic-canvas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.881Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sc-managing-worktrees","description":">","version":"0.8.0","bodyPreview":"# Managing Git Worktrees\n\nUse this skill to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking. Use the `/sc-git-worktree` command to invoke this skill.\n\n## Agent Delegation\n\nThis skill delegates to specialized agents via the **Task tool**:\n\n| Operation | Agent | Returns |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Create | `sc-worktree-create` | JSON: success, path, branch, tracking_row |\n| Scan | `sc-worktree-scan` | JSON: success, worktrees list, recommendations |\n| Cleanup | `sc-worktree-cleanup","body":"# Managing Git Worktrees\n\nUse this skill to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking. Use the `/sc-git-worktree` command to invoke this skill.\n\n## Agent Delegation\n\nThis skill delegates to specialized agents via the **Task tool**:\n\n| Operation | Agent | Returns |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Create | `sc-worktree-create` | JSON: success, path, branch, tracking_row |\n| Scan | `sc-worktree-scan` | JSON: success, worktrees list, recommendations |\n| Cleanup | `sc-worktree-cleanup` | JSON: success, branch_deleted, tracking_update |\n| Abort | `sc-worktree-abort` | JSON: success, worktree_removed, tracking_update |\n| Update | `sc-worktree-update` | JSON: success, commits_pulled, conflicts (if any) |\n\nTo invoke an agent, use the Task tool with:\n- Prompt file: `.claude/agents/<agent-name>.md`\n- Parameters as documented in each agent''s Inputs section\n\n## Standards and paths\n- Repo root: current directory.\n- Default worktree base: `../synaptic-canvas-worktrees`.\n- Worktrees live in `<worktree_base>/<branch>`.\n- Tracking document (if used): `<worktree_base>/worktree-tracking.md` must be updated on create/scan/cleanup/abandon. Allow a toggle to disable tracking for repos that don''t use it.\n- Naming: worktree directory = branch name; branch naming follows repo policy (e.g., master release; develop/DevBranch integration; feature from integration; hotfix from master; release branches as needed).\n- Branch protections/hooks: no direct commits to protected branches; ensure hooks/branch protections are respected across worktrees.\n- Cleanliness: worktrees must be removed and tracking updated when work is complete or branch is merged.\n\n## Protected Branch Configuration\n\nProtected branches (main, develop, master, etc.) require special handling to prevent accidental deletion:\n\n```yaml\n# Configuration (typically in repo .claude/config or passed to agents)\ngit_flow:\n  enabled: true  # boolean: whether git-flow workflow is used\n  main_branch: \"main\"  # or \"master\" - the primary production branch\n  develop_branch: \"develop\"  # only if git_flow.enabled = true\n\nprotected_branches:\n  - \"main\"\n  - \"develop\"\n  - \"master\"\n  # Can include additional patterns: \"release/*\", \"hotfix/*\"\n```\n\n**Protected Branch Rules:**\n- If `git_flow.enabled: false` → protect only `main_branch`\n- If `git_flow.enabled: true` → protect `main_branch` + `develop_branch`\n- Additional branches can be added to `protected_branches` array\n- **Cleanup/abort agents NEVER delete protected branches** (local or remote)\n- Protected branches can only be removed from worktrees, never deleted\n- Use `--update` to safely pull changes for protected branches in worktrees\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Scaffolding (if missing)\n- Ensure base path exists: `<worktree_base>`. If missing, create it.\n- If tracking is enabled, ensure tracking doc exists with headers.\n\n### Create worktree (and branch)\n1) Inputs: `--branch <name>`, `--base <master|develop|...>`, optional `--path`.\n2) Ensure scaffolding/tracking doc exists (if enabled); fetch all: `git fetch --all --prune`.\n3) Confirm base branch exists and is up to date.\n4) Determine path: default `<worktree_base>/<branch>` (or override).\n5) Create branch/worktree:\n   - If branch does not yet exist: `git worktree add -b <branch> <path> <base>`.\n   - If branch exists: `git worktree add <path> <branch>`.\n6) In the new worktree, ensure hooks apply and verify status is clean.\n7) If tracking enabled, add/refresh entry in tracking doc (branch, path, base, purpose, owner, created date, status).\n8) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-create` agent; it returns structured JSON (tracking row, status).\n\n### Scan/verify worktrees\n1) List worktrees: `git worktree list --porcelain`.\n2) Cross-check tracking doc (if enabled); flag missing/stale entries or extra rows.\n3) For each worktree, check status and merge state:\n   - `git -C <path> status --short`\n   - `git -C <path> fetch`\n   - `git branch --remotes --contains <branch>` to see if merged.\n4) Identify issues: untracked changes, diverged branches, merged-but-not-cleaned worktrees, missing tracking entries.\n5) Update tracking doc with current state and issues (if enabled); propose cleanup where appropriate.\n6) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-scan` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Clean-up worktree (post-merge or finished work)\n1) **Check if branch is protected**: If branch is in protected_branches list, ONLY remove worktree, NEVER delete the branch.\n2) If `git status` is not clean, stop and request explicit approval/coordination.\n3) Ensure all work is committed/pushed or explicitly confirmed to discard.\n4) Confirm target branch merged or otherwise approved for removal.\n5) Remove worktree: `git worktree remove <path>` (use `--force` only with approval).\n6) For **non-protected branches**: If merged and no unique commits, delete the branch locally (`git branch -d <branch>`) and remotely (`git push origin --delete <branch>`) by default; only skip if the user explicitly opts out. If the remote branch is already absent, continue without error. If not merged, only delete with explicit approval.\n7) For **protected branches**: Only remove worktree, preserve branch locally and remotely. Update tracking to note \"worktree removed, branch preserved (protected)\".\n8) If tracking enabled, update tracking doc to remove/mark cleaned with merge SHA/date.\n9) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-cleanup` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Abandon worktree (discard work)\n1) **Check if branch is protected**: If branch is in protected_branches list, ONLY remove worktree, NEVER delete the branch.\n2) If `git status` is not clean, stop and request explicit approval/coordination.\n3) Confirm user approval to discard local changes and optionally delete the branch.\n4) Remove worktree: `git worktree remove <path>` (force only with approval).\n5) For **non-protected branches**: If instructed, delete the branch locally (`git branch -D <branch>`) and remotely (`git push origin --delete <branch>`).\n6) For **protected branches**: Only remove worktree, preserve branch locally and remotely. Require confirmation: \"Branch is protected. Remove worktree but preserve branch?\"\n7) If tracking enabled, update tracking doc to remove the entry and note abandonment.\n8) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-abort` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Update protected branch (pull latest changes)\n1) **Verify branch is protected**: Only operates on branches in protected_branches list. If no branch is specified, update all protected branches that have worktrees.\n2) Check if worktree exists at expected path; error if missing.\n3) If `git status` is not clean, stop and report dirty state.\n4) Fetch and pull: `git fetch origin <branch>` then `git pull origin <branch>`.\n5) **If merge conflicts occur**:\n   - Collect conflicted files: `git diff --name-only --diff-filter=U`\n   - Return control to main agent with conflict details\n   - Main agent coordinates with user to resolve conflicts\n   - After resolution, user commits and continues\n6) **If clean pull**: Update tracking with last_checked timestamp and commits pulled count.\n7) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-update` agent; it returns structured JSON with success or conflict details.\n\n## Safety and reminders\n- **NEVER delete protected branches** (main, develop, master) under any circumstances.\n- Protected branches can only be removed from worktrees; the branch itself must always be preserved.\n- Never delete branches or force-remove worktrees without explicit approval.\n- Never clean/abandon a worktree with uncommitted changes unless explicitly approved.\n- Keep tracking doc in sync on every operation when enabled.\n- Respect branch protections and hooks; no direct commits to protected branches.\n- Use background agents for long scans/cleanups; keep the main context focused on decisions and summaries.\n- When updating protected branches in worktrees, handle merge conflicts by returning control to main agent for user coordination.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:53:13.282Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-integrated AI Agents needing advanced worktree management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级工作树管理功能的Git集成AI代理。","ja":"Git統合AIエージェントが高度なワークツリー管理機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 작업 트리 관리 기능이 필요한 Git 통합 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA integrados con Git que necesitan capacidades de gestión de worktree avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA intégrés à Git nécessitant des capacités de gestion de worktree avancées.","de":"Ideal für in Git integrierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Worktree-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA integrados ao Git que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de worktree.","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, интегрированных с Git, требующих продвинутых возможностей управления worktree.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتكامل مع Git الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة worktree."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking using the `/sc-git-worktree` command, leveraging JSON data for success, path, branch, and tracking row information, and delegates tasks to specialized agents via the Task tool.","zh":"赋予代理管理工作树的标准结构和跟踪使用 `/sc-git-worktree` 命令的能力，利用 JSON 数据来成功、路径、分支和跟踪行信息，并通过 Task 工具将任务委托给专用代理。","ja":"エージェントに `/sc-git-worktree` コマンドを使用して標準構造とトラッキングを持つワークツリーを管理する能力を付与し、JSON データを使用して成功、パス、ブランチ、およびトラッキング行情報を提供し、Task ツールを使用してタスクを専用エージェントに委任します。","ko":"에이전트에게 `/sc-git-worktree` 명령을 사용하여 표준 구조 및 추적을 갖춘 작업 트리를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, JSON 데이터를 사용하여 성공, 경로, 분기 및 추적 행 정보를 제공하며, Task 도구를 사용하여 태스크를専用 에이전트에 위임합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar worktrees con una estructura estándar y seguimiento utilizando el comando `/sc-git-worktree`, aprovechando los datos JSON para la información de éxito, ruta, rama y seguimiento de fila, y delega tareas a agentes especializados a través de la herramienta Task.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des worktrees avec une structure standard et un suivi en utilisant la commande `/sc-git-worktree`, en exploitant les données JSON pour les informations de réussite, de chemin, de branche et de suivi de ligne, et délègue des tâches à des agents spécialisés via l''outil Task.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Worktrees mit einer Standardstruktur und Nachverfolgung unter Verwendung des Befehls `/sc-git-worktree` zu verwalten, indem JSON-Daten für Erfolgs-, Pfad-, Branch- und Nachverfolgungszeileninformationen genutzt werden, und delegiert Aufgaben an spezialisierte Agents über das Task-Tool.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar worktrees com uma estrutura padrão e rastreamento usando o comando `/sc-git-worktree`, aproveitando dados JSON para sucesso, caminho, branch e informações da linha de rastreamento, e delega tarefas a agentes especializados por meio da ferramenta Task.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять worktree с стандартной структурой и отслеживанием с помощью команды `/sc-git-worktree`, использует данные JSON для успеха, пути, ветки и информации о строке отслеживания, и делегирует задачи специализированным агентам через инструмент Task.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة worktrees ببنية معيارية وتعقب باستخدام الأمر `/sc-git-worktree` ، مستفيداً من بيانات JSON للنجاح والمسار والفرع ومعلومات صفحة التعقب ، و تفويض المهام إلى وكلاء متخصصين من خلال أداة Task."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new worktrees with the `sc-worktree-create` agent","Scanning existing worktrees for recommendations using the `sc-worktree-scan` agent","Cleaning up worktrees with the `sc-worktree-cleanup` agent"],"zh":["使用 `sc-worktree-create` 代理创建新的工作树","使用 `sc-worktree-scan` 代理扫描现有的工作树以获取建议","使用 `sc-worktree-cleanup` 代理清理工作树"],"ja":["`sc-worktree-create` エージェントを使用して新しいワークツリーを作成する","`sc-worktree-scan` エージェントを使用して既存のワークツリーをスキャンして推奨事項を取得する","`sc-worktree-cleanup` エージェントを使用してワークツリーをクリーンアップする"],"ko":["`sc-worktree-create` 에이전트를 사용하여 새로운 작업 트리를 생성하는 것","`sc-worktree-scan` 에이전트를 사용하여 기존 작업 트리를 스캔하여 추천을 받는 것","`sc-worktree-cleanup` 에이전트를 사용하여 작업 트리를 정리하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevos worktrees con el agente `sc-worktree-create`","Escaneo de worktrees existentes para recomendaciones utilizando el agente `sc-worktree-scan`","Limpieza de worktrees con el agente `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux worktrees avec l''agent `sc-worktree-create`","Analyse de worktrees existants pour des recommandations en utilisant l''agent `sc-worktree-scan`","Nettoyage de worktrees avec l''agent `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Worktrees mit dem Agent `sc-worktree-create`","Scannen von bestehenden Worktrees für Empfehlungen unter Verwendung des Agents `sc-worktree-scan`","Bereinigen von Worktrees mit dem Agent `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"pt":["Criação de novos worktrees com o agente `sc-worktree-create`","Varredura de worktrees existentes para recomendações usando o agente `sc-worktree-scan`","Limpeza de worktrees com o agente `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"ru":["Создание новых worktree с помощью агента `sc-worktree-create`","Сканирование существующих worktree для рекомендаций с помощью агента `sc-worktree-scan`","Очистка worktree с помощью агента `sc-worktree-cleanup`"],"ar":["إنشاء worktrees جديدة مع عميل `sc-worktree-create`","مسح worktrees الحالية لتوصيات باستخدام عميل `sc-worktree-scan`","تنظيف worktrees مع عميل `sc-worktree-cleanup`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Dependent on Task tool for agent delegation"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装","依赖 Task 工具进行代理委托"],"ja":["Git のインストールが必要","エージェントの委任には Task ツールに依存する"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요함","에이전트 위임에는 Task 도구에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Dependiente de la herramienta Task para la delegación de agentes"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Dépend de l''outil Task pour la délégation d''agents"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Abhängig von dem Task-Tool für die Delegation von Agents"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Dependente da ferramenta Task para delegação de agentes"],"ru":["Требует установки Git","Зависит от инструмента Task для делегирования агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","يعتمد على أداة Task لتفويد الوكلاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1082cef00ec5f414c0ca666202d4023392dae287550e0711a3a7b9001962e97c","qualityScore":39}');
