ordinación entre repositorios","Integración con Matchpoint-AI organización","Optimización de los despliegues","Soporte para GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Déploiement de chartes Helm pour les déploiements GitHub Actions Runner Scale Set (ARC)","Amélioration de la coordination entre les référentiels","Intégration avec l''organisation Matchpoint-AI","Optimisation des déploiements","Prise en charge de GitHub Actions"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Helm-Charts für GitHub-Actions-Runner-Scale-Set-(ARC)-Deployments","Verbesserung der Koordination zwischen Repositories","Integration mit der Matchpoint-AI-Organisation","Optimierung der Bereitstellung","Unterstützung für GitHub Actions"],"pt":["Implantação de conjuntos de executores de GitHub Actions","Uso de Helm charts para gerenciar implantações","Integração com organizações Matchpoint-AI","Suporte a escalabilidade e flexibilidade","Fácil configuração e gerenciamento"],"ru":["Развертывание наборов.runners GitHub Actions","Использование Helm charts для управления развертываниями","Интеграция с организациями Matchpoint-AI","Поддержка масштабируемости и гибкости","Легкая конфигурация и управление"],"ar":["تنفيذ مجموعات تشغيل GitHub Actions","استخدام Helm charts لإدارة التنفيذ","التكامل مع منظمات Matchpoint-AI","دعم للتوسع والمرونة","تكوين وادارة سهلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","cross-repo-coordination","Helm charts","GitHub Actions Runner Scale Set","Matchpoint-AI","如何使用cross-repo-coordination","cross-repo-coordination安装指南","cross-repo-coordination vs 其他AI工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","cross-repo-coordination","Helm charts","GitHub Actions Runner Scale Set","Matchpoint-AI","cross-repo-coordinationの使い方","cross-repo-coordinationのインストールガイド","cross-repo-coordination vs 他のAIツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","cross-repo-coordination","Helm charts","GitHub Actions Runner Scale Set","Matchpoint-AI","cross-repo-coordination 사용법","cross-repo-coordination 설치 가이드","cross-repo-coordination vs 다른 AI 도구"],"es":["cómo usar Helm charts","qué es cross-repo-coordination","Herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","despliegue de GitHub Actions","Matchpoint-AI alternativa","instalación de Helm","guía de configuración de GitHub Actions"],"fr":["comment utiliser les chartes Helm","qu''est-ce que cross-repo-coordination","Outils d''Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","déploiement de GitHub Actions","Matchpoint-AI alternative","installation de Helm","guide de configuration de GitHub Actions"],"de":["wie man Helm-Charts verwendet","was ist cross-repo-coordination","KI-Agents-Tools","Bereitstellung von GitHub Actions","Matchpoint-AI Alternative","Helm-Installation","Konfigurationsanleitung für GitHub Actions"],"pt":["como usar helm charts","o que é coordenação entre repositórios","ferramentas de ia para dev","github actions runner scale set","matchpoint-ai alternative","helm charts para implantação","devops tools para github","como configurar helm charts","o que é github actions"],"ru":["как использовать helm charts","что такое координация между репозиториями","инструменты ии для разработчиков","github actions runner scale set","matchpoint-ai альтернатива","helm charts для развертывания","devops инструменты для github","как настроить helm charts","что такое github actions"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام helm charts","ما هي تنسيق بين المستودعات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مجموعات تشغيل github actions","بديل matchpoint-ai","helm charts لتنفيذ","أدوات devops لgithub","كيفية تكوين helm charts","ما هي github actions"]}},"owner":"Matchpoint-AI","repo":"matchpoint-github-runners-helm","repoPath":"Matchpoint-AI/matchpoint-github-runners-helm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.902Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cross-repo-coordination","description":"Coordinate changes across project-beta repositories when updating runner configurations. Ensures workflow labels match runner scale set names. Use when changing runnerScaleSetName or deploying new runner pools.","bodyPreview":"# Cross-Repository Workflow Coordination Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nGitHub Actions workflows in the project-beta ecosystem use self-hosted runners. When runner configurations change, ALL repositories using those runners need coordinated updates.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nmatchpoint-github-runners-helm\n├── Defines runnerScaleSetName: \"arc-beta-runners\"\n└── ArgoCD deploys runners with this label\n\nproject-beta-frontend\nproject-beta-api           } Must use: runs-on: arc-beta-runners\nproject-beta\n```\n\n**Critic","body":"# Cross-Repository Workflow Coordination Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nGitHub Actions workflows in the project-beta ecosystem use self-hosted runners. When runner configurations change, ALL repositories using those runners need coordinated updates.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nmatchpoint-github-runners-helm\n├── Defines runnerScaleSetName: \"arc-beta-runners\"\n└── ArgoCD deploys runners with this label\n\nproject-beta-frontend\nproject-beta-api           } Must use: runs-on: arc-beta-runners\nproject-beta\n```\n\n**Critical Rule:** Workflow `runs-on:` MUST EXACTLY match Helm `runnerScaleSetName`\n\n## The Coordination Problem\n\n### Issue #121 Example\n\n**Change:** Update `runnerScaleSetName` from `arc-runners` to `arc-beta-runners`\n\n**Impact:**\n```\nmatchpoint-github-runners-helm\n  ✅ runnerScaleSetName: \"arc-beta-runners\"\n\nproject-beta-frontend (15 workflows)\n  ❌ runs-on: arc-runners  # OLD label - jobs stuck!\n\nproject-beta-api (13 workflows)\n  ❌ runs-on: arc-runners  # OLD label - jobs stuck!\n\nproject-beta (3 workflows)\n  ❌ runs-on: arc-runners  # OLD label - jobs stuck!\n```\n\n**Result:** All CI jobs stuck in \"queued\" state until workflows updated.\n\n## Affected Repositories\n\n| Repository | Workflows | Runner Labels | Priority |\n|------------|-----------|---------------|----------|\n| project-beta-frontend | 15 files | arc-beta-runners | P0 - Blocks deploys |\n| project-beta-api | 13 files | arc-beta-runners | P0 - Blocks deploys |\n| project-beta | 3 files | arc-beta-runners | P0 - Blocks infra |\n\n## Coordination Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Planning\n\nBefore changing `runnerScaleSetName`, audit all repositories:\n\n```bash\n# Search for current runner label usage\nfor repo in project-beta-frontend project-beta-api project-beta; do\n  echo \"=== $repo ===\"\n  cd /path/to/$repo\n  grep -r \"runs-on:\" .github/workflows/ | grep -v \"ubuntu-latest\" | sort -u\ndone\n```\n\n**Output example:**\n```\n=== project-beta-frontend ===\n.github/workflows/ci.yaml:    runs-on: arc-runners\n.github/workflows/deploy.yaml:    runs-on: arc-runners\n...\n\n=== project-beta-api ===\n.github/workflows/test.yaml:    runs-on: arc-runners\n...\n```\n\n**Document the changes needed:**\n- Count of files per repository\n- Specific workflow files affected\n- Any workflows using different labels\n\n### Phase 2: Create Migration Plan\n\n**Option A: Dual Runner Pools (Zero Downtime)**\n\nDeploy BOTH old and new runner pools during transition:\n\n```yaml\n# matchpoint-github-runners-helm/argocd/applicationset-runners.yaml\ngenerators:\n- list:\n    elements:\n    - name: arc-runners           # OLD - for existing workflows\n      valuesFile: examples/runners-values-old.yaml\n    - name: arc-beta-runners      # NEW - for updated workflows\n      valuesFile: examples/runners-values-new.yaml\n```\n\n**Timeline:**\n1. Deploy both runner pools\n2. Update workflows in all repos (can be done gradually)\n3. Remove old runner pool after all workflows migrated\n\n**Pros:**\n- Zero downtime\n- Safe rollback (revert workflow changes)\n- Can update repos independently\n\n**Cons:**\n- 2x runner costs during migration\n- Need to track which repos migrated\n\n**Option B: Coordinated Single Cutover**\n\nUpdate runner AND all workflows simultaneously:\n\n1. Prepare PRs in ALL repositories (don''t merge)\n2. Merge runner config change\n3. Wait for ArgoCD sync (~3 min)\n4. Merge ALL workflow PRs quickly\n5. Monitor for stuck jobs\n\n**Pros:**\n- No extra runner costs\n- Clean cutover\n\n**Cons:**\n- ~3-5 minute CI outage\n- Requires coordination across repos\n- Risky if issues arise\n\n**Recommended:** Option A for production, Option B for dev/test\n\n### Phase 3: Update Workflows\n\nFor each repository, create a PR that updates ALL workflow files:\n\n```bash\n# Script: update-runner-labels.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n\nOLD_LABEL=\"arc-runners\"\nNEW_LABEL=\"arc-beta-runners\"\nREPO=$1\n\ncd /path/to/$REPO\n\n# Find all workflow files\nWORKFLOWS=$(find .github/workflows -name \"*.ya*ml\")\n\n# Update each file\nfor workflow in $WORKFLOWS; do\n  if grep -q \"runs-on: $OLD_LABEL\" \"$workflow\"; then\n    echo \"Updating: $workflow\"\n    sed -i \"s/runs-on: $OLD_LABEL/runs-on: $NEW_LABEL/g\" \"$workflow\"\n  fi\ndone\n\n# Create PR\ngit checkout -b fix/update-runner-label-to-$NEW_LABEL\ngit add .github/workflows/\ngit commit -m \"ci: Update runner label from $OLD_LABEL to $NEW_LABEL\n\nAligns with runner configuration change in matchpoint-github-runners-helm.\n\nRefs: matchpoint-ai/matchpoint-github-runners-helm#121\"\n\ngit push -u origin fix/update-runner-label-to-$NEW_LABEL\n\ngh pr create \\\n  --title \"ci: Update runner label from $OLD_LABEL to $NEW_LABEL\" \\\n  --body \"Updates all workflows to use the new runner label \\`$NEW_LABEL\\`.\n\n## Context\nmatchpoint-github-runners-helm changed \\`runnerScaleSetName\\` to \\`$NEW_LABEL\\`.\n\n## Changes\n- Updates all \\`.github/workflows/*.yaml\\` files\n- Changes \\`runs-on: $OLD_LABEL\\` → \\`runs-on: $NEW_LABEL\\`\n\n## Testing\n- [ ] Verify workflows use correct runner label\n- [ ] Confirm CI jobs execute (not stuck in queue)\n\nRelated: matchpoint-ai/matchpoint-github-runners-helm#121\"\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./update-runner-labels.sh project-beta-frontend\n./update-runner-labels.sh project-beta-api\n./update-runner-labels.sh project-beta\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Verification\n\nAfter merging workflow updates:\n\n```bash\n# Check that runners are picking up jobs\ngh run list --repo Matchpoint-AI/project-beta-frontend --limit 5\n\n# Verify no jobs stuck in queue\ngh run list --repo Matchpoint-AI/project-beta-frontend --status queued\n\n# Check runner status\ngh api /orgs/Matchpoint-AI/actions/runners --jq ''.runners[] | {name, status, busy, labels: [.labels[].name]}''\n```\n\n**Success criteria:**\n- ✅ No jobs stuck in \"queued\" for > 2 minutes\n- ✅ Jobs transition to \"in_progress\" quickly\n- ✅ Runners show \"busy: true\" when jobs running\n\n## Common Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Adding New Runner Pool\n\n**Example:** Add dedicated runners for frontend with GPU support\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Add runner pool in matchpoint-github-runners-helm:\n   ```yaml\n   # argocd/applicationset-runners.yaml\n   - name: arc-frontend-gpu\n     valuesFile: examples/frontend-gpu-values.yaml\n   ```\n\n2. Update ONLY affected workflows in project-beta-frontend:\n   ```yaml\n   # .github/workflows/e2e-visual-tests.yaml\n   jobs:\n     visual-tests:\n       runs-on: arc-frontend-gpu  # NEW pool\n   ```\n\n3. Keep other workflows on existing pool:\n   ```yaml\n   # .github/workflows/ci.yaml\n   jobs:\n     test:\n       runs-on: arc-beta-runners  # Existing pool\n   ```\n\n**Impact:** Only workflows explicitly updated use new pool\n\n### Scenario 2: Removing Runner Pool\n\n**Example:** Deprecate `arc-runners` in favor of `arc-beta-runners`\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Ensure NO workflows reference old label:\n   ```bash\n   for repo in project-beta-frontend project-beta-api project-beta; do\n     cd /path/to/$repo\n     grep -r \"runs-on: arc-runners\" .github/workflows/ && echo \"❌ Found old label in $repo\"\n   done\n   ```\n\n2. Remove runner pool from matchpoint-github-runners-helm:\n   ```yaml\n   # argocd/applicationset-runners.yaml\n   # Remove the arc-runners entry\n   ```\n\n3. Verify no queued jobs after removal:\n   ```bash\n   gh run list --status queued --limit 20\n   ```\n\n### Scenario 3: Emergency Runner Failover\n\n**Example:** Primary runner pool down, need to switch to backup\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Deploy backup runner pool (if not already deployed):\n   ```bash\n   # Quick deploy via ArgoCD\n   kubectl apply -f argocd/applications/arc-backup-runners.yaml\n   ```\n\n2. Bulk update workflows in critical repo:\n   ```bash\n   # Emergency script\n   find .github/workflows -name \"*.yaml\" -exec sed -i ''s/runs-on: arc-beta-runners/runs-on: arc-backup-runners/g'' {} \\;\n   git add .github/workflows/\n   git commit -m \"EMERGENCY: Switch to backup runners\"\n   git push\n   ```\n\n3. Monitor job execution:\n   ```bash\n   watch -n 5 ''gh run list --limit 10''\n   ```\n\n## Validation Scripts\n\n### Pre-Merge Validation\n\nRun before merging runner configuration changes:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# scripts/validate-runner-labels.sh\n\nset -euo pipefail\n\nRUNNER_LABEL=$1\nREPOS=(\"project-beta-frontend\" \"project-beta-api\" \"project-beta\")\n\necho \"🔍 Checking if workflows use runner label: $RUNNER_LABEL\"\n\nfor repo in \"${REPOS[@]}\"; do\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"=== $repo ===\"\n\n  if [ ! -d \"../$repo\" ]; then\n    echo \"⚠️  Repository not found: ../$repo\"\n    continue\n  fi\n\n  cd \"../$repo\"\n\n  MATCHES=$(grep -r \"runs-on: $RUNNER_LABEL\" .github/workflows/ 2>/dev/null | wc -l)\n\n  if [ \"$MATCHES\" -gt 0 ]; then\n    echo \"✅ Found $MATCHES workflow jobs using $RUNNER_LABEL\"\n    grep -r \"runs-on: $RUNNER_LABEL\" .github/workflows/ | head -5\n  else\n    echo \"❌ No workflows use $RUNNER_LABEL\"\n  fi\n\n  cd - > /dev/null\ndone\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\ncd matchpoint-github-runners-helm\n./scripts/validate-runner-labels.sh arc-beta-runners\n```\n\n### Post-Merge Validation\n\nRun after merging workflow updates:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# scripts/verify-ci-not-stuck.sh\n\nset -euo pipefail\n\nREPOS=(\"Matchpoint-AI/project-beta-frontend\" \"Matchpoint-AI/project-beta-api\" \"Matchpoint-AI/project-beta\")\n\necho \"🔍 Checking for stuck CI jobs...\"\n\nfor repo in \"${REPOS[@]}\"; do\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"=== $repo ===\"\n\n  QUEUED=$(gh run list --repo \"$repo\" --status queued --limit 50 --json databaseId,createdAt,status | jq -r ''.[] | select(.status == \"queued\") | \"\\(.databaseId) - queued since \\(.createdAt)\"'')\n\n  if [ -z \"$QUEUED\" ]; then\n    echo \"✅ No queued jobs\"\n  else\n    echo \"⚠️  Found queued jobs:\"\n    echo \"$QUEUED\"\n\n    # Check if any queued > 5 minutes\n    STUCK=$(echo \"$QUEUED\" | jq -r ''select(now - (.createdAt | fromdateiso8601) > 300)'')\n    if [ -n \"$STUCK\" ]; then\n      echo \"❌ Jobs stuck for > 5 minutes!\"\n    fi\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/verify-ci-not-stuck.sh\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Error: Jobs Stuck After Runner Change\n\n**Symptom:** CI jobs stuck in \"queued\" after runner label change\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Check what label runners have\nkubectl get autoscalingrunnerset -A -o jsonpath=''{.items[*].spec.runnerScaleSetName}''\n\n# Check what label workflows use\nfor repo in project-beta-frontend project-beta-api project-beta; do\n  cd ../$repo\n  grep -h \"runs-on:\" .github/workflows/* | sort -u\ndone\n```\n\n**Fix:**\n```bash\n# If mismatch found, update workflows\ncd ../project-beta-frontend\nfind .github/workflows -name \"*.yaml\" -exec sed -i ''s/runs-on: OLD_LABEL/runs-on: NEW_LABEL/g'' {} \\;\ngit commit -am \"fix: Update runner label to match deployed runners\"\ngit push\n```\n\n### Error: Some Repos Updated, Others Not\n\n**Symptom:** CI works in some repos but not others\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Check each repo''s workflows\nfor repo in project-beta-frontend project-beta-api project-beta; do\n  echo \"=== $repo ===\"\n  cd ../$repo\n  grep -h \"runs-on:\" .github/workflows/* | sort -u\n  cd -\ndone\n```\n\n**Fix:** Update remaining repos using update script\n\n### Error: Runners Deployed But Not Registering\n\n**Symptom:** Runners deployed but GitHub doesn''t show them\n\n**Diagnosis:**\n```bash\n# Check GitHub runners\ngh api /orgs/Matchpoint-AI/actions/runners --jq ''.runners[] | {name, labels: [.labels[].name]}''\n\n# Check Kubernetes runners\nkubectl get pods -n arc-beta-runners -l app.kubernetes.io/component=runner\n```\n\n**Fix:** See [arc-runner-troubleshooting](../arc-runner-troubleshooting/SKILL.md)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Plan multi-repo changes in advance** - Don''t surprise developers with stuck CI\n2. **Use dual runner pools during migration** - Eliminates downtime\n3. **Communicate changes** - Post in team chat before merging\n4. **Verify in dev first** - Test runner changes in development repo\n5. **Monitor after deployment** - Watch for queued jobs for 30 minutes post-change\n6. **Document runner labels** - Keep README updated with current label names\n7. **Automate validation** - Run validation scripts in CI for runner config changes\n\n## Coordination Checklist\n\nBefore changing `runnerScaleSetName`:\n\n- [ ] Audit all repos for workflow label usage\n- [ ] Document count of files per repo needing updates\n- [ ] Choose migration strategy (dual pool vs cutover)\n- [ ] Prepare PRs for all affected repos\n- [ ] Communicate change timeline to team\n- [ ] Deploy runner config change\n- [ ] Wait for ArgoCD sync (verify runners online)\n- [ ] Merge workflow PRs\n- [ ] Verify CI jobs execute successfully\n- [ ] Monitor for stuck jobs (30 minutes)\n- [ ] Clean up old runner pool (if dual pool strategy)\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [arc-runner-troubleshooting](../arc-runner-troubleshooting/SKILL.md) - Runner registration issues\n- [argocd-bootstrap](../argocd-bootstrap/SKILL.md) - Runner deployment via ArgoCD\n- [infrastructure-cd](../infrastructure-cd/SKILL.md) - Automated deployment workflow\n\n## Related Issues\n\n- #121 - releaseName/runnerScaleSetName mismatch causing empty labels\n- #123 - Cross-repo label update coordination\n- #112 - CI jobs stuck investigation\n- project-beta-api#798 - Workflow label update\n- project-beta-frontend#886 - CI blocked by label mismatch\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub Actions: runs-on](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/using-workflows/workflow-syntax-for-github-actions#jobsjob_idruns-on)\n- [ARC: Using Runners in Workflows](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners-with-actions-runner-controller/using-actions-runner-controller-runners-in-a-workflow)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:57:43.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated cross-repository workflow coordination in GitHub Actions environments","zh":"适用于需要在 GitHub Actions 环境中自动化跨存储库工作流协调的 DevOps Agent","ja":"GitHub Actions 環境におけるクロスリポジトリ ワークフロー コーディネーションを自動化する必要がある DevOps Agent に適しています","ko":"GitHub Actions 환경에서 리포지토리 간 워크플로우 조정을 자동화해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren coordinación de flujos de trabajo automatizados entre varios repositorios en entornos de GitHub Actions","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une coordination de flux de travail automatisée entre plusieurs référentiels dans des environnements GitHub Actions","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Koordination von Workflows zwischen mehreren Repositorien in GitHub Actions-Umgebungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem coordenação de fluxo de trabalho automatizada entre repositórios em ambientes GitHub Actions","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированной координации рабочих процессов между репозиториями в средах GitHub Actions","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يتطلب تنسيق تدفق العمل الآلي عبر المستودعات في بيئات GitHub Actions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to synchronize runner configurations across multiple repositories using Helm charts and ArgoCD, ensuring seamless deployments with labels like runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners","zh":"赋予代理人使用 Helm 图表和 ArgoCD 在多个存储库中同步运行器配置的能力，确保带有标签（如 runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners）的无缝部署","ja":"Helm チャートと ArgoCD を使用して複数のリポジトリでランナー構成を同期する能力をエージェントに与え、runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners などのラベルでシームレスなデプロイを可能にします","ko":"헬름 차트와 ArgoCD를 사용하여 여러 리포지토리에서 러너 구성을 동기화하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners와 같은 레이블을 사용한 무중단 배포를 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para sincronizar configuraciones de ejecutores en varios repositorios mediante gráficos Helm y ArgoCD, garantizando implementaciones sin problemas con etiquetas como runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners","fr":"Permet aux agents de synchroniser les configurations d''exécuteurs sur plusieurs référentiels à l''aide de graphiques Helm et d''ArgoCD, garantissant des déploiements sans problème avec des étiquettes comme runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Konfigurationen von Ausführern über mehrere Repositorien hinweg mithilfe von Helm-Diagrammen und ArgoCD zu synchronisieren, um eine nahtlose Bereitstellung mit Labels wie runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar configurações de executor em várias repositórios usando gráficos Helm e ArgoCD, garantindo implantações sem problemas com rótulos como runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать конфигурации запуска器 во множественных репозиториях с помощью диаграмм Helm и ArgoCD, обеспечивая бесперебойные развертывания с метками типа runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مزامنة تكوينات التشغيل عبر عدة مستودعات باستخدام رسوم Helm و ArgoCD، مما يضمن عمليات نشر بدون مشاكل مع علامات مثل runnerScaleSetName: arc-beta-runners"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating updates to self-hosted runners across project-beta ecosystem repositories","Coordinating deployments with ArgoCD for consistent runner configurations","Synchronizing runnerScaleSetName labels for unified workflow management"],"zh":["在 project-beta 生态系统存储库中自动更新自托管运行器","使用 ArgoCD 协调部署以实现一致的运行器配置","同步 runnerScaleSetName 标签以实现统一的工作流管理"],"ja":["project-beta エコシステム リポジトリでセルフホスト ランナーを自動更新する","ArgoCD を使用して一貫したランナー構成でデプロイを調整する","runnerScaleSetName ラベルを同期して統一されたワークフロー管理を実現する"],"ko":["project-beta 생态계 리포지토리에서 자체 호스트 러너를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","ArgoCD를 사용하여 일관된 러너 구성으로 배포를 조정하는 것","runnerScaleSetName 레이블을 동기화하여統一된 워크플로우 관리를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de ejecutores autohospedados en los repositorios del ecosistema project-beta","Coordinar implementaciones con ArgoCD para configuraciones de ejecutores coherentes","Sincronizar etiquetas de runnerScaleSetName para una gestión de flujos de trabajo unificada"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour des exécuteurs auto-hébergés sur les référentiels de l''écosystème project-beta","Coordonner les déploiements avec ArgoCD pour des configurations d''exécuteurs cohérentes","Synchroniser les étiquettes de runnerScaleSetName pour une gestion de flux de travail unifiée"],"de":["Automatisieren von Updates für selbstgehostete Runner im project-beta-Ökosystem-Repository","Koordinieren von Bereitstellungen mit ArgoCD für konsistente Runner-Konfigurationen","Synchronisieren von runnerScaleSetName-Labels für eine einheitliche Workflow-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de executores auto-hospedados em repositórios do ecossistema project-beta","Coordenar implantações com ArgoCD para configurações de executor consistentes","Mizar rótulos runnerScaleSetName para gestão de fluxo de trabalho unificada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления само-хостинговых запускаеров в репозиториях экосистемы project-beta","Координировать развертывания с помощью ArgoCD для последовательных конфигураций запускаеров","Синхронизировать метки runnerScaleSetName для унифицированного управления рабочим процессом"],"ar":["تutomatizar تحديث التشغيليين المضيفين ذاتيًا في مستودعات نظام البيئة project-beta","تنسيق عمليات النشر مع ArgoCD للحصول على تكوينات تشغيل موحدة","مزامنة علامات runnerScaleSetName لإدارة تدفق العمل الموحدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions and self-hosted runners setup","Dependent on Helm charts and ArgoCD for deployment","Limited to repositories using the same runner configurations"],"zh":["需要 GitHub Actions 和自托管运行器设置","依赖 Helm 图表和 ArgoCD 进行部署","仅限使用相同运行器配置的存储库"],"ja":["GitHub Actions とセルフホスト ランナーの設定が必要","Helm チャートと ArgoCD に依存してデプロイを行う","同じランナー構成を使用するリポジトリに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub Actions와 자체 호스트 러너 설정이 필요합니다","배포를 위해 헬름 차트와 ArgoCD에 의존합니다","同じ 러너 구성을 사용하는 리포지토리에서만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de GitHub Actions y ejecutores autohospedados","Depende de gráficos Helm y ArgoCD para la implementación","Limitado a repositorios que utilizan las mismas configuraciones de ejecutores"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GitHub Actions et d''exécuteurs auto-hébergés","Dépend de graphiques Helm et d''ArgoCD pour le déploiement","Limité aux référentiels utilisant les mêmes configurations d''exécuteurs"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von GitHub Actions und selbstgehosteten Runnern","Hängt von Helm-Diagrammen und ArgoCD für die Bereitstellung ab","Begrenzt auf Repositorien, die die gleichen Runner-Konfigurationen verwenden"],"pt":["Exige configuração de GitHub Actions e executores auto-hospedados","Dependente de gráficos Helm e ArgoCD para implantação","Limitado a repositórios que usam as mesmas configurações de executor"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub Actions и само-хостинговых запускаеров","Зависит от диаграмм Helm и ArgoCD для развертывания","Ограничен репозиториями, использующими одни и те же конфигурации запускаеров"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد GitHub Actions والتشغيليين المضيفين ذاتيًا","يعتمد على رسوم Helm و ArgoCD للنشر","محدود بالمستودعات التي تستخدم نفس تكوينات التشغيل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"582ac18099e3dc9c93f104a569daa3bb9603af23fa18497397c12823c73458ee","qualityScore":39}');
