n Kapiteln","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit der YouTube-API","Unterstützung mehrerer Videoformate"],"pt":["Geração de metadados para vídeos do YouTube","Criação de capítulos personalizados","Integração com a API do YouTube","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de vídeo","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Генерация метаданных для видео на YouTube","Создание пользовательских глав","Интеграция с API YouTube","Поддержка нескольких форматов видео","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс"],"ar":["إنشاء أوسمة لمقاطع فيديو يوتيوب","إنشاء فصول مخصصة","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات يوتيوب","دعم عدة صيغ فيديو","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 yt-genius","什么是 YouTube 元数据","yt-genius 替代品","yt-genius 安装","YouTube 章节生成","AI 智能工具","视频质量优化","用户体验改善"],"ja":["yt-genius の使い方","YouTube メタデータとは","yt-genius の代替","yt-genius のインストール","YouTube チャプター生成","AI エージェント","ビデオの品質最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの改善"],"ko":["yt-genius 사용법","YouTube 메타데이터란","yt-genius 대체품","yt-genius 설치","YouTube 장 생성","AI 에이전트","비디오 품질 최적화","사용자 경험 개선"],"es":["herramientas de AI para YouTube","cómo usar yt-genius","yt-genius alternativa","yt-genius vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de yt-genius","guía de configuración de yt-genius","mejora de la experiencia del usuario en YouTube","generación de metadatos para YouTube","creación de capítulos para YouTube"],"fr":["outils IA pour YouTube","comment utiliser yt-genius","yt-genius alternative","yt-genius vs autres outils IA","installation de yt-genius","guide de configuration de yt-genius","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur sur YouTube","génération de métadonnées pour YouTube","création de chapitres pour YouTube"],"de":["KI-Tools für YouTube","wie man yt-genius verwendet","yt-genius Alternative","yt-genius vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von yt-genius","Einrichtungsanleitung für yt-genius","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung auf YouTube","Erstellung von Metadaten für YouTube","Erstellung von Kapiteln für YouTube"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para youtube","como usar yt-genius","o que é yt-genius","yt-genius vs tubebuddy","yt-genius instalação","yt-genius guia de configuração","melhores ferramentas de ia para youtube","yt-genius alternativa"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для YouTube","как использовать yt-genius","что такое yt-genius","yt-genius vs tubebuddy","установка yt-genius","руководство по настройке yt-genius","лучшие инструменты ИИ для YouTube","альтернатива yt-genius"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ليوتيوب","كيفية استخدام yt-genius","ما هو yt-genius","yt-genius مقابل tubebuddy","تثبيت yt-genius","دليل إعداد yt-genius","أفضل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ليوتيوب","بديل yt-genius"]}},"owner":"peterfriese","repo":"yt-genius-skill","repoPath":"peterfriese/yt-genius-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.940Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"yt-genius","description":"Expertise in YouTube video optimization, generating metadata (titles, descriptions, chapters, SEO), and repurposing content for social media. Use when the user wants to write titles, descriptions, hashtags, or social posts for a video or script.","bodyPreview":"# YouTube Genius\n\nYou are a YouTube growth expert and content strategist. Your goal is to help the user maximize the reach and engagement of their video content.\n\n## Capabilities\n1.  **Metadata Generation**: Create click-worthy titles, SEO-optimized descriptions, timestamped chapters, info cards, and relevant hashtags.\n2.  **Social Media Repurposing**: Draft posts for Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and YouTube Community.\n3.  **Content Analysis**: Identify potential \"Shorts\" seg","body":"# YouTube Genius\n\nYou are a YouTube growth expert and content strategist. Your goal is to help the user maximize the reach and engagement of their video content.\n\n## Capabilities\n1.  **Metadata Generation**: Create click-worthy titles, SEO-optimized descriptions, timestamped chapters, info cards, and relevant hashtags.\n2.  **Social Media Repurposing**: Draft posts for Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and YouTube Community.\n3.  **Content Analysis**: Identify potential \"Shorts\" segments and suggest \"Gemini Nano Banana\" thumbnail concepts.\n4.  **Long-form Repurposing**: Convert transcripts into deep-dive Twitter articles with hero image concepts and embedded media markers.\n\n## Input Handling\nThe user may provide:\n*   **A YouTube URL**: Use the bundled script to fetch the transcript.\n*   **A Document/Text**: The user might provide a script or blog post directly, or point to a file/resource. If they point to a file, READ IT FIRST using your available tools (e.g., `read_resource`, `view_file`) before proceeding.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Get Content\n*   **If URL**: Run `scripts/get_transcript.py <url>`.\n    *   If successful, use the transcript text.\n    *   If it fails, ask the user if they can provide the transcript manually or a file.\n*   **If Document/Text**: Ensure you have read the full content.\n\n### Step 2: Analyze\n*   Identify the core value proposition (the \"Hook\").\n*   Summarize key takeaways.\n*   Analyze the tone (Educational, Entertaining, Rant, News).\n\n### Step 3: Generate Metadata\n**Titles**:\n*   Generate 5 options ranging from \"Safe/Search-based\" to \"High Click-Through Rate (CTR)/Click-baity\".\n*   *Constraint*: If user specifies a style (e.g. \"punchy\"), prioritize that.\n*   *Optimization*: Use power words, curiosity gaps, and clear value promises.\n\n**Description**:\n*   **Hook**: First 2 lines must be compelling (visible above the fold).\n*   **About**: 2-3 paragraphs summarizing the video with SEO keywords naturally integrated.\n*   **Resources**: A dedicated list of links mentioned in the video or relevant documentation. Use placeholders if specific URLs aren''t known (e.g., `[LINK TO FIREBASE DOCS]`).\n*   **Chapters**:\n    *   Generate timestamped chapters based on the transcript''s logical flow.\n    *   *Critical Requirement*: You MUST use the exact timestamps provided in the transcript for the start of each chapter. Do not hallucinate or shift timestamps.\n    *   *Workflow*:\n        1.  Scan the transcript for major topic shifts.\n        2.  Identify the first timestamp for each new section.\n        3.  Format as `[MM:SS] Chapter Title`.\n*   **Hashtags**: 3-5 broad and niche hashtags mixed.\n\n**Extras**:\n*   **Info Cards**: Identify 2-5 moments (timestamped) suitable for YouTube Info Cards (iCards). Suggest the type (Video, Playlist, Link) and the content/label.\n*   **Thumbnail**: Suggest a visual concept using the \"Gemini Nano Banana\" style (colorful, abstract but relevant, high contrast).\n*   **Shorts Scouter**: Identify 1-3 segments (timestamped) that stand alone well.\n\n### Step 4: Social Media Pack (Output)\nDraft copy for:\n1.  **Twitter/X**: A hook + thread starter or a punchy single tweet.\n2.  **LinkedIn**: A structured \"mini-article\" format (Hook -> Problem -> Solution -> Call to Discussion).\n3.  **Bluesky / Threads / Mastodon**: Short, conversational style.\n4.  **Twitter Long-form Article**:\n    *   **Delegation**: Use the `./subskills/article-expert/SKILL.md` subskill to generate a premium long-form article.\n    *   **Context**: Pass the transcript and the identified \"Hook\" to the subskill.\n    *   **Outcome**: The subskill will handle image generation, clipping, and final markdown assembly.\n5.  **YouTube Community**: A poll or \"Behind the scenes\" teaser.\n\n## Rules\n*   **Voice**: Professional but engaging. Avoid generic AI fluff (\"In today''s digital landscape...\"). Beat the \"boring AI\" allegations.\n*   **Formatting**: Use bolding for emphasis. Use lists for readability.\n*   **Feedback**: Always ask if the user wants to refine the titles or adjust the tone.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:09:18.824Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing advanced YouTube metadata optimization and social media repurposing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级YouTube元数据优化和社交媒体重用功能的内容创作代理。","ja":"YouTubeメタデータの高度な最適化およびソーシャルメディアの再利用機能を必要とするコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 YouTube 메타데이터 최적화 및 소셜 미디어 재사용 기능을 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan una optimización avanzada de metadatos de YouTube y capacidades de reutilización de medios sociales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée des métadonnées YouTube et de capacités de réutilisation des médias sociaux.","de":"Perfekt für Content Creation Agents, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von YouTube-Metadaten und Social-Media-Neunutzungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de otimização avançada de metadados do YouTube e capacidades de reutilização de mídia social.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации метаданных YouTube и переработки контента в социальных сетях.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لبيانات الفيديو على يوتيوب وقدرات إعادة استخدام الوسائط الاجتماعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate click-worthy titles, SEO-optimized descriptions, and timestamped chapters using metadata generation protocols, and repurpose content for Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and YouTube Community posts.","zh":"赋予代理生成点击值得的标题、SEO优化描述和时间戳章节，使用元数据生成协议，并为Twitter/X、LinkedIn、Bluesky、Mastodon、Threads和YouTube社区帖子重用内容。","ja":"メタデータ生成プロトコルを使用してクリック価値のあるタイトル、SEO最適化された説明、タイムスタンプ付きの章を生成し、Twitter/X、LinkedIn、Bluesky、Mastodon、Threads、YouTubeコミュニティの投稿のためにコンテンツを再利用するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"메타데이터 생성 프로토콜을 사용하여 클릭 가치가 있는 제목, SEO 최적화된 설명 및 타임스탬프가 있는 장을 생성하고 Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads 및 YouTube 커뮤니티 게시물에 대한 콘텐츠를 재사용하는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar títulos atractivos, descripciones optimizadas para SEO y capítulos con marca de tiempo utilizando protocolos de generación de metadatos, y a reutilizar contenido para publicaciones de Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads y YouTube Community.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des titres attractifs, des descriptions optimisées pour le SEO et des chapitres avec horodatage en utilisant des protocoles de génération de métadonnées, et de réutiliser le contenu pour les publications Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads et YouTube Community.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klickwürdige Titel, SEO-optimierte Beschreibungen und timestampete Kapitel mithilfe von Metadatengenerierungsprotokollen zu generieren und Inhalte für Twitter/X-, LinkedIn-, Bluesky-, Mastodon-, Threads- und YouTube-Community-Beiträge zu repurposen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem títulos atraentes, descrições otimizadas para SEO e capítulos com carimbo de data/hora usando protocolos de geração de metadados, e reutilizem o conteúdo para postagens no Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads e comunidades do YouTube.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать привлекающие внимание заголовки, описания, оптимизированные для поисковых систем, и главы с временными метками, используя протоколы генерации метаданных, а также перерабатывать контент для публикаций в Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads и сообществах YouTube.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله توليد عناوين جذابة ووصف محسن لتحسين محركات البحث والأفصول المحددة زمنيا باستخدام بروتوكولات توليد البيانات الوصفية، وإعادة استخدام المحتوى لنشره على تويتر/إكس، و لينكد إن، وبلوسكاي، وماستودون، وثرودز، ومجتمعات يوتيوب."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating metadata for YouTube videos","Repurposing content for cross-platform social media posts","Identifying potential ''Shorts'' segments for increased engagement"],"zh":["为YouTube视频生成元数据","为跨平台社交媒体帖子重用内容","识别潜在的''Shorts''段以提高参与度"],"ja":["YouTube動画のメタデータを生成する","クロスプラットフォームのソーシャルメディア投稿のためにコンテンツを再利用する","関与度の向上のための潜在的な''Shorts''セグメントを特定する"],"ko":["YouTube 비디오의 메타데이터 생성","크로스 플랫폼 소셜 미디어 게시물에 대한 콘텐츠 재사용","참여도 향상을 위한 잠재적인 ''Shorts'' 세그먼트 식별"],"es":["Generar metadatos para vídeos de YouTube","Reutilizar contenido para publicaciones de medios sociales en varias plataformas","Identificar segmentos potenciales de ''Shorts'' para un mayor compromiso"],"fr":["Générer des métadonnées pour les vidéos YouTube","Réutiliser le contenu pour les publications de médias sociaux sur plusieurs plateformes","Identifier les segments potentiels de ''Shorts'' pour un engagement accru"],"de":["Metadaten für YouTube-Videos generieren","Inhalte für Social-Media-Beiträge auf mehreren Plattformen repurposen","Potenzielle ''Shorts''-Segmente für erhöhtes Engagement identifizieren"],"pt":["Geração de metadados para vídeos do YouTube","Reutilização de conteúdo para postagens de mídia social em várias plataformas","Identificação de segmentos potenciais de ''Shorts'' para aumento do engajamento"],"ru":["Генерация метаданных для видео на YouTube","Переработка контента для постов в социальных сетях на разных платформах","Определение потенциальных сегментов ''Shorts'' для увеличения вовлеченности"],"ar":["توليد بيانات وصفية لفيديوهات يوتيوب","إعادة استخدام المحتوى لنشرات الوسائط الاجتماعية عبر منصات متعددة","تحديد مقاطع قصيرة محتملة لزيادة المشاركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to YouTube API for metadata generation","Limited to YouTube and specified social media platforms"],"zh":["需要访问YouTube API进行元数据生成","仅限YouTube和指定的社交媒体平台"],"ja":["メタデータ生成のためにYouTube APIへのアクセスが必要","YouTubeと指定されたソーシャルメディアプラットフォームのみに限定"],"ko":["메타데이터 생성을 위한 YouTube API 액세스가 필요","YouTube 및 지정된 소셜 미디어 플랫폼만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de YouTube para la generación de metadatos","Limitado a YouTube y plataformas de medios sociales especificadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API YouTube pour la génération de métadonnées","Limité à YouTube et aux plateformes de médias sociaux spécifiées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die YouTube-API für die Metadatengenerierung","Begrenzt auf YouTube und spezifizierte Social-Media-Plattformen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do YouTube para geração de metadados","Limitado ao YouTube e às plataformas de mídia social especificadas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API YouTube для генерации метаданных","Ограничен для YouTube и указанных платформ социальных сетей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات يوتيوب لتوليد البيانات الوصفية","محدود ليوتيوب ومنصات الوسائط الاجتماعية المحددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4a0e223da237e2d3a7521691233667f6002e5f80641e4a603157fa07567b2abc","qualityScore":39}');
