,"ko":["Anima AI 에이전트","TypeScript 애니메이션 엔진","Anima 사용 방법","Anima 설치 가이드","Anima 대안","Anima와 다른 애니메이션 엔진의 비교","TypeScript 애니메이션 라이브러리","JavaScript 애니메이션 프레임워크"],"es":["cómo usar Anima","qué es Anima","alternativas a Anima","Anima vs Manim","instalación de Anima","guía de configuración de Anima","desarrollo de animaciones con Anima"],"fr":["comment utiliser Anima","quoi est Anima","alternatives à Anima","Anima vs Manim","installation d''Anima","guide de configuration d''Anima","développement d''animations avec Anima"],"de":["wie man Anima verwendet","was ist Anima","Alternativen zu Anima","Anima vs Manim","Installation von Anima","Konfigurationsanleitung für Anima","Entwicklung von Animationen mit Anima"],"pt":["anima typescript animation","motor de animação para IA Agents","como usar anima","anima vs manim","anima install","anima setup guide","animação precisa typescript","ferramenta animação para desenvolvedores","anima alternative"],"ru":["anima typescript анимация","движок анимации для ИИ Агентов","как использовать anima","anima vs manim","anima установка","anima руководство по настройке","точная анимация typescript","инструмент анимации для разработчиков","anima альтернатива"],"ar":["anima typescript رسوم متحركة","محرك رسوم متحركة لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام anima","anima مقابل manim","تثبيت anima","دليل إعداد anima","رسوم متحركة دقيقة typescript","أداة رسوم متحركة للمطورين","بديل anima"]}},"owner":"RedWilly","repo":"Anima","repoPath":"RedWilly/Anima","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.957Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"anima","description":"Summarizes how to use the Anima animation engine (Scene, Mobjects, Fluent API, Pro API, camera, timeline, rendering, and CLI). Use when authoring or explaining Anima animations.","bodyPreview":"# Using the Anima Engine\n\nAnima is a TypeScript animation engine for mathematical visualizations. It runs on Bun and renders to canvas.\n\nImport everything from `''anima''` (the package index). All classes, animations, and easing functions are exported from there.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```ts\nimport { Scene, Circle, Rectangle, Color, easeInOutQuad } from ''anima'';\n\nexport class MyScene extends Scene {\n  constructor() {\n    super({ width: 1920, height: 1080, frameRate: 60, backgroundColor: Color.BLACK });","body":"# Using the Anima Engine\n\nAnima is a TypeScript animation engine for mathematical visualizations. It runs on Bun and renders to canvas.\n\nImport everything from `''anima''` (the package index). All classes, animations, and easing functions are exported from there.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```ts\nimport { Scene, Circle, Rectangle, Color, easeInOutQuad } from ''anima'';\n\nexport class MyScene extends Scene {\n  constructor() {\n    super({ width: 1920, height: 1080, frameRate: 60, backgroundColor: Color.BLACK });\n\n    const circle = new Circle(1).stroke(Color.WHITE, 2).pos(-2, 0); // radius 1, at position (-2, 0)\n    const rect = new Rectangle(2, 1).fill(Color.BLUE, 0.6).pos(2, 0); // 2×1, at position (2, 0)\n\n    // Items in the same play() call run in PARALLEL\n    this.play(\n      circle.fadeIn(1).moveTo(0, 0, 1), // fadeIn 1s, then move to (x=0, y=0) over 1s\n      rect.fadeIn(1)                     // fadeIn 1s (runs in parallel with circle''s chain)\n    );\n\n    this.wait(0.5); // 0.5 second pause\n\n    // Successive play() calls run SEQUENTIALLY\n    this.play(circle.fadeOut(0.5)); // fadeOut over 0.5s\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRender with CLI: `anima render myfile.ts -s MyScene -o output.mp4`\n\n## Coordinate System\n\nOrigin `(0, 0)` is screen center. Y-axis points **up**. Visible frame is ~14.2 × 8 world units at 1920×1080.\n\n## Skill Modules\n\nFor detailed usage of each subsystem, read the relevant module:\n\n| Module | What it covers |\n|---|---|\n| [Scene](rules/scene.md) | Scene setup, config, coordinate system, `play()`, `wait()`, `add()`/`remove()`, lifecycle rules |\n| [Mobjects](rules/mobjects.md) | Mobject/VMobject hierarchy, immediate setters (`pos`, `show`, `hide`, `setScale`, `setRotation`), `saveState()`/`restore()` |\n| [Geometry](rules/geometry.md) | `Circle`, `Rectangle`, `Line`, `Arrow`, `Arc`, `Polygon`, `Point` — constructors and usage |\n| [Styling](rules/styling.md) | `Color` class (presets, `fromHex`, `fromHSL`), `.stroke()`, `.fill()`, default appearance rules |\n| [Animations](rules/animations.md) | Fluent API (chaining), Pro API (explicit objects), `Sequence`, `Parallel`, `MorphTo`, `delay()`, hybrid usage |\n| [Easing](rules/easing.md) | All 30+ easing functions: standard, bounce, Manim-style rate functions, choosing guide |\n| [Camera](rules/camera.md) | `CameraFrame` animations (`zoomIn`, `zoomOut`, `centerOn`, `fitTo`, `zoomToPoint`), `Shake`, `Follow`, bounds, instant methods |\n| [Text](rules/text.md) | `Text` creation from font files, `TextStyle`, glyph access, animating text |\n| [Graph](rules/graph.md) | `Graph` nodes/edges, layout algorithms (`circular`, `tree`, `force-directed`), `updateEdges()` |\n| [VGroup](rules/vgroup.md) | `VGroup` children management, `arrange()`, `center()`, `toCorner()`, `alignTo()`, cascading styles |\n| [Keyframes](rules/keyframes.md) | `KeyframeAnimation`, `KeyframeTrack` — fine-grained multi-property keyframe control |\n| [Rendering](rules/rendering.md) | `Renderer`, formats (mp4/webp/gif/sprite/png), `Resolution` presets, quality, CLI commands, `serialize`/`deserialize` |\n\n## Core Rules for Authoring Scenes\n\n1. **Extend `Scene`** and build everything in the constructor.\n2. **Intro animations** (`fadeIn`, `write`, `draw`, `FadeIn`, `Write`, `Draw`) auto-add objects to the scene.\n3. **Transform/exit animations** (`moveTo`, `rotate`, `scaleTo`, `fadeOut`, etc.) require the target to already be in the scene.\n4. Use `this.add(obj)` for static objects that should be visible without animation.\n5. All durations are in **seconds**.\n6. All angles are in **radians**.\n7. Multiple items in one `this.play(...)` call run in **parallel**. Successive `play()` calls run **sequentially**.\n8. Use `this.wait(seconds)` to insert gaps between play calls.\n\n## Long Video Tips\n\nFor 30–50 minute videos:\n\n- **Structure in sections**: Group related animations with `this.wait()` between logical sections.\n- **Use `saveState()` / `restore()`**: Save object positions before zooming in, restore to return.\n- **Camera management**: Use `centerOn`, `fitTo`, and `zoomIn`/`zoomOut` to guide the viewer''s focus.\n- **Reuse objects**: `remove()` objects when done, `add()` new ones. Don''t leave hundreds of invisible objects in the scene.\n- **Use `Sequence` and `Parallel`**: For complex choreography, compose explicitly rather than deeply nesting fluent chains.\n- **Keyframes**: For complex motion paths, use `KeyframeAnimation` instead of chaining dozens of `moveTo` calls.\n- **Preview quality**: Use `quality: ''preview''` or the CLI `preview` command during iteration, switch to `production` for final render.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:18.688Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing precise, structured animations with clean visual output in TypeScript.","zh":"适合需要精确、结构化动画和干净视觉输出的前端代理，使用TypeScript。","ja":"TypeScriptを使用して、正確で構造化されたアニメーションとクリーンな視覚出力を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확하고 구조화된 애니메이션 및 깨끗한 시각적 출력이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, TypeScript를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan animaciones precisas y estructuradas con una salida visual limpia en TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''animations précises et structurées avec une sortie visuelle propre en TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die präzise, strukturierte Animationen mit sauberer visueller Ausgabe in TypeScript benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de animações precisas e estruturadas com saída visual limpa em TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Frontend-агентов, которым требуются точные, структурированные анимации с чистым визуальным выводом на TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى رسوم متحركة دقيقة ومنظمة مع إخراج بصري نظيف في TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create deterministic animations using Bun or Node.js, or directly in the browser, with features like easing functions and canvas rendering, utilizing the Anima engine and its compatibility with TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理创建确定性动画的能力，使用Bun或Node.js，或者直接在浏览器中，具有缓动函数和画布渲染等功能，利用Anima引擎及其与TypeScript的兼容性。","ja":"BunまたはNode.js、または直接ブラウザで、イージング関数やキャンバスレンダリングなどの機能を使用して、決定論的なアニメーションを作成するエージェントの能力を与え、AnimaエンジンとTypeScriptとの互換性を利用します。","ko":"Bun 또는 Node.js, 또는 직접 브라우저에서 이징 함수 및 캔버스 렌더링 등의 기능을 사용하여 결정적 애니메이션을 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Anima 엔진 및 TypeScript와의 호환성을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones deterministas utilizando Bun o Node.js, o directamente en el navegador, con características como funciones de suavizado y renderizado de canvas, utilizando el motor Anima y su compatibilidad con TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations déterministes en utilisant Bun ou Node.js, ou directement dans le navigateur, avec des fonctionnalités comme les fonctions de lissage et le rendu de canvas, en utilisant le moteur Anima et sa compatibilité avec TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, deterministische Animationen zu erstellen, indem sie Bun oder Node.js verwenden oder direkt im Browser, mit Funktionen wie Längsfunktionen und Canvas-Rendering, unter Verwendung des Anima-Motors und seiner Kompatibilität mit TypeScript.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar animações determinísticas usando Bun ou Node.js, ou diretamente no navegador, com recursos como funções de easing e renderização de canvas, utilizando o mecanismo Anima e sua compatibilidade com TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать детерминированные анимации с использованием Bun или Node.js, или непосредственно в браузере, с такими функциями, как функции сглаживания и рендеринг на canvas, используя движок Anima и его совместимость с TypeScript.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة حتمية باستخدام Bun أو Node.js، أو مباشرة في المتصفح، بميزات مثل وظائف التيسير وتقديم لوحة الرسم، مستخدمين محرك Anima وتوافقه مع TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating mathematical visualizations for educational content","Creating interactive animations for web applications","Debugging animation sequences with precise frame rate control"],"zh":["为教育内容生成数学可视化","为Web应用程序创建交互式动画","使用精确帧率控制调试动画序列"],"ja":["教育コンテンツのための数学的可視化を生成する","Webアプリケーションのためのインタラクティブアニメーションを作成する","正確なフレームレート制御を使用してアニメーションシーケンスをデバッグする"],"ko":["교육 콘텐츠를 위한 수학적 시각화를 생성","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 인터랙티브 애니메이션 생성","정확한 프레임 레이트 제어를 사용하여 애니메이션 시퀀스 디버깅"],"es":["Generación de visualizaciones matemáticas para contenido educativo","Creación de animaciones interactivas para aplicaciones web","Depuración de secuencias de animación con control de velocidad de cuadro preciso"],"fr":["Génération de visualisations mathématiques pour du contenu éducatif","Création d''animations interactives pour des applications web","Débogage de séquences d''animation avec un contrôle précis de la vitesse d''images"],"de":["Erzeugung mathematischer Visualisierungen für Bildungsinhalte","Erstellung interaktiver Animationen für Webanwendungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Animationssequenzen mit präziser Bildfrequenzsteuerung"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações matemáticas para conteúdo educacional","Criação de animações interativas para aplicações web","Depuração de sequências de animação com controle preciso de taxa de quadros"],"ru":["Создание математических визуализаций для образовательного контента","Создание интерактивных анимаций для веб-приложений","Отладка последовательностей анимации с точным контролем частоты кадров"],"ar":["إنشاء تصورات رياضية للمحتوى التعليمي","إنشاء رسوم متحركة تفاعلية لتطبيقات الويب","تصحيح تسلسلات الرسوم المتحركة مع التحكم الدقيق في معدل الإطارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Runs on Bun or Node.js, or directly in the browser","Limited to 2D canvas rendering"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","在Bun或Node.js上运行，或者直接在浏览器中","仅限2D画布渲染"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","BunまたはNode.js上で実行する、または直接ブラウザで実行する","2Dキャンバスレンダリングのみ"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요","Bun 또는 Node.js에서 실행하거나 직접 브라우저에서 실행","2D 캔버스 렌더링만"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript","Se ejecuta en Bun o Node.js, o directamente en el navegador","Limitado al renderizado de canvas 2D"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","S''exécute sur Bun ou Node.js, ou directement dans le navigateur","Limité au rendu de canvas 2D"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Läuft auf Bun oder Node.js, oder direkt im Browser","Begrenzt auf 2D-Canvas-Rendering"],"pt":["Requer um ambiente TypeScript","Executa em Bun ou Node.js, ou diretamente no navegador","Limitado à renderização 2D em canvas"],"ru":["Требует среду TypeScript","Запускается на Bun или Node.js, или непосредственно в браузере","Ограничено 2D-рендерингом на canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","يعمل على Bun أو Node.js، أو مباشرة في المتصفح","يقتصر على تقديم لوحة الرسم ثنائية الأبعاد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ee1ed0886cab0db256e77578267c2c38fb1bb9cd14425768b3808f798c0c4a98","qualityScore":39}');
