talación de commit","guía de configuración de commit"],"fr":["outils d''IA","commit pour Hyperlane","comment utiliser commit","qu''est-ce que Hyperlane","alternatives à commit","commit vs autres outils","installation de commit","guide de configuration de commit"],"de":["KI-Tools","commit für Hyperlane","wie man commit verwendet","was ist Hyperlane","Alternativen zu commit","commit vs andere Tools","Installation von commit","Konfigurationsanleitung für commit"],"pt":["template hyperlane warp route","como usar commit hyperlane","ui para rotas interchain","ferramenta ia para desenvolvimento web3","hyperlane vs layerzero","instalar template commit","guia de configuração warp route","sdk hyperlane react","transferência de tokens entre blockchains"],"ru":["шаблон hyperlane warp route","как использовать commit hyperlane","ui для межсетевых маршрутов","инструмент ии для разработки web3","hyperlane vs layerzero","установить шаблон commit","руководство по настройке warp route","sdk hyperlane react","передача токенов между блокчейнами"],"ar":["قالب hyperlane warp route","كيفية استخدام commit hyperlane","واجهة مستخدم للمسارات بين السلاسل","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتطوير web3","hyperlane مقابل layerzero","تثبيت قالب commit","دليل إعداد warp route","sdk hyperlane react","تحويل الرموز المميزة بين سلاسل الكتل"]}},"owner":"hyperlane-xyz","repo":"hyperlane-warp-ui-template","repoPath":"hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-warp-ui-template","stars":184,"forks":206,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T22:03:59Z","topics":["hyperlane","interchain","route","template","warp"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Commit changes following project quality gates and best practices. Run before creating any git commit.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Skill\n\nUse this skill when committing changes to ensure quality and correctness.\n\n## Pre-Commit Checklist\n\nRun these in order. **Do not commit if any fail.**\n\n1. **`pnpm prettier`** — Format all source files\n2. **`pnpm lint`** — Check for ESLint errors\n3. **`pnpm typecheck`** — Verify TypeScript compiles\n4. **`pnpm build`** — Ensure production build succeeds (optional for small changes, required before PR)\n\n## Staging Rules\n\n- **Only stage files related to the current task.** Review `gi","body":"# Commit Skill\n\nUse this skill when committing changes to ensure quality and correctness.\n\n## Pre-Commit Checklist\n\nRun these in order. **Do not commit if any fail.**\n\n1. **`pnpm prettier`** — Format all source files\n2. **`pnpm lint`** — Check for ESLint errors\n3. **`pnpm typecheck`** — Verify TypeScript compiles\n4. **`pnpm build`** — Ensure production build succeeds (optional for small changes, required before PR)\n\n## Staging Rules\n\n- **Only stage files related to the current task.** Review `git status` carefully.\n- **Never stage unrelated files** — markdown notes, scratch files, `.monorepo-tarballs/`, `agent/`, etc. should not be committed unless explicitly requested.\n- **Use specific file paths** with `git add`, not `git add .` or `git add -A`.\n- **Review `git diff --staged`** before committing to verify only intended changes are included.\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\n- Use conventional commit prefixes: `feat:`, `fix:`, `style:`, `chore:`, `refactor:`, `docs:`, `test:`\n- Keep the first line under 72 characters\n- Add a blank line then bullet points for multi-change commits\n- End with `Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>`\n- Use a HEREDOC to pass the message to avoid shell escaping issues\n\n## Things to Watch For\n\n- **Secrets**: Never commit `.env`, credentials, or API keys\n- **Large files**: Don''t commit binaries, build artifacts, or font files (check `.gitignore`)\n- **Formatting drift**: If prettier changed files you didn''t touch, stage them separately or skip them\n\n## Example Flow\n\n```bash\npnpm prettier\npnpm lint\npnpm typecheck\ngit status                    # review what changed\ngit diff                      # verify changes are correct\ngit add <specific-files>      # only related files\ngit diff --staged             # double-check staged changes\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\nfeat: description of change\n\n- Detail 1\n- Detail 2\n\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:19:50.396Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing rigorous pre-commit checks and quality assurance.","zh":"非常适合需要严格的预提交检查和质量保证的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが厳格な事前コミットチェックと品質保証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":" 엄격한 전 커밋 체크와 품질 보증이 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan rigurosas comprobaciones previas a la confirmación y aseguramiento de la calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant des vérifications préalables à la validation rigoureuses et une assurance qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die strenge Vor-Commit-Prüfungen und Qualitätsicherung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de verificações rigorosas pré-envio e garantia de qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, требующих строгих проверок перед фиксацией и обеспечения качества.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الكود التي تحتاج إلى عمليات فحص قوية قبل الالتزام وتأمين الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards using `pnpm prettier`, detect errors with `pnpm lint`, and verify TypeScript compilation with `pnpm typecheck`, ensuring high-quality code commits.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 `pnpm prettier` 强制执行编码标准、使用 `pnpm lint` 检测错误、使用 `pnpm typecheck` 验证 TypeScript 编译，从而确保高质量的代码提交。","ja":"エージェントが `pnpm prettier` を使用してコード規約を強制実行し、`pnpm lint` を使用してエラーを検出し、`pnpm typecheck` を使用して TypeScript のコンパイルを確認することで、高品質のコードのコミットを確実に行えるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `pnpm prettier`를 사용하여 코딩 표준을 강제로 적용하고 `pnpm lint`를 사용하여 오류를 감지하고 `pnpm typecheck`를 사용하여 TypeScript 컴파일을 확인하여 높은 품질의 코드 커밋을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación usando `pnpm prettier`, detectar errores con `pnpm lint` y verificar la compilación de TypeScript con `pnpm typecheck`, asegurando compromisos de código de alta calidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les normes de codage à l''aide de `pnpm prettier`, de détecter les erreurs avec `pnpm lint` et de vérifier la compilation de TypeScript avec `pnpm typecheck`, garantissant ainsi des validations de code de haute qualité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Codierungsstandards mithilfe von `pnpm prettier` durchzusetzen, Fehler mit `pnpm lint` zu erkennen und die TypeScript-Kompilierung mit `pnpm typecheck` zu überprüfen, um einen hochwertigen Code-Commit sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de codificação usando `pnpm prettier`, detectar erros com `pnpm lint` e verificar a compilação do TypeScript com `pnpm typecheck`, garantindo a alta qualidade dos commits de código.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования с помощью `pnpm prettier`, обнаруживать ошибки с помощью `pnpm lint` и проверять компиляцию TypeScript с помощью `pnpm typecheck`, обеспечивая высокое качество коммитов кода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض معايير الترميز باستخدام `pnpm prettier`، واكتشاف الأخطاء باستخدام `pnpm lint`، والتحقق من 编译 لغة TypeScript باستخدام `pnpm typecheck`، مما يضمن جودة عالية للالتزامات بالكود."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-commit checks for ESLint errors","Validating TypeScript compilation before pushing changes","Ensuring production build success with `pnpm build`"],"zh":["自动化 ESLint 错误的预提交检查","在推送更改前验证 TypeScript 编译","使用 `pnpm build` 确保生产构建成功"],"ja":["ESLint エラーの事前コミットチェックの自動化","変更をプッシュする前に TypeScript のコンパイルを確認する","`pnpm build` を使用して生産構築の成功を確実に行う"],"ko":["ESLint 오류의 전 커밋 체크 자동화","변경 사항을 푸시하기 전에 TypeScript 컴파일 확인","`pnpm build`를 사용하여 프로덕션 빌드 성공 보장"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones previas a la confirmación para errores de ESLint","Validar la compilación de TypeScript antes de realizar cambios","Asegurar el éxito de la compilación de producción con `pnpm build`"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications préalables à la validation pour les erreurs ESLint","Valider la compilation de TypeScript avant d''apporter des modifications","Assurer la réussite de la construction de production avec `pnpm build`"],"de":["Automatisieren von Vor-Commit-Prüfungen für ESLint-Fehler","Überprüfen der TypeScript-Kompilierung vor dem Einchecken von Änderungen","Sicherstellen des Erfolgs des Produktionsbuilds mit `pnpm build`"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações pré-envio para erros do ESLint","Validar compilação do TypeScript antes de enviar alterações","Garantir o sucesso da compilação de produção com `pnpm build`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки перед фиксацией для ошибок ESLint","Проверить компиляцию TypeScript перед отправкой изменений","Обеспечить успех сборки производства с помощью `pnpm build`"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات الفحص قبل الالتزام للأخطاء في ESLint","التحقق من 编译 لغة TypeScript قبل إرسال التغييرات","ضمان نجاح بناء الإنتاج باستخدام `pnpm build`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm installation","Limited to projects using TypeScript and ESLint"],"zh":["需要安装 pnpm","仅限使用 TypeScript 和 ESLint 的项目"],"ja":["pnpm のインストールが必要","TypeScript と ESLint を使用するプロジェクトのみに限定"],"ko":["pnpm 설치가 필요","TypeScript와 ESLint를 사용하는 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pnpm","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan TypeScript y ESLint"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pnpm","Limité aux projets utilisant TypeScript et ESLint"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von pnpm","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die TypeScript und ESLint verwenden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pnpm","Limitado a projetos que usam TypeScript e ESLint"],"ru":["Требует установки pnpm","Ограничен проектами, использующими TypeScript и ESLint"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pnpm","محدود بمشاريع التي تستخدم لغة TypeScript وESLint"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3151de25bc6b438850b2b47d4abe31719a88141694d8eca7179869e7fd053d9a","qualityScore":38}');
