Biblioteca de Router","ru":"ИИ Агенты: release-funstack - Библиотека роутера","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: release-funstack - مكتبة راوتر","en":"release-funstack"},"description":{"zh":"release-funstack是一款基于导航API的路由库，用于替代传统的History API","ja":"release-funstackはナビゲーションAPIを使用したルーター ライブラリで、従来のHistory APIを置き換えるために使用されます","ko":"release-funstack는 네비게이션 API 기반의 라우터 라이브러리로, 기존의 History API를 대체하기 위해 사용됩니다","es":"release-funstack es una biblioteca de router basada en Navigation API para React, diseñada para reemplazar la History API legacy","fr":"release-funstack est une bibliothèque de routage basée sur Navigation API pour React, conçue pour remplacer la History API legacy","de":"release-funstack ist eine Router-Bibliothek basierend auf Navigation API für React, entwickelt um die History API Legacy zu ersetzen","pt":"A release-funstack é uma biblioteca de router baseada em Navigation API, projetada para React, sem legado de History API.","ru":"Release-funstack - библиотека роутера на основе Navigation API, предназначенная для React, без наследия History API.","ar":"release-funstack هي مكتبة راوتر تعتمد على Navigation API، مصممة ل React، بدون تراث History API.","en":"Router library based on Navigation API. In explocation of a router without History API legacy"},"definition":{"en":"Router library based on Navigation API. In explocation of a router without History API legacy"},"features":{"zh":["基于导航API的路由管理","无需History API的遗留问题","支持React应用","易于安装和设置","高性能路由管理"],"ja":["ナビゲーションAPIを使用したルーティング管理","History APIのレガシーの問題なし","Reactアプリケーション対応","簡単なインストールと設定","高性能なルーティング管理"],"ko":["네비게이션 API 기반의 라우팅 관리","History API의 레거시 문제 없음","React 애플리케이션 지원","쉬운 설치 및 설정","고성능 라우팅 관리"],"es":["Basada en Navigation API","Sin History API legacy","Compatible con React","Fácil de instalar y configurar","Mejora la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Basée sur Navigation API","Sans History API legacy","Compatible avec React","Facile à installer et à configurer","Améliore l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Basierend auf Navigation API","Ohne History API Legacy","Kompatibel mit React","Einfach zu installieren und konfigurieren","Verbessert die Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Baseada em Navigation API","Sem legado de History API","Projetada para React","Fácil de usar","Melhora a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Основана на Navigation API","Без наследия History API","Предназначена для React","Легко использовать","Улучшает опыт пользователя"],"ar":["تعمل على أساس Navigation API","بدون تراث History API","مصممة ل React","سهلة الاستخدام","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用release-funstack","什么是导航API","release-funstack安装","React路由管理","release-funstack替代方案","release-funstack vs react-router","release-funstack设置指南","release-funstack性能优化"],"ja":["release-funstackの使用方法","ナビゲーションAPIとは","release-funstackのインストール","Reactルーティング管理","release-funstackの代替","release-funstack vs react-router","release-funstack設定ガイド","release-funstackパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["release-funstack 사용 방법","네비게이션 API란","release-funstack 설치","React 라우팅 관리","release-funstack 대체","release-funstack vs react-router","release-funstack 설정 가이드","release-funstack 성능 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar release-funstack","qué es Navigation API","release-funstack vs React Router","instalar release-funstack","guía de configuración de release-funstack","alternativas a React Router"],"fr":["comment utiliser release-funstack","qu''est-ce que Navigation API","release-funstack vs React Router","installer release-funstack","guide de configuration de release-funstack","alternatives à React Router"],"de":["wie man release-funstack verwendet","was ist Navigation API","release-funstack vs React Router","release-funstack installieren","Konfigurationsanleitung für release-funstack","Alternativen zu React Router"],"pt":["como usar release-funstack","o que é release-funstack","release-funstack alternativa","release-funstack vs react-router","instalar release-funstack","guia de configuração release-funstack","react router","navigation api"],"ru":["как использовать release-funstack","что такое release-funstack","release-funstack альтернатива","release-funstack vs react-router","установить release-funstack","руководство по настройке release-funstack","react роутер","navigation api"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام release-funstack","ما هي release-funstack","release-funstack بديل","release-funstack مقابل react-router","تثبيت release-funstack","دليل إعداد release-funstack","react راوتر","navigation api"]}},"owner":"uhyo","repo":"funstack-router","repoPath":"uhyo/funstack-router","stars":43,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T14:03:12Z","topics":["react","router"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-funstack","description":"A skill to make a GitHub release for the `@funstack/router` package. Use this skill when the user wants to release a new version of the package.","bodyPreview":"# Release FUNSTACK Skill\n\nTo release a new version of the `@funstack/router` package, follow these steps:\n\n1. Read the `packages/router/package.json` file to determine the current version of the package.\n\n- User may or may not have already updated the version in `package.json`. Ask the user to confirm if they have updated the version. If not, you should update the version based on semantic versioning rules (patch, minor, major) as per user''s instruction.\n\n2. Update the version in `packages/route","body":"# Release FUNSTACK Skill\n\nTo release a new version of the `@funstack/router` package, follow these steps:\n\n1. Read the `packages/router/package.json` file to determine the current version of the package.\n\n- User may or may not have already updated the version in `package.json`. Ask the user to confirm if they have updated the version. If not, you should update the version based on semantic versioning rules (patch, minor, major) as per user''s instruction.\n\n2. Update the version in `packages/router/package.json`, commit and push if necessary.\n\n- The commit message should be `chore: bump version to x.y.z` where `x.y.z` is the new version.\n\n3. Inspect the git log since the last release tag to generate release notes.\n\n- The release notes should summarize the changes made since the last release.\n- Especially, highlight any breaking changes, new features, or important fixes.\n\n4. Use the `gh` CLI to create a new release on GitHub with the new version and the generated release notes.\n\n- The tag name should be `x.y.z` where `x.y.z` is the new version.\n\n5. Inform the user that the release has been created successfully, providing the URL to the release page on GitHub.\n\n## Writing Release Notes\n\nWhen writing release notes, consider the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n## What''s Changed\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- Change the `onNavigate` signature to accept an `OnNavigateInfo` object instead of the matched array. (#52)\n\n### Features\n\n- Add new hooks `useRouteParams`, `useRouteState` and `useRouteData` for type-safe state management (#50)\n\n### Improvements\n\n- Improve route matching performance by optimizing the matching algorithm (#20)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/uhyo/funstack-router/compare/0.0.1...0.0.2\n```\n\nNotes:\n\n- Highlight breaking changes if any.\n- Group changes into categories like \"Features\", \"Improvements\", \"Fixes\", etc.\n- Documentation updates and dependency updates should be omitted unless they are significant (e.g. breaking changes).\n- Provide a link to the full changelog comparing the previous version and the new version.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T07:38:48.182Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced JavaScript Agents managing Navigation API and router libraries like @funstack/router","zh":"非常适合高级JavaScript代理管理导航API和路由库，如@funstack/router","ja":"ナビゲーションAPIとルーター ライブラリ（@funstack/routerなど）を管理するための高度なJavaScriptエージェントに最適","ko":"네비게이션 API 및 라우터 라이브러리 (@funstack/router 등)를 관리하는 고급 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de JavaScript Avanzados que gestionan Navigation API y bibliotecas de enrutadores como @funstack/router","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript avancés gérant Navigation API et les bibliothèques de routage comme @funstack/router","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte JavaScript-Agents, die Navigation API und Router-Bibliotheken wie @funstack/router verwalten","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes JavaScript Avançados que gerenciam Navigation API e bibliotecas de roteamento como @funstack/router","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов JavaScript, которые управляют Navigation API и библиотеками маршрутизации, такими как @funstack/router","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء JavaScript المتقدمين الذين يديرون Navigation API ومكتبات التوجيه مثل @funstack/router"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update and manage package versions using semantic versioning rules, ensuring compatibility with the Navigation API and efficient router library management through the @funstack/router package, leveraging package.json files and semantic versioning protocols","zh":"赋予代理更新和管理包版本的能力，使用语义版本控制规则，确保与导航API的兼容性，并通过@funstack/router包高效地管理路由库，利用package.json文件和语义版本控制协议","ja":"セマンティック バージョニング ルールを使用してパッケージのバージョンを更新および管理するエージェントを可能にし、ナビゲーション API と @funstack/router パッケージを介したルーター ライブラリの効率的な管理を確保し、package.json ファイルおよびセマンティック バージョニング プロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 패키지 버전을 업데이트하고 관리할 수 있도록 하여, 의미 체계 버전 규칙을 사용하고 네비게이션 API와의 호환성을 보장하고, @funstack/router 패키지를 통해 라우터 라이브러리를 효율적으로 관리하며, package.json 파일 및 의미 체계 버전 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a actualizar y gestionar versiones de paquetes utilizando reglas de versionado semántico, asegurando la compatibilidad con Navigation API y una gestión eficiente de bibliotecas de enrutadores a través del paquete @funstack/router, aprovechando archivos package.json y protocolos de versionado semántico","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour et de gérer les versions de packages en utilisant des règles de versionnage sémantique, garantissant la compatibilité avec Navigation API et une gestion efficace des bibliothèques de routage via le package @funstack/router, en exploitant les fichiers package.json et les protocoles de versionnage sémantique","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Paketversionen mithilfe semantischer Versionsregeln zu aktualisieren und zu verwalten, die Kompatibilität mit Navigation API sicherzustellen und eine effiziente Verwaltung von Router-Bibliotheken über das @funstack/router-Paket zu ermöglichen, indem package.json-Dateien und semantische Versionsprotokolle genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar e gerenciar versões de pacotes usando regras de versionamento semântico, garantindo compatibilidade com a Navigation API e gestão eficiente de bibliotecas de roteamento por meio do pacote @funstack/router, aproveitando arquivos package.json e protocolos de versionamento semântico","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обновлять и управлять версиями пакетов, используя правила семантического версионирования, обеспечивая совместимость с Navigation API и эффективное управление библиотеками маршрутизации через пакет @funstack/router, используя файлы package.json и протоколы семантического версионирования","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديث وإدارة إصدارات الحزم باستخدام قواعد الإصدار الدلالي، مما يضمن التوافق مع Navigation API وإدارة المكتبات الفعالة من خلال حزمة @funstack/router، باستخدام ملفات package.json وبروتوكولات الإصدار الدلالي"},"useCases":{"en":["Updating package versions based on semantic versioning rules","Managing router library versions without History API legacy","Validating and confirming version updates in package.json files"],"zh":["基于语义版本控制规则更新包版本","在不使用History API的遗留版本的情况下管理路由库版本","在package.json文件中验证和确认版本更新"],"ja":["セマンティック バージョニング ルールに基づいてパッケージのバージョンを更新する","History APIのレガシーバージョンを使用せずにルーター ライブラリのバージョンを管理する","package.jsonファイルでバージョン更新を検証および確認する"],"ko":["의미 체계 버전 규칙에 따라 패키지 버전을 업데이트하는 것","히스토리 API의 레거시 버전을 사용하지 않고 라우터 라이브러리 버전을 관리","package.json 파일에서 버전 업데이트를 검증 및 확인"],"es":["Actualización de versiones de paquetes basada en reglas de versionado semántico","Gestión de versiones de bibliotecas de enrutadores sin legado de History API","Validación y confirmación de actualizaciones de versiones en archivos package.json"],"fr":["Mise à jour des versions de packages basée sur des règles de versionnage sémantique","Gestion des versions de bibliothèques de routage sans héritage de History API","Validation et confirmation des mises à jour de versions dans les fichiers package.json"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Paketversionen basierend auf semantischen Versionsregeln","Verwaltung von Router-Bibliotheksversionen ohne History-API-Erbe","Validierung und Bestätigung von Versionsaktualisierungen in package.json-Dateien"],"pt":["Atualizar versões de pacotes com base em regras de versionamento semântico","Gerenciar versões de bibliotecas de roteamento sem legado da History API","Validar e confirmar atualizações de versão em arquivos package.json"],"ru":["Обновление версий пакетов на основе правил семантического версионирования","Управление версиями библиотек маршрутизации без наследия History API","Проверка и подтверждение обновлений версий в файлах package.json"],"ar":["تحديث إصدارات الحزم بناءً على قواعد الإصدار الدلالي","إدارة إصدارات مكتبات التوجيه دون تراث History API","التحقق من صحة وتأكيد تحديثات الإصدار في ملفات package.json"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to package.json files","Limited to @funstack/router package management"],"zh":["需要访问package.json文件","仅限@funstack/router包管理"],"ja":["package.jsonファイルへのアクセスが必要","@funstack/routerパッケージの管理のみ"],"ko":["package.json 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","@funstack/router 패키지 관리만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos package.json","Limitado a la gestión del paquete @funstack/router"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers package.json","Limité à la gestion du package @funstack/router"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf package.json-Dateien","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung des @funstack/router-Pakets"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos package.json","Limitado à gestão do pacote @funstack/router"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам package.json","Ограничен управлением пакетом @funstack/router"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات package.json","محدود بإدارة حزمة @funstack/router"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7f90a61240242a2e4483a216eb19a875411c76d8682863479c4ff092740dc405","qualityScore":38}');
