,"was ist ein KI-Agent","dipeo-backend vs andere Frameworks","Installation von dipeo-backend","Konfigurationsanleitung für dipeo-backend","Entwicklung von künstlicher Intelligenz mit dipeo-backend"],"pt":["como usar dipeo-backend","o que é agente de IA","dipeo-backend alternativa","dipeo-backend vs outros","instalar dipeo-backend","guia de configuração do dipeo-backend"],"ru":["как использовать dipeo-backend","что такое ИИ агент","дipeo-backend альтернатива","дipeo-backend vs другие","установить dipeo-backend","руководство по настройке dipeo-backend"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام dipeo-backend","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل dipeo-backend","dipeo-backend مقابل الاخرين","تثبيت dipeo-backend","دليل إعداد dipeo-backend"]}},"owner":"sorryhyun","repo":"DiPeO","repoPath":"sorryhyun/DiPeO","stars":12,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-06T07:13:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dipeo-backend","description":"Router skill for DiPeO backend ecosystem (server/ and cli/): FastAPI server, CLI tools, database, MCP integration. Use when task mentions CLI commands, server endpoints, database queries, or MCP tools. For simple tasks, handle directly; for complex work, escalate to dipeo-backend agent.","bodyPreview":"# DiPeO Backend Router\n\n**Domain**: Backend ecosystem including FastAPI server (`server/`), CLI tools (`cli/`), message store, and MCP integration. Database schema initialization is in `/dipeo/infrastructure/execution/state/persistence_manager.py` (package-maintainer domain).\n\n## Quick Decision: Skill or Agent?\n\n### ✅ Handle Directly (This Skill)\n- **Simple changes**: <20 lines, 1-2 files\n- **Read-only tasks**: Understanding code, reviewing configs, debugging logs\n- **Documentation lookup**: CLI","body":"# DiPeO Backend Router\n\n**Domain**: Backend ecosystem including FastAPI server (`server/`), CLI tools (`cli/`), message store, and MCP integration. Database schema initialization is in `/dipeo/infrastructure/execution/state/persistence_manager.py` (package-maintainer domain).\n\n## Quick Decision: Skill or Agent?\n\n### ✅ Handle Directly (This Skill)\n- **Simple changes**: <20 lines, 1-2 files\n- **Read-only tasks**: Understanding code, reviewing configs, debugging logs\n- **Documentation lookup**: CLI help, API signatures, database schema\n- **Small config tweaks**: Environment variables, command flags\n\n### ❌ Escalate to Agent\n- **Complex features**: Multi-file changes, new CLI commands, database migrations\n- **Architecture changes**: New API endpoints, MCP tool implementation\n- **Cross-cutting concerns**: Affects CLI + database + execution engine\n- **Uncertain scope**: Not sure how many files will change\n\n**Agent**: `Task(dipeo-backend, \"your detailed task description\")`\n\n## Documentation Sections (Load On-Demand)\n\nUse `Skill(doc-lookup)` with these anchors when you need detailed context:\n\n**Core Responsibilities**:\n- `docs/agents/backend-development.md#core-responsibilities` - CLI, FastAPI server, database, MCP server\n\n**Implementation Patterns**:\n- `docs/agents/backend-development.md#common-patterns` - CLI, background execution, database, MCP patterns\n\n**Troubleshooting**:\n- `docs/agents/backend-development.md#troubleshooting` - Server, CLI, database, MCP issues\n\n**MCP Integration**:\n- `docs/features/mcp-server-integration.md#quick-start` - Setup and usage guide\n- `docs/features/chatgpt-mcp-integration.md#quick-start` - ChatGPT connection\n\n**Example doc-lookup call**:\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/doc-lookup/scripts/section_search.py \\\n  --query \"cli-commands\" \\\n  --paths docs/agents/backend-development.md \\\n  --top 1\n```\n\n## Escalation to Other Agents\n\n**To dipeo-package-maintainer**: Execution handlers, service architecture, domain models, LLM infrastructure\n**To dipeo-codegen-pipeline**: GraphQL schema changes, generated type issues, TypeScript specs\n\n## Typical Workflow\n\n1. **Assess task complexity**: Simple (handle) vs. complex (escalate)\n2. **If simple**: Load relevant section via `Skill(doc-lookup)`\n3. **Execute**: Make changes or provide answer\n4. **If complex**: Escalate with `Task(dipeo-backend, \"task details\")`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:34:19.486Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Backend Agents requiring comprehensive FastAPI server management and MCP integration.","zh":"适用于需要全面FastAPI服务器管理和MCP集成的高级后端代理。","ja":"Advanced Backend Agentsに適した、包括的なFastAPIサーバー管理とMCP統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전체적인 FastAPI 서버 관리 및 MCP 통합이 필요한 고급 백엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de backend avanzados que requieren una gestión integral del servidor FastAPI y la integración con MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de backend avancés nécessitant une gestion complète du serveur FastAPI et l''intégration avec MCP.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Backend-Agents, die eine umfassende FastAPI-Serververwaltung und MCP-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Avançados de Backend que requerem gestão abrangente do servidor FastAPI e integração com o MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов бэкенда, требующих комплексного управления сервером FastAPI и интеграции с MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الخلفية المتقدم الذي يتطلب إدارة شاملة لخادم FastAPI وتكامل مع MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex backend ecosystems, including database schema initialization via persistence_manager.py, leveraging FastAPI and CLI tools for seamless execution and debugging, all while integrating with MCP for robust functionality.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂的后端生态系统的能力，包括通过persistence_manager.py初始化数据库模式，利用FastAPI和CLI工具实现无缝执行和调试，同时与MCP集成以实现强大的功能。","ja":"エージェントが複雑なバックエンドエコシステムを管理できるようにし、persistence_manager.pyを介したデータベーススキーマの初期化、FastAPIとCLIツールを使用したシームレスな実行とデバッグ、およびMCPとの統合による強力な機能を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 백엔드 생태계를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, persistence_manager.py를 통해 데이터베이스 스키마를 초기화하고, FastAPI 및 CLI 도구를 사용하여 무중단 실행 및 디버깅을 수행하며, MCP와의 통합을 통해 강력한 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar ecosistemas de backend complejos, incluyendo la inicialización del esquema de base de datos a través de persistence_manager.py, aprovechando FastAPI y herramientas de CLI para una ejecución y depuración sin problemas, todo mientras se integra con MCP para una funcionalidad robusta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des écosystèmes de backend complexes, y compris l''initialisation du schéma de base de données via persistence_manager.py, en exploitant FastAPI et les outils de CLI pour une exécution et un débogage sans problèmes, le tout en s''intégrant avec MCP pour une fonctionnalité robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Backend-Ökosysteme zu verwalten, einschließlich der Initialisierung der Datenbankschemata über persistence_manager.py, unter Nutzung von FastAPI und CLI-Tools für eine nahtlose Ausführung und Fehlersuche, während sie mit MCP für robuste Funktionalität integriert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem ecossistemas de backend complexos, incluindo inicialização do esquema de banco de dados via persistence_manager.py, aproveitando o FastAPI e as ferramentas CLI para execução e depuração sem problemas, além de integrar com o MCP para funcionalidade robusta.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять сложными экосистемами бэкенда, включая инициализацию схемы базы данных через persistence_manager.py, используя FastAPI и инструменты CLI для бесперебойной выполнения и отладки, а также интегрируя с MCP для надежной функциональности.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إدارة بيئات الخلفية المعقدة، بما في ذلك تهيئة مخطط قاعدة البيانات عبر persistence_manager.py، واستخدام FastAPI وأدوات CLI للتنفيذ والتصحيح دون مشاكل، بالإضافة إلى التكامل مع MCP للوظيفة القوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging logs and understanding codebase via block diagram UI","Initializing and managing database schema for optimized performance","Executing read-only tasks and reviewing configurations for enhanced security"],"zh":["通过块图UI调试日志和理解代码库","初始化和管理数据库模式以优化性能","执行只读任务并审查配置以增强安全性"],"ja":["ブロック図UIを使用したログのデバッグとコードベースの理解","データ