mi...","en":"oracle"},"description":{"zh":"Oracle Matrix Rain是一个为Windows Terminal提供动态矩阵雨效果的AI智能工具，增强终端使用体验","ja":"Oracleは、Windows Terminalにマトリックスレインエフェクトを提供するAIエージェントです","ko":"오라클은 윈도우 터미널에 매트릭스 레인 효과를 제공하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Oracle es una herramienta de AI que agrega Matrix Rain a Windows Terminal, mejorando la experiencia del desarrollador","fr":"Oracle est un outil d''IA qui ajoute Matrix Rain à Windows Terminal, améliorant l''expérience du développeur","de":"Oracle ist ein KI-Tool, das Matrix Regen für Windows Terminal hinzufügt, die Erfahrung des Entwicklers verbessert","pt":"O Oracle é uma ferramenta de IA que traz efeitos visuais de Matrix Rain para o Windows Terminal, melhorando a experiência de desenvolvimento","ru":"Oracle - это инструмент ИИ, который приносит визуальные эффекты Matrix Rain в Windows Terminal, улучшая опыт разработки","ar":"Oracle هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي يأتي مع تأثيرات بصرية من Matrix Rain لنظام Terminal في Windows، مما يحسن تجربة التطوير","en":"Matrix rain for Windows Terminal"},"definition":{"en":"Matrix rain for Windows Terminal"},"features":{"zh":["为Windows Terminal提供动态矩阵雨效果","使用AI算法生成实时视觉效果","可自定义视觉效果参数","支持多种终端环境","易于安装和配置"],"ja":["Windows Terminalにマトリックスレインエフェクトを提供","AIアルゴリズムを使用してリアルタイムの視覚効果を生成","視覚効果のパラメータをカスタマイズ可能","複数のターミナル環境をサポート","簡単にインストールおよび設定可能"],"ko":["윈도우 터미널에 매트릭스 레인 효과 제공","AI 알고리즘을 사용하여 실시간 시각 효과 생성","시각 효과 매개변수를 사용자 지정할 수 있음","여러 종류의 터미널 환경을 지원","설치 및 설정이 간단함"],"es":["Interfaz de usuario personalizable","Efectos visuales de Matrix Rain","Compatibilidad con Windows Terminal","Fácil instalación y configuración","Mejora la experiencia del desarrollador"],"fr":["Interface utilisateur personnalisable","Effets visuels de Matrix Rain","Compatibilité avec Windows Terminal","Installation et configuration faciles","Améliore l''expérience du développeur"],"de":["Benutzeroberfläche anpassbar","Visuelle Effekte von Matrix Regen","Kompatibilität mit Windows Terminal","Einfache Installation und Konfiguration","Verbessert die Erfahrung des Entwicklers"],"pt":["Efeitos visuais de Matrix Rain","Integração com Windows Terminal","Melhoria da experiência de desenvolvimento","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","Personalização de efeitos visuais"],"ru":["Визуальные эффекты Matrix Rain","Интеграция с Windows Terminal","Улучшение опыта разработки","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Настройка визуальных эффектов"],"ar":["التأثيرات البصرية من Matrix Rain","التكامل مع نظام Terminal في Windows","تحسين تجربة التطوير","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","تخصيص التأثيرات البصرية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Oracle Matrix Rain","Windows Terminal","矩阵雨效果","AI算法","视觉效果","终端环境","如何使用Oracle Matrix Rain","Oracle Matrix Rain安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Oracle","Windows Terminal","マトリックスレインエフェクト","AIアルゴリズム","視覚効果","ターミナル環境","Oracleの使い方","Oracleのインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","오라클","윈도우 터미널","매트릭스 레인 효과","AI 알고리즘","시각 효과","터미널 환경","오라클 사용법","오라클 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","Oracle AI","Matrix Rain Windows Terminal","cómo instalar Oracle","guía de configuración de Oracle","alternativas a Oracle","Oracle vs otras herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","Oracle IA","Matrix Rain Windows Terminal","comment installer Oracle","guide de configuration d''Oracle","alternatives à Oracle","Oracle vs autres outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","Oracle KI","Matrix Regen Windows Terminal","wie installiere ich Oracle","Konfigurationsanleitung für Oracle","Alternativen zu Oracle","Oracle im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar oracle","o que é oracle","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","oracle vs outras ferramentas","instalar oracle","guia de configuração do oracle","desenvolvimento com oracle","exemplos de uso do oracle"],"ru":["как использовать oracle","что такое oracle","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","oracle vs другие инструменты","установить oracle","руководство по настройке oracle","разработка с помощью oracle","примеры использования oracle"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أوراكل","ما هو أوراكل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أوراكل مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أوراكل","دليل إعداد أوراكل","التطوير مع أوراكل","أمثلة على استخدام أوراكل"]}},"owner":"matrixshader","repo":"matrix-shader","repoPath":"matrixshader/matrix-shader","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T00:11:52Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oracle","description":"Process pending FAQ questions — drafts answers from codebase knowledge, flags unknowns for human review, and publishes approved answers. Use when the user says /oracle or asks to process the FAQ inbox.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nProcess all pending FAQ questions submitted via the MatrixShader support page. Reads the codebase to draft accurate answers for questions Claude can handle, flags business/roadmap questions for the human, and identifies spam for cleanup. Every action requires user approval before executing.\n</objective>\n\n<quick_start>\n1. Fetch pending questions: `GET /api/faq?status=pending` with Bearer auth\n2. Read codebase files to build answer context\n3. Classify each question into CAN ANSWER, NEE","body":"<objective>\nProcess all pending FAQ questions submitted via the MatrixShader support page. Reads the codebase to draft accurate answers for questions Claude can handle, flags business/roadmap questions for the human, and identifies spam for cleanup. Every action requires user approval before executing.\n</objective>\n\n<quick_start>\n1. Fetch pending questions: `GET /api/faq?status=pending` with Bearer auth\n2. Read codebase files to build answer context\n3. Classify each question into CAN ANSWER, NEEDS HUMAN, or JUNK\n4. Present all results grouped by bucket with draft answers\n5. User approves/edits/skips each — then execute API calls\n</quick_start>\n\n<essential_principles>\n- **Never fabricate answers.** Only answer from codebase knowledge, README, and docs. If unsure, classify as NEEDS HUMAN.\n- **Never publish without approval.** Always show the draft and wait for the user to confirm.\n- **Keep answers concise.** 1-3 sentences. Helpful and direct, matching the Matrix operator voice (but not over-the-top).\n- **Batch efficiently.** Show all CAN ANSWER questions together so the user can approve in bulk or review individually.\n</essential_principles>\n\n<context>\n**API base:** `https://matrixshader.com/api/faq`\n\n**Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer $DASHBOARD_PASSWORD` header (env var). If not set, ask the user for it.\n\n**Endpoints:**\n- `GET /api/faq?status=pending` — fetch pending questions (auth required)\n- `PATCH /api/faq` — update a question (auth required). Body: `{ \"id\", \"action\", ... }`\n  - `action: \"publish\"` — requires `answer` field, optional `category`\n  - `action: \"dismiss\"` — marks as dismissed\n  - `action: \"reopen\"` — returns to pending\n  - `action: \"update\"` — partial update (answer, category, tags)\n- `DELETE /api/faq?id=xxx` — permanently delete (auth required)\n\n**Valid categories:** `general`, `installation`, `usage`, `licensing`, `compatibility`, `troubleshooting`\n</context>\n\n<process>\n**Step 1: Authenticate and fetch**\n\nRun `scripts/fetch-pending.sh` to get all pending questions. If DASHBOARD_PASSWORD is not in environment, ask the user for it.\n\nIf zero pending questions, say \"The Oracle sees no unanswered questions.\" and stop.\n\n**Step 2: Display summary**\n\nShow a numbered overview:\n```\nThe Oracle: {N} pending questions\n\n#1 [{category}] \"{question}\" — {email} ({date})\n#2 [{category}] \"{question}\" — {email} ({date})\n...\n```\n\n**Step 3: Build answer context**\n\nRead these codebase files to prepare for drafting answers:\n- `CLAUDE.md` — architecture overview, key mechanisms\n- `README.md` — user-facing feature list, install instructions\n- `Website/index.html` — product page feature descriptions\n- `Website/redpill/index.html` — Red Pill purchase page details\n- `matrix_control.ps1` — control panel features and hotkeys\n- `matrix_setup.ps1` — setup wizard flow\n- `Website/privacy/index.html` and `Website/terms/index.html` — policy questions\n\nSearch additional files as needed for specific questions (shader files, C# source, etc.).\n\n**Step 4: Classify each question**\n\nFor each pending question:\n1. Check if the category is correct — note any corrections needed\n2. Determine which bucket it belongs in:\n\n| Bucket | Criteria | Examples |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| **CAN ANSWER** | Answerable from codebase/docs | \"How do I change colors?\", \"Does it work on Windows 10?\" |\n| **NEEDS HUMAN** | Requires business judgment, account info, or roadmap commitment | \"Can I get a discount?\", \"When will you support macOS?\", \"I want a refund\" |\n| **JUNK** | Gibberish, test data, spam, not a real question | \"asdfasdf\", \"test123\" |\n\n**Step 5: Present results**\n\nGroup by bucket and show:\n\nFor **CAN ANSWER** — show question, category correction (if any), and draft answer\nFor **NEEDS HUMAN** — show question and explain why only the human can answer it\nFor **JUNK** — show question and recommend dismiss or delete\n\nAsk the user how to proceed. Accept bulk commands (\"publish all\", \"looks good\") or individual review.\n\n**Step 6: Execute approved actions**\n\nFor each approved action, run the appropriate API call using `scripts/faq-action.sh`:\n\n- **Publish**: `scripts/faq-action.sh publish <id> \"<answer>\" [category]`\n- **Dismiss**: `scripts/faq-action.sh dismiss <id>`\n- **Delete**: `scripts/faq-action.sh delete <id>`\n- **Update category**: `scripts/faq-action.sh update <id> [category]`\n\n**Step 7: Summary**\n\nShow final tally:\n```\nOracle Complete:\n  Published: {N}\n  Dismissed: {N}\n  Deleted:   {N}\n  Skipped:   {N} (still pending)\n```\n</process>\n\n<anti_patterns>\n- **Guessing answers** — If you''re not confident from codebase sources, mark NEEDS HUMAN. Wrong answers on a public FAQ are worse than no answer.\n- **Publishing without approval** — Every publish must be explicitly confirmed by the user.\n- **Over-theming answers** — Answers should be helpful and clear. Don''t force Matrix references into every response.\n- **Skipping category correction** — If a question is miscategorized, fix it as part of the publish/update call.\n</anti_patterns>\n\n<success_criteria>\nTriage is complete when:\n- All pending questions have been classified into buckets\n- User has reviewed and decided on each question (publish, dismiss, delete, or skip)\n- All approved API calls have been executed successfully\n- Final summary shows the tally of actions taken\n</success_criteria>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T04:08:32.800Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude needing advanced FAQ analysis and codebase reading capabilities for accurate user support.","zh":"非常适合需要高级FAQ分析和代码库阅读能力的AI代理，如Claude，以提供准确的用户支持。","ja":"Claudeのような高度なFAQ分析およびコードベースの読み取り機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude와 같은 고급 FAQ 분석 및 코드베이스 읽기 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA como Claude que necesitan un análisis de preguntas frecuentes avanzado y capacidades de lectura de código para un soporte de usuario preciso.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude nécessitant une analyse de questions fréquentes avancée et des capacités de lecture de code pour un support utilisateur précis.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, die eine erweiterte FAQ-Analyse und Codelesefunktionen für einen genauen Benutzersupport benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Claude que necessitam de análise avançada de FAQ e capacidades de leitura de código para suporte de usuário preciso.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, которые требуют расширенного анализа FAQ и возможностей чтения кода для точной поддержки пользователей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لأسئلة وأجوبة شائعة وقدرات قراءة قاعدة الشفرة لدعم المستخدمين بدقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to classify questions into CAN ANSWER, NEEDS HUMAN, or spam using Bearer auth and API calls like GET /api/faq?status=pending, providing efficient support page management and codebase context understanding.","zh":"赋予代理分类问题的能力，使用Bearer身份验证和API调用，如GET /api/faq?status=pending，提供高效的支持页面管理和代码库背景理解。","ja":"Bearer認証とAPI呼び出し（例：GET /api/faq?status=pending）を使用して、エージェントが質問をCAN ANSWER、NEEDS HUMAN、またはスパムに分類できるようにし、効率的なサポートページ管理とコードベースの背景理解を提供します。","ko":"Bearer 인증 및 API 호출(예: GET /api/faq?status=pending)을 사용하여 에이전트가 질문을 CAN ANSWER, NEEDS HUMAN 또는 스팸으로 분류할 수 있도록 하여 효율적인 지원 페이지 관리 및 코드베이스 컨텍스트 이해를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a clasificar preguntas en PUEDE RESPONDER, NECESITA HUMANO o spam utilizando Bearer auth y llamadas a la API como GET /api/faq?status=pending, lo que proporciona una gestión eficiente de la página de soporte y una comprensión del contexto del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de classer les questions en PEUT RÉPONDRE, NÉCESSITE HUMAIN ou spam en utilisant Bearer auth et des appels d''API tels que GET /api/faq?status=pending, ce qui fournit une gestion de page de support efficace et une compréhension du contexte du code.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Fragen in KANN ANTWORTEN, BENÖTIGT MENSCHEN oder Spam einzustufen, indem sie Bearer-Auth und API-Aufrufe wie GET /api/faq?status=pending verwenden, was eine effiziente Verwaltung der Supportseite und ein Verständnis des Codekontexts ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a classificar perguntas em PODE RESPONDER, PRECISA DE HUMANO ou spam usando autenticação Bearer e chamadas de API como GET /api/faq?status=pending, fornecendo gerenciamento eficiente de página de suporte e compreensão do contexto da base de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью классифицировать вопросы на МОЖЕТ ОТВЕТИТЬ, ТРЕБУЕТ ЧЕЛОВЕКА или спам, используя аутентификацию Bearer и вызовы API, такие как GET /api/faq?status=pending, обеспечивая эффективное управление страницей поддержки и понимание контекста кодовой базы.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تصنيف الأسئلة إلى يمكن الإجابة، يحتاج إلى إنسان أو رسائل البريد العشوائي باستخدام مصادقة الحامل والمكالمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مثل GET /api/faq؟حالة = معلق، وتوفير إدارة فعالة لصفحة الدعم وفهم سياق قاعدة الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating FAQ question processing","Generating accurate answers based on codebase context","Flagging business and roadmap questions for human review"],"zh":["自动化FAQ问题处理","根据代码库背景生成准确答案","标记需要人工审查的业务和路线图问题"],"ja":["FAQ質問の自動化処理","コードベースの背景に基づく正確な回答の生成","人間によるレビューが必要なビジネスおよびロードマップに関する質問のフラグ付け"],"ko":["FAQ 질문 자동 처리","코드베이스 컨텍스트에 기반한 정확한 답변 생성","인간의 검토가 필요한 비즈니스 및 로드맵 관련 질문 플래그"],"es":["Automatización del procesamiento de preguntas de preguntas frecuentes","Generación de respuestas precisas en función del contexto del código","Marcado de preguntas de negocio y hoja de ruta para revisión humana"],"fr":["Automatisation du traitement des questions de questions fréquentes","Génération de réponses précises en fonction du contexte du code","Marquage des questions d''entreprise et de feuille de route pour examen humain"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verarbeitung von FAQ-Fragen","Erzeugung genauer Antworten basierend auf dem Codekontext","Markierung von Geschäfts- und Roadmap-Fragen für menschliche Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar o processamento de perguntas de FAQ","Gerar respostas precisas com base no contexto da base de código","Marcar perguntas de negócios e roadmap para revisão humana"],"ru":["Автоматизация обработки вопросов FAQ","Генерация точных ответов на основе контекста кодовой базы","Помечение бизнес- и дорожных карт вопросов для рассмотрения человеком"],"ar":["آليّة معالجة أسئلة وأجوبة شائعة","توليد إجابات دقيقة بناءً على سياق قاعدة الشفرة","تعليم أسئلة العمل والخارطة الطريق لمراجعة الإنسان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Bearer auth for API calls","Needs user approval before executing actions","Limited to FAQ questions submitted via the MatrixShader support page"],"zh":["需要Bearer身份验证来进行API调用","需要用户批准才能执行操作","仅限通过MatrixShader支持页面提交的FAQ问题"],"ja":["API呼び出しを行うためにBearer認証が必要","操作を実行する前にユーザーの承認が必要","MatrixShaderサポートページ経由で提出されたFAQ質問のみ"],"ko":["API 호출을 위해 Bearer 인증이 필요","작업을 실행하기 전에 사용자 승인이 필요","MatrixShader 지원 페이지를 통해 제출된 FAQ 질문만"],"es":["Requiere Bearer auth para llamadas a la API","Necesita aprobación del usuario antes de ejecutar acciones","Limitado a preguntas de preguntas frecuentes enviadas a través de la página de soporte de MatrixShader"],"fr":["Nécessite Bearer auth pour les appels d''API","Nécessite l''approbation de l''utilisateur avant d''exécuter des actions","Limité aux questions de questions fréquentes soumises via la page de support de MatrixShader"],"de":["Benötigt Bearer-Auth für API-Aufrufe","Benötigt Benutzerzustimmung vor der Ausführung von Aktionen","Begrenzt auf FAQ-Fragen, die über die Supportseite von MatrixShader eingereicht werden"],"pt":["Exige autenticação Bearer para chamadas de API","Necessita de aprovação do usuário antes de executar ações","Limitado a perguntas de FAQ submetidas via página de suporte do MatrixShader"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации Bearer для вызовов API","Требует одобрения пользователя перед выполнением действий","Ограничен вопросами FAQ, поданными через страницу поддержки MatrixShader"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة الحامل لمكالمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","يحتاج إلى موافقة المستخدم قبل تنفيذ الإجراءات","محدود بالأسئلة والأجوبة الشائعة المقدمة من خلال صفحة دعم MatrixShader"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a07ad33414c68316d7e0d24af3d3318ea17bec1dbf1ea1903f18f08b2b531018","qualityScore":37}');
