chtzeit-State-Management für React und TypeScript","pt":"Koota: Gerenciamento de Estado em Tempo Real para React","ru":"Koota: Высокопроизводительное управление состоянием в реа...","ar":"Koota: إدارة الحالة في الوقت الفعلي للري액ت","en":"koota"},"description":{"zh":"Koota 是一个高性能的实时状态管理库，用于 React 和 TypeScript 应用程序。它使用实体、特征和关系来管理状态","ja":"Koota は、リアルタイム状態管理を提供する高性能ライブラリで、React と TypeScript アプリケーション向けに設計されています。エンティティ、トレイト、リレーションを使用して状態を管理します","ko":"Koota는 리액트 및 타입스크립트 애플리케이션을 위한 고성능 실시간 상태 관리 라이브러리입니다. 엔티티, 특성 및 관계를 사용하여 상태를 관리합니다","es":"Koota es una solución de gestión de estado en tiempo real para React y TypeScript que utiliza entidades con rasgos componibles","fr":"Koota est une solution de gestion d''état en temps réel pour React et TypeScript qui utilise des entités avec des traits composites","de":"Koota ist eine Echtzeit-State-Management-Lösung für React und TypeScript, die Entitäten mit komponierbaren Eigenschaften verwendet","pt":"Koota é uma solução de gerenciamento de estado em tempo real para React e TypeScript, que utiliza entidades com traits compostáveis para gerenciar o estado d...","ru":"Koota - это решение для управления состоянием в реальном времени для React и TypeScript, которое использует сущности с составными чертами для управления сост...","ar":"Koota هو حل لإدارة الحالة في الوقت الفعلي للري액ت وTypeScript، ويستخدم الكيانات مع السمات القابلة للتكوين لإدارة حالة التطبيق","en":"🌎 Performant real-time state management for React and TypeScript"},"definition":{"en":"🌎 Performant real-time state management for React and TypeScript"},"features":{"zh":["实体、特征和关系的状态管理","高性能的实时状态更新","支持 React 和 TypeScript","灵活的状态管理架构","易于使用的 API"],"ja":["エンティティ、トレイト、リレーションの状態管理","リアルタイム状態更新の高性能化","React と TypeScript のサポート","柔軟な状態管理アーキテクチャ","使いやすい API"],"ko":["엔티티, 특성 및 관계의 상태 관리","고성능의 실시간 상태 업데이트","리액트 및 타입스크립트 지원","유연한 상태 관리 아키텍처","사용하기 쉬운 API"],"es":["Gestión de estado en tiempo real","Entidades con rasgos componibles","Compatibilidad con React y TypeScript","Definición de datos mediante esquemas o callbacks","Construcción de gráficos mediante relaciones entre entidades"],"fr":["Gestion d''état en temps réel","Entités avec des traits composites","Compatibilité avec React et TypeScript","Définition de données via des schémas ou des callbacks","Construction de graphiques via des relations entre entités"],"de":["Echtzeit-State-Management","Entitäten mit komponierbaren Eigenschaften","Kompatibilität mit React und TypeScript","Datendefinition über Schemata oder Callbacks","Aufbau von Graphen über Beziehungen zwischen Entitäten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado em tempo real","Entidades com traits compostáveis","Suporte a React e TypeScript","Gestão de relacionamentos entre entidades","Arquétipos únicos para combinações de traits"],"ru":["Управление состоянием в реальном времени","Сущности с составными чертами","Поддержка React и TypeScript","Управление отношениями между сущностями","Уникальные архетипы для комбинаций черт"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة في الوقت الفعلي","الكيانات مع السمات القابلة للتكوين","دعم للري액ت وTypeScript","إدارة العلاقات بين الكيانات","النماذج الفريدة لمجموعات السمات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Koota","实时状态管理","React","TypeScript","状态管理","实体","特征","关系","高性能"],"ja":["Koota","リアルタイム状態管理","React","TypeScript","状態管理","エンティティ","トレイト","リレーション","高性能"],"ko":["Koota","실시간 상태 관리","리액트","타입스크립트","상태 관리","엔티티","특성","관계","고성능"],"es":["gestión de estado en tiempo real","React","TypeScript","entidades","rasgos componibles","state management","desarrollo de aplicaciones","rendimiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["gestion d''état en temps réel","React","TypeScript","entités","traits composites","state management","développement d''applications","performances des applications"],"de":["Echtzeit-State-Management","React","TypeScript","Entitäten","komponierbare Eigenschaften","State-Management","Anwendungsentwicklung","Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de estado","React","TypeScript","tempo real","entidades","traits","relacionamentos","arquétipos"],"ru":["управление состоянием","React","TypeScript","реальное время","сущности","черты","отношения","архетипы"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة","ري액ت","TypeScript","الوقت الفعلي","الكيانات","السمات","العلاقات","النماذج"]}},"owner":"pmndrs","repo":"koota","repoPath":"pmndrs/koota","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.666Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"koota","description":"Real-time ECS state management for TypeScript and React. Use when the user mentions koota, ECS, entities, traits, queries, or building data-oriented applications.","bodyPreview":"# Koota ECS\n\nKoota manages state using entities with composable traits.\n\n## Glossary\n\n- **Entity** - A unique identifier pointing to data defined by traits. Spawned from a world.\n- **Trait** - A reusable data definition. Can be schema-based (SoA), callback-based (AoS), or a tag.\n- **Relation** - A directional connection between entities to build graphs.\n- **World** - The context for all entities and their data (traits).\n- **Archetype** - A unique combination of traits that entities share.\n- **Qu","body":"# Koota ECS\n\nKoota manages state using entities with composable traits.\n\n## Glossary\n\n- **Entity** - A unique identifier pointing to data defined by traits. Spawned from a world.\n- **Trait** - A reusable data definition. Can be schema-based (SoA), callback-based (AoS), or a tag.\n- **Relation** - A directional connection between entities to build graphs.\n- **World** - The context for all entities and their data (traits).\n- **Archetype** - A unique combination of traits that entities share.\n- **Query** - Fetches entities matching an archetype. The primary way to batch update state.\n- **Action** - A discrete, synchronous data mutation (create, update, destroy). Reusable from any call site.\n- **System** - A reactive orchestrator that observes state changes and coordinates work, including async workflows. Runs in the frame loop or event callbacks.\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Data-oriented\n\nBehavior is separated from data. Data is defined as traits, entities compose traits, and systems mutate data on traits via queries. See [Basic usage](#basic-usage) for a complete example.\n\n### Composable systems\n\nDesign systems as small, single-purpose units rather than monolithic functions that do everything in sequence. Each system should handle one concern so that behaviors can be toggled on/off independently.\n\n```typescript\n// Good: Composable systems - each can be enabled/disabled independently\nfunction applyVelocity(world: World) {}\nfunction applyGravity(world: World) {}\nfunction applyFriction(world: World) {}\nfunction syncToDOM(world: World) {}\n\n// Bad: Monolithic system - can''t disable gravity without disabling everything\nfunction updatePhysicsAndRender(world: World) {\n  // velocity, gravity, friction, DOM sync all in one function\n}\n```\n\nThis enables feature flags, debugging (disable one system to isolate issues), and flexible runtime configurations.\n\n### Decouple view from logic\n\nSeparate core state and logic (the \"core\") from the view (\"app\"):\n\n- Run logic independent of rendering\n- Swap views while keeping state (2D ↔ 3D)\n- Run logic in a worker or on a server\n\n### Prefer traits + actions over classes\n\nPrefer not to use classes to encapsulate data and behavior. Use traits for data and actions for behavior. Only use classes when required by external libraries (e.g., THREE.js objects) or the user prefers it.\n\n## Directory structure\n\nIf the user has a preferred structure, follow it. Otherwise, use this guidance: the directory structure should mirror how the app''s data model is organized. Separate core state/logic from the view layer:\n\n- **Core** - Pure TypeScript. Traits, systems, actions, world. No view imports.\n- **View** - Reads from world, mutates via actions. Organized by domain/feature.\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── core/              # Pure TypeScript, no view imports\n│   ├── traits/\n│   ├── systems/\n│   ├── actions/\n│   └── world.ts\n└── features/          # View layer, organized by domain\n```\n\nFiles are organized by role, not by feature slice. Traits and systems are composable and don''t map cleanly to features.\n\nFor detailed patterns and monorepo structures, see [references/architecture.md](references/architecture.md).\n\n## Trait types\n\n| Type               | Syntax                     | Use when                  | Examples                         |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **SoA (Schema)**   | `trait({ x: 0 })`          | Simple primitive data     | `Position`, `Velocity`, `Health` |\n| **AoS (Callback)** | `trait(() => new Thing())` | Complex objects/instances | `Ref` (DOM), `Keyboard` (Set)    |\n| **Tag**            | `trait()`                  | No data, just a flag      | `IsPlayer`, `IsEnemy`, `IsDead`  |\n\n## Trait naming conventions\n\n| Type          | Pattern         | Examples                         |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Tags**      | Start with `Is` | `IsPlayer`, `IsEnemy`, `IsDead`  |\n| **Relations** | Prepositional   | `ChildOf`, `HeldBy`, `Contains`  |\n| **Trait**     | Noun            | `Position`, `Velocity`, `Health` |\n\n## Relations\n\nRelations build graphs between entities such as hierarchies, inventories, targeting.\n\n```typescript\nimport { relation } from ''koota''\n\nconst ChildOf = relation({ autoDestroy: ''orphan'' }) // Hierarchy\nconst Contains = relation({ store: { amount: 0 } }) // With data\nconst Targeting = relation({ exclusive: true }) // One target only\n\n// Build graph\nconst parent = world.spawn()\nconst child = world.spawn(ChildOf(parent))\n\n// Query children of parent\nconst children = world.query(ChildOf(parent))\n\n// Query all entities with any ChildOf relation\nconst allChildren = world.query(ChildOf(''*''))\n\n// Get targets from entity\nconst items = entity.targetsFor(Contains) // Entity[]\nconst target = entity.targetFor(Targeting) // Entity | undefined\n```\n\nFor detailed patterns, traversal, ordered relations, and anti-patterns, see [references/relations.md](references/relations.md).\n\n## Basic usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { trait, createWorld } from ''koota''\n\n// 1. Define traits\nconst Position = trait({ x: 0, y: 0 })\nconst Velocity = trait({ x: 0, y: 0 })\nconst IsPlayer = trait()\n\n// 2. Create world and spawn entities\nconst world = createWorld()\nconst player = world.spawn(Position({ x: 100, y: 50 }), Velocity, IsPlayer)\n\n// 3. Query and update\nworld.query(Position, Velocity).updateEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  pos.x += vel.x\n  pos.y += vel.y\n})\n```\n\n## Entities\n\nEntities are unique identifiers that compose traits. Spawned from a world.\n\n```typescript\n// Spawn\nconst entity = world.spawn(Position, Velocity)\n\n// Read/write traits\nentity.get(Position) // Read trait data\nentity.set(Position, { x: 10 }) // Write (triggers change events)\nentity.add(IsPlayer) // Add trait\nentity.remove(Velocity) // Remove trait\nentity.has(Position) // Check if has trait\n\n// Destroy\nentity.destroy()\n```\n\n**Entity IDs**\n\nAn entity is internally a number packed with entity ID, generation ID (for recycling), and world ID. Safe to store directly for persistence or networking.\n\n```typescript\nentity.id() // Just the entity ID (reused after destroy)\nentity // Full packed number (unique forever)\n```\n\n**Typing**\n\nUse `TraitRecord` to get the type that `entity.get()` returns\n\n```typescript\ntype PositionRecord = TraitRecord<typeof Position>\n```\n\n## Queries\n\nQueries fetch entities matching an archetype and are the primary way to batch update state.\n\n```typescript\n// Query and update\nworld.query(Position, Velocity).updateEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  pos.x += vel.x\n  pos.y += vel.y\n})\n\n// Read-only iteration (no write-back)\nconst data: Array<{ x: number; y: number }> = []\nworld.query(Position, Velocity).readEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  data.push({ x: pos.x, y: pos.y })\n})\n\n// Get first match\nconst player = world.queryFirst(IsPlayer, Position)\n\n// Filter with modifiers\nworld.query(Position, Not(Velocity)) // Has Position but not Velocity\nworld.query(Or(IsPlayer, IsEnemy)) // Has either trait\n```\n\n**Note:** `updateEach`/`readEach` only return data-bearing traits (SoA/AoS). Tags, `Not()`, and relation filters are **excluded**:\n\n```typescript\nworld.query(IsPlayer, Position, Velocity).updateEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  // Array has 2 elements - IsPlayer (tag) excluded\n})\n```\n\nFor tracking changes, caching queries, and advanced patterns, see [references/queries.md](references/queries.md).\n\n## React integration\n\n**Imports:** Core types (`World`, `Entity`) from `''koota''`. React hooks from `''koota/react''`.\n\n**Change detection:** `entity.set()` and `world.set()` trigger change events that cause hooks like `useTrait` to rerender. For AoS traits where you mutate objects directly, manually signal with `entity.changed(Trait)`.\n\nFor React hooks and actions, see [references/react-hooks.md](references/react-hooks.md).\n\nFor component patterns (App, Startup, Renderer, view sync, input), see [references/react-patterns.md](references/react-patterns.md).\n\n## Runtime\n\nSystems query the world and update entities. Run them via frameloop (continuous) or event handlers (discrete).\n\nFor systems, frameloop, event-driven patterns, and time management, see [references/runtime.md](references/runtime.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:01.330Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced state management capabilities in React and TypeScript","zh":"非常适合需要在React和TypeScript中使用高级状态管理功能的前端代理","ja":"ReactとTypeScriptで高度なステート管理機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"React와 TypeScript에서 고급 상태 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de gestión de estado avanzadas en React y TypeScript","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de gestion d''état avancées dans React et TypeScript","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Zustandsverwaltungsfunktionen in React und TypeScript benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de estado em React e TypeScript","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности управления состоянием в React и TypeScript","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الحالة في React وTypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state using entities with composable traits, allowing for efficient and performant real-time state management in React and TypeScript applications, leveraging libraries like React Query and TypeScript type checking","zh":"赋予代理管理状态的能力，使用具有可组合特征的实体，允许在React和TypeScript应用程序中高效且高性能地管理实时状态，利用像React Query和TypeScript类型检查这样的库","ja":"エージェントにステートを管理する能力を与え、合成可能な特性を持つエンティティを使用して、ReactとTypeScriptアプリケーションで効率的かつパフォーマンスの高いリアルタイムステート管理を可能にし、React QueryやTypeScriptの型チェックなどのライブラリを利用","ko":"에이전트에게 상태를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 조합 가능한 특성을 가진 엔티티를 사용하여 React와 TypeScript 애플리케이션에서 효율적이고 성능이 좋은 실시간 상태 관리를 가능하게 하며 React Query와 TypeScript 타입 체크 같은 라이브러리를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado utilizando entidades con rasgos componibles, lo que permite una gestión de estado en tiempo real eficiente y de alto rendimiento en aplicaciones React y TypeScript, aprovechando bibliotecas como React Query y verificación de tipos TypeScript","fr":"Autorise les agents à gérer l''état en utilisant des entités avec des traits composable, permettant ainsi une gestion d''état en temps réel efficace et performante dans les applications React et TypeScript, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme React Query et la vérification de types TypeScript","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Zustand mithilfe von Entitäten mit komponierbaren Eigenschaften zu verwalten, wodurch eine effiziente und leistungsstarke Echtzeit-Zustandsverwaltung in React- und TypeScript-Anwendungen ermöglicht wird, unter Ausnutzung von Bibliotheken wie React Query und TypeScript-Typüberprüfung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado usando entidades com traços compostos, permitindo um gerenciamento de estado em tempo real eficiente e performático em aplicativos React e TypeScript, aproveitando bibliotecas como React Query e verificação de tipo TypeScript","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием с помощью сущностей с составными чертами, что позволяет эффективно и производительно управлять состоянием в реальном времени в приложениях React и TypeScript, используя библиотеки như React Query и проверку типов TypeScript","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الحالة باستخدام الكيانات التي تتميز بالسمات القابلة للتأليف، مما يسمح بإدارة الحالة في الوقت الفعلي بكفاءة وعالية الأداء في تطبيقات React وTypeScript، مستفيدة من المكتبات مثل React Query ومراقبة نوع TypeScript"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing complex state graphs in React applications","Optimizing state updates for better performance in TypeScript","Debugging state-related issues in React and TypeScript applications"],"zh":["在React应用程序中管理复杂的状态图","在TypeScript中优化状态更新以提高性能","在React和TypeScript应用程序中调试与状态相关的问题"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーションで複雑なステートグラフを管理","TypeScriptでステート更新を最適化してパフォーマンスを向上","ReactとTypeScriptアプリケーションでステート関連の問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션에서 복잡한 상태 그래프를 관리","TypeScript에서 상태 업데이트를 최적화하여 성능을 개선","React와 TypeScript 애플리케이션에서 상태 관련 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Gestión de grafos de estado complejos en aplicaciones React","Optimización de actualizaciones de estado para un mejor rendimiento en TypeScript","Depuración de problemas relacionados con el estado en aplicaciones React y TypeScript"],"fr":["Gestion de graphiques d''état complexes dans les applications React","Optimisation des mises à jour d''état pour de meilleures performances dans TypeScript","Débogage des problèmes liés à l''état dans les applications React et TypeScript"],"de":["Verwaltung komplexer Zustandsgraphen in React-Anwendungen","Optimierung von Zustandsaktualisierungen für bessere Leistung in TypeScript","Fehlerbehebung von Zustandsbezogenen Problemen in React- und TypeScript-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerenciar grafos de estado complexos em aplicativos React","Otimizar atualizações de estado para melhor desempenho em TypeScript","Depurar problemas relacionados ao estado em aplicativos React e TypeScript"],"ru":["Управлять сложными графами состояния в приложениях React","Оптимизировать обновления состояния для лучшей производительности в TypeScript","Отладить проблемы, связанные с состоянием, в приложениях React и TypeScript"],"ar":["إدارة رسوم بيانية لحالة معقدة في تطبيقات React","تحسين تحديثات الحالة من أجل الأداء الأفضل في TypeScript","تصحيح الأخطاء المتعلقة بالحالة في تطبيقات React وTypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and TypeScript","Limited to React and TypeScript applications"],"zh":["需要了解React和TypeScript","仅限React和TypeScript应用程序"],"ja":["ReactとTypeScriptの知識が必要","ReactとTypeScriptアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["React와 TypeScript에 대한 지식이 필요","React와 TypeScript 애플리케이션에만 적용"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y TypeScript","Limitado a aplicaciones React y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et TypeScript","Limité aux applications React et TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und TypeScript","Begrenzt auf React- und TypeScript-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e TypeScript","Limitado a aplicativos React e TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует знания React и TypeScript","Ограничен приложениями React и TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React وTypeScript","محدود بتطبيقات React وTypeScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7d75390892021b7230b21fd3e34342996508fa1b2346bcab2a583de187a2ef09","qualityScore":37}');
